window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":901,"title":"Chapter 901 - Aiyaiyai!? What are people doing in this shop!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","-In the Wuwei Daoist Alliance-","In the conference hall, Nalan Mingxue had a thick pile of documents before her. In slim and neat writing, she had written down everything from opening the shop, the layout of the interior, and the release of games.","“You sent the seniors to act as shop clerks in Innumerable-Immortal Sea?” Mr. Fang walked in and asked, not knowing if he should cry or laugh.","“Only they can do it right now.” Nalan Mingxue handed her business plan to Fang Qi and said, “Have a look at this.”","...","In the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, many immortals gathered in the Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market at the foot of Saint Emperor Mountain.","The Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics said with a chuckle, “This spiritual artifact looks interesting. But immortal friends, what’s the level of this Nine Palace Step?”","“Don’t worry,” Gu Tingyun said, “Our shop has ‘high immortal’ in its name. Any item in this shop are no less than the items that the high immortals are willing to use!”","“Besides, for each usage, you only need to pay...” He extended five fingers and said, “One-fifth of an immortal crystal!”","“What-!?” Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics exclaimed since the lowest-level of items that the high immortals were willing to use was Xuan-level, which was great for ordinary immortal cultivators!","“Is it true that we can use it for one-fifth of an immortal crystals each time?!”","Zong Wu nodded and said, “With one immortal crystal, you can buy five immortal tokens in the shop. With each immortal token, you can use this BBK Learning Machine for one session.”","The tall and thin man said, “Then, get me five immortal tokens.”","He stepped onto the Nine Palace Platform and turned on the spiritual artifact. As he looked at the screen, rhythmic music sounded from the spiritual artifact, but... this immortal cultivator looked a bit confused.","“Wait until the prelude of the music finishes,” Zong Wu explained, “Follow the beats and step on the corresponding square. Just imagine that you’re dodging your enemy’s attacks with this movement technique.","“Clank!” The tall and thin immortal cultivator stomped on the pad with great aggression.","The whole shop shook.","The expressions of all the people in the shop turned dark.","Due to the forcefulness of the first step, he had no time to do the second step, which led to the missing of several subsequent steps.","“Go lightly. This movement technique requires agile and ethereal steps as if you’re walking on the clouds,” Zong Wu said in a hurry, “The accuracy of the steps will affect your score and ranking; it will determine if you can unlock higher-level movement techniques. It’s not easy to dance well.”","“It has such wondrous uses?!” Everyone watched the tall and thin cultivator attentively and didn’t notice Zong Wu’s mistake in his wording.","“This spiritual artifact can not only train our steps but show us the right step style and rhythm as well?!”","Soon, the cultivator corrected his mistake and danced on the spiritual artifact nimbly.","“Gongzi...” Standing before the dance machine, the servant-looking young man beside the white-robed young master rubbed his hands, eager to try.","“What BBK Learning Machine!?” The white-robed young master smirked and said in disdain, “The prehistoric immortal movement techniques that I learned at the Dao-Hearing Pavilion are all profound and complex. How can you be so useless!?”","“You’re right, Young Master...”","“But... this artifact is interesting.” The white-robed young master said, “Let’s watch it for a while.”","As he watched calmly, the cultivator on the machine suddenly became profound and mysterious as he moved his feet, following the arrows on the screen...","The ethereal figure had blurry shadows around him. Moving with the beats, the tall and thin immortal cultivator yelled in astonishment, “This... it seems to be even better than the ordinary Xuan-level immortal movement techniques... I feel like I’m walking on the clouds-!”","Not daring to make a mistake, he stared at the falling arrows on the screen intently as his upper body swayed as if he was dodging an enemy’s attacks while his feet created clapping sounds on the platform.","With each step he took, the arrow on the screen shattered and turned into crisp and melodious music notes. When the steps were done perfectly, bright neon lights lit up. As his steps moved more and more accurately, the arrows on the screen fell even faster until his feet turned blurry.","It looked as if countless feet were moving on the platform while his body split into three and then nine shadows. At last, everyone saw nine exact same people dancing on the Nine Palace Array!","“This...?!” The white-robed young master stared at the scene dumbfoundedly and yelled in surprise, “Doppelgangers and instant teleportation!? This movement technique... is not only useful but elegant and dashing. Like a drunken immortal walking in the clouds, each step looks casual but extremely wondrous.","“This movement technique... is awesome! It’s more than a Xuan-level immortal movement technique. This...”","He looked at Zong Wu and others with an intense stare. “What’s the name of this movement technique?”","“It’s... um...” the latter exchanged a look. Finally, Gu Tingyu said, “Nine Palace Moon-Watching Step!”","“What a great Nine Palace Moon-Watching Step!” The white-robed young master said, “I, Yao Ji, will try the Nine Palace Moon-Watching Step today!”","He took out a pale golden immortal jade casually and tossed it onto the desk. “I’m in a good mood today. See how many tokens it can trade and bring them to me.”","Gu Tingyun picked up the immortal jade and examined it. “It’s worth at least 600 immortal crystals. You can get a membership card in our shop and deposit the immortal tokens on it, saving you the trouble of taking so many immortal tokens with you.”","“Do it! Do it! Bring me some immortal tokens.” Eagerly, Yao Ji stepped onto another Nine Palace Platform. “By the way, you said... we can unlock new movement techniques?”","Gu Tingyun nodded and said, “Of course. If you can use this movement technique perfectly, you can unlock a new movement technique. This shop is the High Immortal Arcade Game Hall. The shop only has rare and high-quality items, fitting for the enjoyment of high immortals.”","Reassured, Yao Ji inserted one token. As the music sounded, he cast a contemptuous glance at the tall and thin cultivator beside him.","“You’re a mere middle-level immortal; I’ll demonstrate the essence of this movement technique to you.” Standing on the Nine Palace Platform, Yao Ji swayed with the music, looking like a drunken immortal walking on the clouds.","As the arrows fell on the screen like dancing elves, his steps moved rhythmically.","“Young Master is indeed awesome!” The young servant exclaimed immediately.","The tall and thin cultivator glanced at Yao Ji as if he was surprised that the latter could move so smoothly and elegantly as a beginner.","“Humph! I, Xue Mang, might have less talent than you, but I won’t admit defeat to you on the Nine Palace Platform!” On the other side, that member of the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics yelled.","People felt as if each step that the tall and thin man took had touched a string in their hearts. His body swayed with the steps like a dancing butterfly.","They competed with each other and made bright blurry shadows on the platform as they followed the instructions on the screens.","“I can feel the rhythm of life in these steps. With the music rhythm and the flashing lights, they seem to pour youthful passion into souls...” The young servant below the platform watched the two immortals dance as if he was watching an excellent battle of spiritual spells!","“I seem to feel like an emotion is going to erupt from the bottom of my heart. It feels as if my blood is burning!” In this atmosphere, the other two members of Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics looked enthusiastic as well.","At this moment, some passing immortal cultivators outside the shop heard a strange song coming from the shop, “Aiyaiyai! Let’s do it together... Aiyaiyai...Aiyaiyai.”","[TL Note: This is the song named Awaken by Taku Iwasaki, a japanese singer. It is used in JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure, an anime.]","They poked their heads into the shop curiously and saw two figures jumping and dancing. “What are they doing in the shop!?”"]},{"number":902,"title":"Chapter 902 - One Step to Heaven Test!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, the places where most of the immortal cultivators gathered were not as crowded as the big cities in the mortal world, in which the common residential areas were full of noises while carriages thronged in the rich communities...","However, the block outside the shop was the marketplace where immortal cultivators from different places traded with the eight major ancient immortal families. After years of development, it had become busy and prosperous.","Turning to the left from the street outside the shop, one would reach the main street of the whole immortal market.","The streets that could accommodate two horse-drawn carriages side by side weren’t very wide, but since no riding was allowed on the streets except for the main street, the pedestrians had enough space to walk around.","Walking on the street outside the shop, passersbys could easily hear the sounds blasting from the machine.","“What’s this...?”","“Aren’t they the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics?!”","“That young master looks like...!?”","At the beginning, there were only a few people standing at the door. About eight minutes later, more than ten people gathered at the door.","“What are they doing?” A young man dressed in a black leather robe pushed through the crowd and looked in curiously.","“No idea...” A brawny guy beside him craned his neck to look inside. “I listened to them for a while. It seems like someone is singing in that spiritual artifact, and then the two people began to jump on it.”","“Jump on it?!” The young man dressed in the black leather robe studied them and then said gravely, “If I’m right, they are practicing some kind of movement technique; it’s an immortal-grade movement technique at least on the Xuan-level!”","“Movement technique?!” People exclaimed behind them.","“Of course.” The young man dressed in the black leather robe pointed at the two people on the dance machines and said, “Look at the white-robed young master. When he uses the movement technique perfectly, his movements are unpredictable, right?”","“That’s true...” the brawny guy exclaimed.","“Pay attention to the rhythm that they followed when moving with each step; isn’t this strange, elegant, and rhythmic movement very enjoyable to watch?”","“Right! Right! Right! I have the same feeling!” A young man who was wearing warrior’s clothes with an iron chain and silver loops hanging on his shirt looked very eye-catching in the crowd. “But what’s so special about it?”","“If my guess is right, this is the legendary Dao Rhythm.” The young man dressed in the black leather robe explained, “Just like the miracles of creation such as the Heaven, Earth, mountains, and rivers, the super-powerful spiritual spells are in harmony with the Great Dao when they correspond with the mystery of creation. Look, each step they take is as mysterious as the transformation of stars. If you don’t watch carefully, you’ll feel like they turned into several figures.”","“Indeed... you’re right!” The young man wearing warrior clothes clapped his hands and said appreciatively.","“Can you explain the song which keeps saying ‘Aiyaiyai’?” The man beside him asked.","“Um...” At this moment, the young man dressed in the black leather robe also looked puzzled. “It’s a puzzle to me, Immortal Qiu, as well.”","He thought for a long while and said, “According to my analysis, this is probably a special pithy formula for the movement technique?”","“Well said!” At this moment, Yao Ji got off the dance machine and said with bright glints in his eyes, “I’ve been thinking about what these words mean. Your conversation inspired me.”","“Are they really pithy formulas?” the others said in surprise, “But... they don’t sound like pithy formulas at all!”","“How can you say that!?” Yao Ji had danced for a long time on the dance machine by now. “Watch!”","Then, he chanted lightly, “Aiyaiyai! Aiyaiyai!”","His feet moved with the rhythm as he jumped and shifted around in patterns as his mind recalled the arrows on the screen as a reflex.","Next, the viewers felt dizzy as they watched Yao Ji turn into three shadows in front of them!","Under their astonished gazes, Yao Ji explained, “To tell you the truth, when I chanted the pithy formula, my mind summoned these steps subconsciously. They are undoubtedly pithy formulas!”","“Does it mean that this movement technique is at least on the Xuan-level ?!” The tall and brawny guy said, “How long have you been in the shop? You’ve achieved such effects in a short time?!”","At this moment, an amiable old man walked up and said with a smile, “Would you guys like to try it? This young master used our shop’s newest product, the Learning Machine.”","“These learning machines can instruct the users to learn an exquisite movement technique. Today is the shop’s grand opening, and we are offering five immortal tokens for one immortal crystal. With one immortal token, you can have one session with this spiritual artifact and learn the profound and complex movement technique.”","“Didn’t you say that we can also unlock new content when certain conditions are met?” At this moment, Yao Ji asked his question.","“Of course.” Gu Tingyun pointed at the screen and explained, “When the arrows fall, if your steps barely match the timing, rhythm, and beats, the pads will flash with silver lights. If your steps match them perfectly, the pad will flash with purple lights!”","“When a set of movement technique is completed, you’ll enter the ranking stage.” At this moment, a list of scores showed on the screen. “This is the rank and the basic conditions for advancing.”","“Of course, we have more than one basic movement technique. You can change to any movement technique you like and even compete with others!”","“Can... we do all these things?!” Yao Ji’s eyes turned sharp as he stared at the tall and thin man beside him and said, “You! We broke even just now; let’s have a competition on the spiritual artifacts!”","“Good! I didn’t do my best yet.” The tall and thin man of the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics said, “The clothes that you wear show that you come from a big family, but I didn’t lose to you!”","“Come on-!”","Music continued to float out of the shop and then wild laughter erupted, “Haha! My movement technique is better than yours! Anyone else wants to compete with me!?”","“I’ll do it!” The young man wearing warrior clothes yelled and leaped onto a dance machine.","When the music sounded, the two people moved without stopping as if they had two electrical motors on their feet.","The competitions continued until the sky turned dark.","“That’s it! That’s it!” Heavy panting sounds came from the shop.","Yao Ji stood alone on the Nine Palace Platform proudly as lights of all colors, red, orange, yellow, green, indigo, blue, and purple flashed over his head; the others all looked at him in horror.","“He actually...”","“He unlocked the new movement technique so soon!?”","“My goodness! He’s amazing!”","But soon, an exclamation sounded, “No! Young Master, you have the One Step to Heaven Test today in the academy!”","“Didn’t I have a test a couple of days ago?!” Yao Ji said angrily, “How come I have another test today?!”","“Don’t ask! Hurry up! This is the One Step to Heaven Test held by the elder in person. Hurry, or you’ll be late!”","..."]},{"number":903,"title":"Chapter 903 - I, Yao Ji, Can’t Pass the Movement Technique Test?! Watch Me...","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, at the Dao-Hearing Pavilion in the Gui Family.","The Gui Family had always valued education and etiquette. Among all the major families, the Dao-Hearing Pavilion had the best learning atmosphere, and even other major families would send some of their members to this place after they reached adulthood for study and experience.","At this moment, elite disciples from different families stood in rows with great solemnity outside the Dao-Hearing Pavilion.","Outside the pavilion was a wide martial arts field. At this moment, three grand-looking coaches dressed in pale blue robes stood on it with their hands clasped behind their backs. An elder wearing a teal robe stood on the high platform and looked down on the disciples who didn’t even dare to breathe heavily.","“Next up, Yao Ji!”","“Yao Ji!?”","“Yao Ji?!”","After three calls, there still wasn’t anyone who answered. At this moment, the three coaches’ faces darkened.","Standing beside the three coaches was a cold-faced young man who moved with the elegance and dignity of a member of a big family; he walked down the platform slowly.","Obviously, he had just finished the test. His arrogant look showed that he had got a good mark.","Turning to the three coaches, he bowed and said, “In my opinion, since this person isn’t here, you don’t have to test him, coaches.”","“Huh?” One of the coaches asked in puzzlement, “Gui Nian, what do you mean?”","The young man with the family name of Gui said with a faint smile, “Coaches, Yao Ji has always been lazy in the academy and is a good-for-nothing. It’s said... that this guy has only a poor human-immortal physique. I think it doesn’t matter if you test him or not.”","“He’s right.” At this moment, another person walked up and said, “Coaches, this guy didn’t even attend the One Step to Heaven Test held by the elders. Furthermore, he has been disrespectful to elders in private just because he comes from a major immortal family. Most importantly, he has only managed to master the most basic movement technique, the Seven-Illusion Spirit Body.”","“The Dao-Hearing Pavilion has a good learning atmosphere and is a holy place for learning Dao that is recognized by all families. We come here to cultivate with concentration, but this guy has a very bad influence on this place!” Another person stood out and said, “Today, he is so arrogant that he is absent from the test personally held by the elders. Next time, I guess he won’t come even at the elders’ invitation! I hope the elders will severely punish him; it would be best if you can expel him, so we will have peace back in this immortal cultivation pavilion!”","“Yes! Expel him so that we can have a peaceful environment!”","“Elder, Yao Ji is indeed arrogant,” Gui Nian said in a low voice, “If...”","“Wait!” At this moment, a white-robed young master walked out of the crowd with a young servant and stepped to the center of the field.","With a sharp gaze, he stepped forward with a strange rhythm as his robe flapped around him even though there was no wind.","“This is...!? Yao Ji!?”","“Yao Ji! You dare to come here?!” Gui Nian of the Gui Family stared at him coldly.","“Why not?!” Yao Ji stared back at him.","“Don’t you know what our test is today?!” Gui Nian stared at him arrogantly as if he was looking down on a good-for-nothing scum.","“Of course. The so-called One Step to Heaven is a test of movement techniques and battle steps.”","“And you dare to show up here?” Gui Nian said with a sneer, “You showed disrespect to the elders. If I were you, I would not humiliate myself in front of others since you’ll fail anyway.”","People laughed when they heard his words.","Gui Nian bowed and said, “It isn’t slander. This guy has failed all the tests in previous years!”","“Just because I failed in previous years doesn’t mean that I will fail this year,” Yao Ji said in a loud voice, “How do you know that I will fail this year?! You bully me just because this place belongs to your Gui Family, but today, I won’t let you do it!”","“Oh?” At this moment, the elder standing on the high platform squinted his eyes. “Have you obtain a breakthrough this year?”","“Yes!” Yao Ji said immediately, “I’m late because I spent the whole day on understanding a wondrous movement technique.”","“Oh...?”","The elder waved his hand and said with interest, “Let him have a try.”","He pointed at one of the coaches and said, “Coach Wang, you test him.”","Seeing that the elder agreed to test Yao Ji, Gui Nian said resentfully, “I’ll see what moves you have!”","Then, the solemn coach with a wide forehead and a square face walked over. “One Step to Heaven Test. To pass the first test, you must dodge ten attacks from me. Are you ready?”","At this moment, Yao Ji lightly stood on his toes and hummed some strange sounds as fierce battle intent burned in his eyes. “I’m ready!”","“Watch carefully! This is the Void Spiritual Sword Technique of the mid-tier Xuan-level!” Coach Wang pointed two fingers forward, and a spiritual light shot out like a lightning bolt!","At this moment, Yao Ji hummed the miraculous ‘pithy formula’. As the prelude of the ‘pithy formula’ was completed, his whole body moved!","The ethereal sword energy shot toward the direction in which Yao Ji moved like a light beam.","But Yao Ji’s body swayed with his steps slightly as if he was walking on the clouds!","The sword energy missed him! He was intact!","Then, the sword energy moved unpredictably like a heavenly shadow.","But at this moment, everyone heard the strange sounds.","“Aiyaiyai! Aiyaiyai~”","Next, everyone saw Yao Ji moving with a strange rhythm as if each step he took was on a perfect spot. During the process, his body moved in a narrow range of a three-by-three grid.","As Yao Ji moved his feet, the coach found that regardless of how he attacked, he couldn’t predict Yao Ji’s next move. Regardless of how he changed his attacks, none of the strikes could hit the target!","“Wow-!?” Exclamations erupted around them.","“This...!? What’s happening?!”","“Watch out!” Coach Wang’s expression changed as he felt the wonders of this movement technique. “Returning Sword Technique! Top-tier Xuan-level!”","With chilly glints in his eyes, he seemed to be swiftly analyzing Yao Ji’s steps in his mind. “Left! Right! Lower leg! Shoulder!”","“Aiyaiyai! Aiyaiyai~!”","Everyone watched as the young man swayed rhythmically under the coach’s sword attacks with smooth steps, flowing like water.","“He dodged it!”","“He dodged it so narrowly!”","“How can it be?!”","At this moment, they seemed to see the youthful dance that was as passionate as boiling blood!","“This...!?” everyone exclaimed as they watched the scene on the field dumbfoundedly.","“He dodged it! He dodged them all-!”","How is this possible?!","In disbelief, they rubbed their eyes, feeling as if they were blinded by the sight!"]},{"number":904,"title":"Chapter 904 - Pazeni Sauti!? the New Movement Technique Is Activated!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I declare that Yao Ji has hereby passed this One Step to Heaven Test!”","The coach said with a smile, “Since you were late because you were understanding the movement technique, you’re forgiven this time. But what words did you just sing? Aiyaiyai?”","“Oh... that is the pithy formula of this movement technique!” Yao Ji answered immediately, “I’ve just learned this technique and have to chant the pithy formula to use it, which is why I chanted the words during the test.”","There is such a strange pithy formula? The coaches pondered.","“Okay, it’s late and we need to test other disciples. You can go now.”","The viewers watched as Yao Ji passed the test with his weird movement technique!","He didn’t only pass; he was only one step away from reaching the excellent rank.","It must be noted that Yao Ji, a good-for-nothing playboy who knew nothing but playing and eating good food, had seldomly passed tests!","But in front of everyone and under the supervision of the elder, he couldn’t have cheated.","How did he pass it?!","“Gongzi Yao!”","“Brother Yao!”","“Brother Yao, teach me!” When Yao Ji walked down from the field, several familiar figures walked up to him. In the Dao-Hearing Pavilion, they were the members of the four families who almost failed each test they took. Other than for Yao Ji, the other three were Yun Qing from the Yun Family, Ying Bei from the Ying Family, and Ji Changtian from the Ji Family. But today, they were astonished to see that Yao Ji suddenly revealed a movement technique that helped him pass the test and almost reached a good mark.","“How did you pass it?!” The first one who was walking up was a young master with triangle-shaped eyes. “Did you really go and learn a movement technique today!?”","“Impossible!” another young master said, “You played with us in the Thousand-Lantern Night Market yesterday. How could you master a movement technique in one short day?!”","“If you were so good, we wouldn’t have been subjected to disdain from Gui Nian and the others!”","“Of course, I’m not so good...” He beckoned at the others, telling them to lean toward him. “I found a great place in the Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market today!”","“What great place?!” The others’ interests were instantly piqued.","These playboys hated studying and were disrespectful to the academy, but none of them wanted to be regarded with contempt everyday.","Outside the academy, few people dared to slight them. But in this place full of ultimate geniuses from the eight major immortal families, it was the unspoken rule that the talented and powerful ones could lord over the others.","They had no place to complain when they were bullied.","“Have you guys heard of the Arcade Game Hall!?” Yao Ji asked in a low voice.","They walked out as they talked. The One Step to Heaven Test still had rankings to announce later, but Yao Ji wasn’t interested in participating in it. As a complete playboy, he wouldn’t lower himself to join this activity!","It was more important to go to the Arcade Game Hall and unlock new movement techniques.","Otherwise, his place on the learning machine would be overtaken by others!","It must be noted that until he left, he had been ranked No.1 on that learning machine in the Arcade Game Hall. No one had been able to overtake him!","“Arcade Game Hall!? What Arcade Game Hall?!” The others were puzzled.","“It’s on the Bright Lantern Street in Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market,” Yao Ji hummed the song and did a few dancing steps with strong rhythm. “Just like this. You’ll know later!”","“Huh-!?” They looked at Yao Ji and exchanged a look with each other, but they indeed felt a strange sense of rhythm and elegance in his moves.","They felt a very strong sense of dynamics.","Yes, dynamics! This movement technique was totally different from all the movement techniques that they had learned before!","They were wondering what kind of movement techniques could create such a sense of dynamics.","Soon, they followed Yao Ji into the newly opened High Immortal Arcade Game Hall in the Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market.","It was night, but the streets in the market were bright with lights and as lively as the day. With lights up everywhere, the place looked more prosperous than the daytime.","“High Immortal Arcade Game Hall!?” They looked up and saw this shop. Different from other shops, this shop had a sign with flashing immortal spiritual lights of all colors including red, green, and yellow, flashing under the night sky. The lights lent a dreamy feeling to the sign.","The door was open, and the entrance was covered by curtains that were as transparent as waterfalls. The fabric looked like glass but was soft to the touch and wouldn’t shatter as easily as glass.","“Wow-! There’s such a place?!” Walking into the shop after Yao Ji, Yun Qing, Ying Bei, and Ji Changtian looked around in amazement, feeling curious about each detail.","The shop wasn’t big but was brightly lit. The most eye-catching was the row of spiritual artifacts in the depths of the shop. A group of people were practicing all kinds of wondrous movement techniques on the platforms with three-by-three grids. They jumped on the platform accompanied by all kinds of music. When they did a perfect step, dazzling colorful lights would shine overhead!","“My goodness...” Yun Qing inhaled deeply and said, “These people look awesome-!”","“They are awesome?” Yao Ji said contemptuously, “They are doing the lowest level movement techniques in the shop. I, Young Master Yao, have activated the movement techniques of the second stage today!”","“I’ll show them to you later.”","“There are even better techniques?!” They looked at him as if he was a god.","“Young Master Yao, when did you become so awesome!?”","“But...” Ji Changtian glanced around and saw that all the spiritual artifacts were taken by people to practice movement techniques, and many others stood around them watching. He said, “Young Master Yao, there are no spots for us.”","“That’s easy.” Yao Ji walked toward the crowd.","“Huh?! Isn’t he the No. 1 on the Fire Power List?!” Someone immediately exclaimed in recognition. At this moment, one person just finished a session and received a score. Then, an eye-catching purple name appeared at the top of the list on the screen. [Grand Young Master Ji!]","“That’s him!” someone yelled in surprise, “Grand Young Master Ji! It’s said that he has activated the movement techniques of the second stage!”","“Do you want to see the movement techniques of the second stage?!” Hearing the exclamations, Yao Ji asked in a loud voice, “Who can lend me the spot? I’ll give him five immortal crystals!”","“Take mine!”","“Come here!”","Soon, a group of people gathered around him. The people dancing on the dance machines also stopped involuntarily and looked over in surprise. “Someone has activated the movement techniques of the second stage so soon!?”","“Let’s see what the movement techniques in the second stage look like!”","At this moment, Yao Ji stepped onto a dance machine, and his face looked proud under the light as he glanced around.","“Ahh-!” Screams sounded. People like, Yun Qing, Ying Bei, and Ji Changtian couldn’t help but join the screams.","Dong-ci-da-ci-dong-ci-da-ci. Yao Ji moved his feet casually on the Nine Palace Platform as if he was getting ready for the use of the movement techniques.","On the screen, the step directions looked different this time. Cubes floated upward, giving an even better visual experience. Meanwhile, a small 3-D figure demonstrated the steps on the screen.","When the music sounded, Yao Ji moved as if he was driven by some force. His feet slid on the dance machine as if he was a ghost, and his body swayed left and right. It was an extremely weird scene to the viewers!","“My Goodness!”","“This movement technique...!? The moves are as capricious as ghosts!”","Yao Ji chanted the pithy formula as he moved.","“Viumbe vyote vya mungu wetu na mfalme wetu.”","“Pazeni sauti ili nasi mwimbe...”","[TL Note: These are the lyrics to the song named Seve by Tez Cadey, a French music producer from Paris. In Chinese, these two lines sound funny. The first translation of the pronunciation in Chinese is ‘the small turtles on the left have big stomachs. Sa Beining is killing chicken, and Lily come here to wash your stomach.’ Sa Beining is a famous TV host in China]","Everyone wondered. Are these words...the new pithy formula!!??."]},{"number":905,"title":"Chapter 905 - Today, I’ll Wake You up with Beating!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I feel like... I can’t see where he is!”","“Did he just grow hundreds of legs?!” People like Yun Qing, Ying Bei, and Ji Changtian hugged their heads and screamed.","“What movement technique is this?! Why didn’t Young Master Yao use this movement technique in the One Step to Heaven Test!?”","“Pazeni sauti! This pithy formula sounds more aggressive!” Yun Qing asked in a loud voice, “Young Master Yao, what movement technique is this?! Can we learn it?!”","Standing below, they stared at the figure on the screen intently as they imitated the steps. But regardless of how hard they tried, they couldn’t find that elegant feeling. Sweat popped out on their foreheads due to frustration.","“Little guys.” At this moment, the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics said smugly, “You are a long way from this stage! You must start with the most basic movement technique!”","The tall and thin man of the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics demonstrated some moves in front of them spontaneously; his blurry sways and moves drew another wave of exclamations.","“Let’s go and find spots to try it! Hurry up while they are all watching Young Master Yao!”","Soon, they each bought a big handful of immortal tokens. After inserting one into the artifact, they began to dance...","...","It was the early morning of the next day.","Since the old man in the shop claimed that he had to do maintenance on the spiritual artifacts for about two hours, the players walked out reluctantly.","It was very late, but at least ten people walked out with them.","“Brother Yao.” Young Master Yun Qing, who had triangle-shaped eyes and a thin figure, said eagerly the moment that they walked out of the shop, “I think that I’ve mastered the Nine Hall Moon-Watching Step!”","“You can’t say that you’ve mastered it when you can only use it smoothly on the learning machine.” Yao Ji, an experienced player, said, “You can try it now that you’re off the spiritual artifact.”","As they talked, they came to the wide main street of the Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market. Recalling the prelude of the music, Yun Qing moved his feet.","“I can do this part!” Yun Qing’s eyes lit up. But as he spoke, he was distracted, making the subsequent steps fumble after a while.","He stopped immediately.","“Young Master Yun, some of your steps were wrong,” Ji Changtian said and demonstrated the steps on the side of the street. His jumps and moves looked more proficient than Yun Qing’s.","“No. No. Your steps are not elegant and light enough.” Ying Bei dressed in a black scholarly robe said immediately, “Watch how I use this movement technique.”","The Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics also came out of the shop at this moment. Seeing this sight, they were eager to compete, so they walked up and said, “You’re elegant but not agile.”","Their feet moved nimbly with shifty shadows. Soon, the passing immortal cultivators began to watch them dance on the side of the street in Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market...","“These people?! Watch these people...!?”","These people moved as if they were walking on the clouds or riding on winds. Their steps were as unpredictable as winds and clouds which moved without a pattern.","The one in the foremost of the group was dressed in a snow-white robe. He moved his feet so fast that they became just a blur. He created many vague shadows that looked like ghosts walking out during the night.","Stunned by the sight, more and more immortals stopped to watch. This upheaval even alerted some grand immortal cultivators living in the market as hermits.","“Come and watch!”","These people are moving like demons!","At this moment, they seemed to realize that many people were watching them and stopped cleanly.","They left without leaving a trace behind.","...","Some people stood there long after they were gone. “Do you know... who were those people? Why did I feel so thrilled by merely watching their movement techniques...?”","“Will they return...?”","A female ambassador with blonde hair and green eyes from the Gods’ Palace said to the people around her, “Oh! Your Innumerable-Immortal Sea is full of talented people! They are so young, so talented, and so...”","Her accent was awkward, and her limited vocabulary wasn’t enough to express her feelings.","“Can anyone tell me their names?”","Another ambassador said, “If Lord Valkyrie was here, I’m sure that she would like it very much. I hope we can bring these movement techniques and casting methods back to our homeland!”","...","By now, Yao Ji and the others had returned to the Dao-Hearing Pavilion on Saint Emperor Mountain.","“Brother Yao,” the others said in surprise, “Did you just use the... newest movement technique from that place, the Nine Hall Ghost Step!?”","“You recognized it?” Yao Ji walked forward with his hands clasped behind his back and said proudly.","“You know how to use it, then why didn’t you use it at the One Step to Heaven Test?!” Yun Qing asked immediately, “It would have served as a slap to Gui Nian’s arrogant face! You could even have entered the One Step to Heaven List and brought some glory to our Four Young Masters of the Saint Emperor Mountain!”","Yao Ji shook his head. “Unfortunately, I wasn’t proficient with these moves and could only use a small part of it. The coach has a sharp eye; it would achieve the opposite effects if he saw the weaknesses.”","The others said with sudden understanding, “You’re right.”","“Besides...” Yao Ji continued, “When did the four of us give a damn about the One Step to Heaven List anyway?!”","“Well said!” Hearing his words, the others perked up. “Brother Yao, you’re already No. 1 on the Fire Power List in the High Immortal Arcade Game Hall! No one can overtake you now. Why should we care for the One Step to Heaven List?! Those guys can think of nothing but stepping on the clouds or entering Heaven, and the names that they can think of are all One Step to Heaven or Sky Step... they have been the same for the past hundreds of years! How vulgar and boring!”","They sounded as if they were aloof from the world.","However, the Fire Power List was different since it gave a comprehensive score including not only the movement techniques but also the smoothness and elegance of the moves as well.","Compared with what a small shop had achieved, the Dao-Hearing Pavilion was lazy and unambitious. As members of the younger generation, they must wait many years before they could enter the battleground. Right now, graceful moves were the most important thing to them.","“Hahaha!?” In Dao-Hearing Pavilion, there were many highly talented disciples. At this moment, a furious sneer came from behind them.","“The notorious scums in Saint Emperor Mountain dare to say that they don’t care about the One Step to Heaven List?!”","“He’s... Gui Zijian, who ranks No. 76 on the One Step to Heaven List!” Exclamations came around them.","The four looked back and saw a young man dressed in a green robe that was embroidered with green clouds. He had fierce eyes and intense immortal vital presence.","His face looked heroic and extraordinary, and people could see that he was a hero-like figure with one glance. Compared with Yao Ji’s pug nose which ruined his otherwise-handsome face and Yun Qing’s ordinary looks with the triangular eyes, this man was indeed good looking.","“Since when can people boast just because they’ve barely passed the test?”","After casting a glance at him, Yao Ji ignored him and continued walking.","“Since when can a scumbag who can’t pass the test dare to ignore me?!” At this moment, Yao Ji heard the howling of wind behind him as Gui Zijian dashed up like a lightning bolt. “Today, I’ll wake you up with a beating!”"]},{"number":906,"title":"Chapter 906 - Elder Ren Kui Honors the Shop with His Visit! Zhou Yi Divination Machine with Fruit Symbols!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: Zhou Yi is known as Classic of Changes or Book of Changes, an ancient Chinese divination text and the oldest of the Chinese classics.]","“Watch out!” Subconsciously, Yao Ji felt a gust of intense murderous spirit coming at him from behind!","Without hesitation, he unleashed the movement technique that he had learned today. As his feet floated on the ground, his figure moved casually but swiftly to the side without warning.","“You... dodged it?” Gui Zijian was surprised that this ignorant playboy had dodged his sudden attack.","More puzzling was that Yao Ji just floated away like a ghost as if he didn’t have feet. After all, any dodging move would give a sign beforehand, or the flow of immortal spiritual energy would move in a certain direction, but Yao Ji showed no sign of it.","“How can it be...!?”","At this moment, two gazes turned toward them from the distant library. They were the elder who was monitoring the One Step to Heaven Test and the coach who tested Yao Ji yesterday.","Obviously, they noticed the disturbance here. In and around Dao-Hearing Pavilion, the disciples were forbidden to engage in private battles.","“Elder Ren, should I...?” The middle-aged coach dressed in a green robe said immediately, “These disciples are too unruly!”","The elder with the surname Ren shook his head and said, “Let’s watch them for a while.”","They watched as Yao Ji turned and used the movement technique in front of Gui Zijian while chanting some words.","His steps looked random and insignificant, but they enabled his body to sway rhythmically before Gui Zijian. His moves were capricious and unpredictable.","Gui Zijian stood where he was in a daze.","With blank eyes, he looked as if he couldn’t locate his target. Their styles, figures, and movements were not on the same level!","“Did you see it?” The elder with the surname Ren asked.","“Yes!” The coach beside him nodded with force as his eyes turned grim. “Gui Zijian seems to have lost the desire to attack when he saw such steps. I wonder...”","He said with sudden understanding, “Does this movement technique damage the opponent’s mind?!”","“Very likely.” The elder with the surname Ren said with a nod, “In fact, the moment that Yao Ji used this movement technique, Gui Zijian was doomed. But this movement technique doesn’t belong to any of the eight major families. I wonder where it came from.”","“This movement technique is so good?!” The coach asked in surprise.","“This movement technique is at least on the same level as the movement techniques used by the top 36 disciples on the One Step to Heaven List. Coach Wang, Gui Zijian will lose!”","Sure enough, with trembling hands, Gui Zijian watched Yao Ji and his friends leave without throwing an attack.","Yao Ji had just demonstrated a movement technique before him and subdued him without fighting!","“But... Yao Ji didn’t go out to experience the world or encounter any fortuitous events...” Coach Wang said, “Where did he learn these movement techniques?”","“The answer will come soon.” Elder Ren Kui squinted his eyes meaningfully.","Soon, a family guard came in and reported, “Elder, we found it! A new shop opened in the Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market at the foot of the mountain, named High Immortal Arcade Game Hall. The shop has a kind of spiritual artifacts that focuses on the learning of movement techniques. Young Master Yao Ji obtained his profound and complex movement techniques from that shop.”","“A small shop could teach Yao Ji, a guy without talent, these movement techniques in such a short time?”","“Interesting.” Elder Ren Kui’s eyes turned sharp. “Very interesting. Coach Wang Liang, would you like to go with me and visit this shop?”","“I also want to meet the people who are better at teaching than the coaches in our Dao-Hearing Pavilion!” Coach Wang Liang snorted and said, “Should we... go now!?”","“Since we’re at it, let’s go now!”","...","Soon, Elder Ren Kui and Coach Wang from the Dao-Hearing Pavilion found the street where the shop was located.","They pulled aside the curtain and glanced around.","“Elder, look...” Many people stood around the huge spiritual treasures as some immortal cultivators jumped on the platforms. “These must be the spiritual treasures that they use to learn the movement techniques. I’ll go up and see what’s so special about these spiritual treasures.”","Nodding, Elder Ren Kui walked up and asked about it in the crowd. He looked thoughtful. “You mean we can follow the music and learn movement techniques from the small figure on the screen?”","“Yeah!” One of the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics answered him and demonstrated some steps. “Brother, do you want to go up and try it?”","“Try it?!” Elder Ren Kui said contemptuously with a snort, “Do you think I need to learn such movement techniques?!”","“Right! Whom do you think you are talking to?!” Beside them, Coach Wang looked disdainful, thinking that these people were beneath them.","Stung, the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics retreated in slight resentment.","“This stuff is only fitting for the disciples; its useless to you, Elder,” the coach said with a sneer, “They are ignorant!”","“Guys, what can I do for you?” At this moment, Gu Tingyun walked up to them.","“Didn’t you hear us?! We need nothing!” Coach Wang gave Gu Tingyun a hard look and pointed at the crowd on the dance machines. “Do you think we are on the same level as those guys?!”","“What’s wrong with these people?!”","“Why are they behaving this way?”","“Don’t mess with them! Look at their clothes...” Sharp-eyed, the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics had guessed that these two people had high status and weren’t people who they could afford to mess with.","Standing out from the crowd, these two immediately drew people’s attention. Many people in the shop looked over.","After all, these things didn’t deserve their attention!","At this moment, Gu Tingyun said, “The two of you, our shop has other types of spiritual artifacts.”","“Huh...?” They looked over curiously.","Following the direction that Gu Tingyun pointed at, Elder Ren Kui saw several spiritual artifact platforms that were about half a man’s height. On the square screens were the images of fruits such as apple, orange, mango, and watermelon. There were other images such as bells and numbers such as [77].","“What are these?!” They asked curiously.","Gu Tingyun said, “These are... Zhou Yi Divination Machines. The square shape comes from the concept that ‘the sky is round, and the earth is square.’”","Seeing their puzzlement, Gu Tingyun explained, “You can use Zhou Yi that is provided by the shop or the divination method that you’ve learned to calculate the following step that the divination machine will take. Then, you can make a choice.”","There was a row of buttons under the screen. Each of the buttons corresponded to the images on the screen, such as the apples, oranges, or mangos.","Gu Tingyun continued to explain, “The users can buy immortal tokens to insert into the machine. If your prediction is correct, your immortal tokens will multiply. If not, the immortal tokens that you inserted will be consumed. The tokens that you earn can be changed back to immortal crystals.”","“Hahahahaha...!” The moment Gu Tingyu said that, the two started to laugh.","Gu Tingyun was baffled. “What are you laughing about?!”","Elder Ren Kui said while laughing, “We’re laughing because you are oblivious to the fact that your shop will lose all the money.”","Gu Tingyun looked at them in battlement and asked, “Why will we lose all the money?”","The two people exchanged a look. Then, Coach Wang pointed at Elder Ren Kui and said while laughing, “Don’t you know that the man standing before you is an ultimate divination master?!”"]},{"number":907,"title":"Chapter 907 - Elder, we are out of money!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Coach Wang made a gesture, asking Elder Ren Kui to take a seat.","He said with a snicker, “Shop Owner, when this gentleman gets all the results right, I hope you won’t go back on your words.”","“Of course not!” Gu Tingyun said, “The Zhou Yi Divination Machine operates and changes strictly according to the workings of Zhou Yi. If you can make a few correct calculations, you can take back the money that you spend on the tokens. You would be playing for free.”","Elder Ren Kui laughed, “Shop Owner, you are being conceited, thinking that you know a bit of divination. You must remember that there’s always someone better than you out there. Coach Wang, go and get 500-immortal-crystals worth of tokens for me.”","“Okay.” Coach Wang immediately went to buy tokens.","At this moment, Elder Ren Kui waved his hand. “I think that I’ll own your shop after making three to five correct calculations.”","Taking a box of immortal tokens from Coach Wang, Elder Ren Kui inserted them into the slot one by one. “One...two...three...”","“Okay!” After a long while, Elder Ren Kui nodded as he looked at the number of tokens shown on the screen. He said to Gu Tingyun who stood next to him, “Watch!”","From his storage spiritual artifact, Elder Ren Kui took out a strange spiritual artifact which looked like a pot but had many holes. Then, he put eight small bronze swords of different shapes into the pot.","Next, he made a series of hand gestures and chanted.","As his hand gesture changed, the holes in the spiritual artifact lit up one by one with immortal spiritual light like twinkling stars. It was a startling scene.","Whoosh! Then, sword shadows flew out from the holes with seven-colored spiritual lights. The eight small swords hovered in the air and turned into a picture of rivers, mountains, and swords as mist rose into the air.","At this moment, all the people nearby and even the crowds looking at the dance machines were drawn by the dazzling seven-colored lights.","“Hiss...! I never expected that I’d have the opportunity to watch the Elder use the Heavenly Secret Godly Divination Technique!” Coach Wang said in amazement, “This is a long-lost godly technique used to calculate the movements of the Heavenly Secrets in prehistoric times!”","“What?!” Most of the nearby people had never heard of this godly technique before. But the spiritual lights and the pureness of the immortal spiritual essence showed that this man who was using the technique had extremely high cultivation strength.","At this moment, someone exclaimed, “Is it the divination technique created by Tianji Zi, the legendary immortal from the prehistoric times?”","[TL Note: Tianji means Heavenly Secrets.]","“I’m surprised that there are people who can recognize it,” Elder Ren Kui said in satisfaction, “But I’ve only learned the basics.”","“According to the legend, anyone who learns the basics can see 30 percent of the Heavenly Secrets...” That person said immediately, “Senior, you’re too humble.”","Elder Ren Kui didn’t reply. While stroking his long beard, he calculated carefully the hexagrams in his mind and said after a long while, “From my divination, Taiyi gives birth to metal dew, and the East is auspicious. Metal... bell... that’s it!”","[TL Note: A hexagram in this context is a figure composed of six stacked horizontal lines, where each line is either Yang, or Yin. The I Ching book consists of 64 hexagrams.]","Elder Ren Kui’s eyes emitted sharp light as he slammed his hand on the bell button with force, “Bell! 500!”","In the next moment, strange bell rings sounded as a wave of white spiritual lights lit up on the screen and circulated around the screen like fireflies. The fruits on the screen flashed with all kinds of colors as immortal essence rose from them, making them look like immortal fruits. The flashing lights on the screen reflected on Elder Ren Kui’s face, giving him a celestial glow.","The people around him began to talk among themselves.","“What is this spiritual artifact; it’s so miraculous.”","“It can even use a divination technique. I wonder whose divination technique is better.”","“Of course, mine is better!” Elder Ren Kui slammed his hand on the desk and said with confidence.","The spiritual light circled on the screen again and again. Whenever it came to the bell, Elder Ren Kui thought that it was going to stop. When he was about to stand up and declare the result to the people, the spiritual light continued to circle.","After several cycles...","“Hey! Stop! Stop for me!” Elder Ren Kui gritted his teeth. “Why doesn’t it stop?!”","“Don’t worry,” Gu Tingyun said in a hurry, “It must do several cycles before it stops.”","“Tsk!” Elder Ren Kui looked impatient. “Why are you anxious?! Do you think that my divination will be wrong? You’re stalling!”","He looked contemptuous.","At this moment...","“It is slowing down!”","“It’s going to stop! It’s going to stop!”","At this moment, not only Elder Ren Kui and Coach Wang, but all the people standing behind them were intently staring at the screen and the spiritual light circling on it.","“It is stopping! It is stopping!” The spiritual light moved slower and slower until it was only three blocks away from the bell that Elder Ren Kui had chosen.","Two blocks!","One block!","“Correct!” Coach Wang yelled, “Elder, your Heavenly Secret Godly Divination Technique is unrivaled.”","He gave a thumbs-up to the chuckling Elder Ren Kui and said, “It feels lie Tianji Zi came back with full glory...”","Before he could finish, the spiritual light on the screen moved forward for one more block.","Ding!","It stopped!","“!!??”","Everyone stared at them intently as the latter looked back at them in stupefaction and then at the screen.","Elder Ren Kui almost jumped up from his seat. “What... what’s wrong?!","“Is...my divination wrong?!”","“This...???”","At this moment, the person who commented earlier said from the crowd, “Senior, all future events have traces in the current time, but they are also capricious. Your divination is very close to the correct answer, which means that the Heavenly Secret Godly Divination Technique is miraculous. I think if you do it again with careful calculation, you will surely succeed.”","At this moment, Gu Tingyun said, “If you are not sure about the result of your divination, you can choose two to three options. It will increase your rate of success.”","“What!?” Elder Ren Kui glared at him and said, “You have so little confidence in my divination?!”","Soon, he tried again. This time, he was more meticulous and more patient.","Soon, shouts sounded in the Arcane Game Hall...","“Watermelon! Watermelon! Watermelon!”","“Lemon! Lemon! Lemon!”","“Ah-! Ya!”","“What a pity! So close! Again!”","“This time, apple! Stop! Stop! Stop!”","“Hahahahaha! I’m right! See? I got it right! I won 500 tokens! A few more times of this, and this shop is mine!”","“Papaya! Papaya!”","“Oh! So close! Again!”","“Hahahaha! Got it right again!”","One night later...","“Coach Wang.” Elder Ren Kui stroked his long beard and asked, “How many times have I gotten it right?”","“Ten plus three, 13 times.”","“For each time, I won 500 to more than 1,000 tokens. Can we buy this whole shop with the proceeds?” Sitting before the Zhou Yi Divination Machine, Elder Ren Kui arranged the hem of his Daoist robe and said calmly.","“Elder... We’re...out of money!”","“Ahh-!!??”"]},{"number":908,"title":"Chapter 908 - I’ll Go and Ask My Master to Come Out!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What!?” Elder Ren Kui had spent a whole night on divination, giving people the impression that he had gotten more grey hair overnight. After coming back from being engrossed in divination, he looked at Coach Wang in puzzlement. “Didn’t you say that I’ve got 13 correct answers? How come we’re out of money?!”","We’re supposed to have won a ton of money!","“But... but...” Coach Wang said helplessly, “We lost more. Besides, we were not prepared for this and didn’t have many immortal crystals with us. Two hours ago, we used up all the immortal crystals in my storage space!”","“Why didn’t tell me sooner?” Elder Ren Kui said in fury.","“I...” Coach Wang explained in a hurry, “You looked so engrossed in your divination, and I was afraid to disturb you...”","“Is the shop’s Zhou Yi Divination Technique really so good?!” Coach Wang looked at Elder Ren Kui uneasily and asked, “Is it even better than the Heavenly Secret Godly Divination Technique?!”","Elder Ren Kui stroked his long beard and said, “This Zhou Yi Divination Technique is indeed powerful. It seems like there are grandmasters behind the shop. My master once said that, despite the great power of the eight major prehistoric families, they aren’t the best in every aspect, such as star observation, divination, and artifact creation. In Innumerable-Immortal Sea, some hermit masters are as good as or even better in some areas than the eight major families.”","“Then...” Coach Wang walked toward the entrance of the shop and looked back at the large audience that had been watching the elder do divinations. “What should we do now?!”","It was a very special time. Now that the eight major families had shouldered the responsibility of killing demons in the Lower Region in the name of doing the right thing for the world and were trying to recruit talented hermits, they couldn’t bully others at this moment.","But if they did nothing, it would show the viewers that their skills were inferior!","“It seems like... I must ask my master to show his hand!” Elder Ren Kui said meaningfully.","“Your master...!?” Coach Wang looked startled as he glanced at the distant void on one side. “You mean...!? The senior who taught you the Heavenly Secret Godly Divination Technique...?! Senior Xuanji Zi who is said to be able to decipher heavenly secrets with one word and is acclaimed as the Heaven Oracle by some immortal masters?!”","“Right!” Elder Ren Kui said great determination.","“But... I heard that Senior Xuanji Zi doesn’t even do one divination in 1,000 years. When some grand and prestigious immortals invited him to do divination for them, he gave them the excuse that he was cultivating in seclusion. Will he be interested in this thing?”","“My master refused those people because their requests of divination were too easy for him, and he had no interest in doing those divinations!”","“Indeed...?!”","...","When they were gone, bedlam broke out in the shop.","“Who was that guy?! He’s the disciple of the ‘Heaven Oracle’?!”","“Will the elusive ‘Heaven Oracle’ come to this small shop?!”","“Is the Zhou Yi Divination Machine really so miraculous!?”","Many cultivators stared at the Zhou Yi Divination Machines intently with greedy eyes. “Sir, give me a copy of Zhou Yi!”","A black-clothed immortal cultivator said loudly, “I’ll try this divination machine too!”","Gu Tingyu took out a small book named the Divination Machine Manual from the counter and handed it to him, and he said, “This is the beginner’s manual for the Zhou Yi Divination Technique. If you can understand the essence of it and reach the top level, you can do any divinations on the divination machine with success!”","“What...!?”","– Half an hour later –","A big group of people sat on the bench in the shop, each with a small blue-covered book in their hands, murmuring to themselves. Then, they began to do divinations with what they learned from the book.","Instantly, another kind of noise began to mingle with the sounds from the dance machines.","“Bell! Bell for 50 tokens!”","“Orange! I’ll put some on the orange! The hexagrams show that the next one is orange!”","“Got it! I got one!”","A large group of people stood around one divination machine, and their shouts became louder and louder.","“Sir, I’ll buy a membership card and deposit 500 immortal crystals! I’ll try the divination machine too!”","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang, in the distant mortal world, was staring at the Task List on the System Interface.","In the past two days, the task progressed at visible speed, much faster than usual!","“Hiss... what’s happening at the Innumerable-Immortal Sea?! They told me that the Arcade Game Hall had just opened!?”","Besides, the profits has to be split!","Mr. Fang only saw a part of the income that the shop earned!","...","While Fang Qi wondered about the situation, immortal music and exclamations rose outside the Arcade Game Hall in Innumerable-Immortal Sea.","People looked outside and saw a celestial figure with a white beard and white hair coming in with floating steps while being accompanied by Elder Ren Kui and Coach Wang.","The old man had an extremely high and full forehead, and vague purple light flashed on his face. While holding a bronze divination plate, he was followed by a green-eyed Kirin. With immortal lights forming a dragon image behind his head, his eyes looked so clear that it seemed like they could see through all illusions in the world.","“Master!” Elder Ren Kui bowed respectfully. “It’s in here.”","The old man nodded slightly and said, “I’ve predicted that a peer is holding a competition of divination here today. I knew that you wouldn’t be his match, so I got out of seclusion cultivation earlier.”","“Master, coming out of seclusion cultivation, has your divination skill improved again?” Elder Ren Kui asked respectfully.","The old man chuckled and said, “You just wait and see how I defeat him!”","Only about two hours had passed since they left. Gu Tingyun looked up and said, “Huh...? You two said that you were out of immortal crystals. How come you’re here again!?","“For the record, our shop is small and don’t accept credit payments!”","“Credit payment?!” Coach Wang reprimanded, “Old Man, watch your tongue! Do you think that we need to play on credit?!”","He put a storage bag on the counter. “Watch carefully! What’s this?!”","As he opened the bag, immortal spiritual essence shot out of the bag into the high sky. “This... this is...?!”","“Black Essence Immortal Crystals! One of them is equivalent to 500 immortal crystals!” Coach Wang said proudly, “Shop Owner, come on and bring us immortal tokens!”","Soon, the old man with purple light on his face sat down with a big box of immortal tokens beside him. He waves his hands and said, “I’ll begin the divination now!”","– Three days later –","After waking up from the one-night sleep, Mr. Fang looked at the task of earning money on the System Interface and almost dropped from his bed. “How come it suddenly increased by 10 percent!?”","In the Arcade Game Hall, Gu Tingyun and Zong Wu stood there, each holding a huge storage bag of immortal crystals. They begged, “Guys! Guys! Please take back these immortal crystals; you may go to another shop...”","Those people stood up abruptly and shouted, “You must take these immortal crystals! Do you have such a low regard for us?!”","“!!??” Stupefied, Zong Wu and Gu Tingyun held the immortal crystals and didn’t know what to do with them. “What should we... do now!?”","“Now, I’ll go and invite the Patriarch’s Prehistoric Immortal Soul!” someone shouted.","“...”"]},{"number":909,"title":"Chapter 909 - The System Finished the Upgrade! Investiture of the Gods Is Released!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","According to rumors, in the newly opened High Immortal Arcade Game Hall, the Heaven Oracle finally invited a streak of the immortal soul of the ancient Tianji Zi to enter his body and broke into the Heavenly Secrets by force. After six successive calculations, he finally won on the shop’s Zhou Yi Divination Machine and won close to 6,000 Black Essence Immortal Crystals from the shop. It had become a legend circulating in this region.","Some people claimed that High Immortal Arcade Game Hall went broke, some people saw that the old shop owner became a homeless on the streets, and some said that Heaven Oracle had damaged his vital essence by forcing himself to calculate the Heavenly Secrets and thus couldn’t do divination for a long time.","Right now, the shop had just closed for the day. People like Gu Tingyun, Nalan Hongwu, and Zong Wu each had a big bag of Black Essence Immortal Crystals in their hands. While exchanging a look with each other, their faces darkened. “Old Ghost Zong, how come I feel like we can even buy the Saint Emperor Mountain if we continue doing this business for a few more months...”","“I agree.”","“Now that we’re famous...” Gu Tingyun was holding the plan drawn by Nalan Mingxue. “According to the plan, we should promote mobile games now, right? With so much money, we can easily build a local network in this area.”","“Yeah. Later, we’ll go and buy this whole street. A part of it can be changed into warehouses, and a part of it can be built into an exclusive specialty shop as mentioned by the shop owner.”","While they were talking, two pairs of eyes stared at the countless immortal crystals in the shop in darkness.","“Should we...” a voice said coldly.","“Don’t even think about it!” another voice warned, “The shop has a master behind it who is stronger than Xuanji Zi in divination. Do you think that you can escape from them with your loot?! Even the eight prehistoric families welcome them, so we’d better not mess with them. Let’s go! This deal is not for us.”","At this moment, Mr. Fang glanced at the task and almost jumped up. “Only 6 percent from the target?! What happened?!”","...","– A few days later –","– In the High Immortal Arcade Game Hall in Innumerable-Immortal Sea –","Coach Wang entered the shop and saw that a small display zone had been set up. Strange white jades with the logo of a rotten apple on the back were on display.","Of course, he recognized the icon of an apple since he saw apples every day.","“Shop Owner, what are these?” Coach Wang asked curiously.","“They are portable learning machines!” Gu Tingyun said,","“They are so small. What can we learn from it?!” Coach Wang was even more puzzled. “By the way, have you considered my offer of buying these spiritual artifacts?”","Obviously, he cared more about these spiritual artifacts.","“Good question,” Gu Tingyun said, “But for now, those spiritual artifacts are not for sale. However, these spiritual artifacts are a portion of the products that are being sold to test the market. The first batch is only 10,000 pieces. We’ll stop selling when they run out.”","“What’s its use?” Coach Wang picked up one and turned it around to study it.","Gu Tingyun picked up one and turned it on. There was an icon with a golden dragon in the background while the words ‘Journey to the War’ lay on top. The other was a game icon with the word ‘Fantasy’.","“Look, there are two learning programs in it. One is the learning program called Journey to the War. The other is the learning program Fantasy Westward Journey.”","[TL Note: These are both popular games in China. Journey to the War, A.K.A Zhengtu, and Fantasy Westward Journey are MMORPG. Fantasy Westward Journey is built on Journey to the West.]","“The first one is more costly. Let’s try the learning program Fantasy Westward Journey.” He clicked on the icon with the word ‘Fantasy’ and created a character. Immediately, an exquisite virtual figure hovered in mid-air.","“Look at the visualization of meridians and the demonstration of skills. After learning the skills, you can see the hand seals for casting spiritual spells, pity formulas, and the routes of spiritual essence circulation. After cultivation, the user can engage in virtual battles with other owners of learning machines or monsters. In Fantasy Westward Journey, the users have all kinds of learning methods such as chained-quests; in Journey to the War, there are all kinds of virtual battles between nations, so the users can deepen their understanding of spiritual spells, techniques, and cultivation methods that they have learned.”","“This...” Coach Wang’s eyes brightened. “If this is the case, the disciples of our Saint Emperor Mountain will need to each have one of these learning machines!”","He reached out and pulled over a disciple randomly. “Yao Ji, you guys come and try this.”","...","One day later, when Mr. Fang woke up...","[Ding! The System finished the upgrade.]","[System Upgrade Task: Acquire Many Energy Crystals","Task Description: Be a truly excellent shop owner and earn as much money as you can!","Task Reward: Mysterious gift bag of a mythological TV Series (contains the TV Series activation right and a treasure from it)]","[Do you want to claim the task reward?]","“It’s finished so soon!?” Fang Qi remembered that he had done nothing except for attending a few meetings, playing some games, and cultivating for some time in the Cultivation Room this month, but the task had finished just like that?!","“So soon?!” Mr. Fang replied eagerly, “Yes!”","Soon, a gift bag with golden shiny light appeared before him.","When he opened it, a light that belonged to a godly weapon shot up into the sky!","Even the shop that was under the operation of the System couldn’t contain this light. Su Tianji and others who were about to enter the shop this morning felt like the Heaven and Earth even shook.","[Mythical TV Series, Investiture of the Gods, is activated!]","[You obtained the spiritual treasure, God-Thrashing Whip.]","[TL Note: Although its name is a whip, it is more like a wooden stick.]","Su Tianji hurried into the shop and exclaimed, “Sir?! What’s happening?! Is Investiture of the Gods released?!”","She looked at the small blackboard in the shop and saw all the previous games and movies had been erased. There were four big worlds on it – [Investiture of the Gods]!","“It’s indeed released-!?”","– In the Canglan City Shop –","Elf Queen Kellybel stood before some elves and said solemnly with her hands on her hips, “For the record, it’s been a long while, and the scummy shop owner hasn’t released Investiture of the Gods yet. So when it’s out, we’ll boycott it just to make him worry.”","“Do you hear me?!”","“Yes!”","“Humph! That’s more like it!” With great efforts, Kellybel had finally obtained some authority among the clumsy elves by livestreaming all kinds of skills in God of War. She looked delighted at the result.","At this moment, someone in the shop yelled, “Investiture of the Gods is released!”","“Ahya-! I’ll watch it!”","“Rowling, wait for me!”","“Slow down-!”","They all ran into the shop.","In less than one second, Kellybel found that all the elves had left her.","“You... you guys-!” Kellybel’s pretty face turned red in anger. “How can you do this?!”","“Hurry! Or there will be no seats left!” someone yelled.","“Wait! Save a spot for me-!” Kellybel immediately rushed into the shop.","Seeing an empty chair, she was about to pull it out and sit down when Mr. Fang plunked on it smoothly with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands!","“Today, the seats are in high demand.” Mr. Fang slurped the instant noodles and said casually, “The people without a seat must wait for a while.”","Kellybel’s pretty face turned red in fury. Staring at the bowl of instant noodles in the despicable shop owner’s hands, she had the urge to grab it and pour the hot soup onto the scum shop owner’s head!","“Ahhhh-!” Not able to watch Investiture of the Gods, she felt like dying!","At this moment, on Mr. Fang’s screen, grand chime-bell music sounded.","Investiture of the Gods began..."]},{"number":910,"title":"Chapter 910 - The Most Horrifying Catastrophe!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The first thing that the viewers saw was a vast fertile land during the primeval time in the middle of Huaxia.","On the vast continent, about 800 feudatories occupied territories that dotted the land like chess pieces. Under the rule of four major feudatories, four grand ancient states stood in four directions to protect the nation.","Su Tianji and the others who watched the TV Series in a group and the elves in the Canglan City Shop felt as if they had entered a nation in the very distant past.","Regardless if it was the Golden Royal Palace engulfed in auspicious clouds and charming lights or the military and civil officials standing in rows before the white jade steps, everything told the viewers the radiant glory of this primeval nation.","“Wow-! Is this ancient Huaxia!?” Watching the TV Series next to Mr. Fang, Elf Girl Sala asked in amazement.","“Is it the legendary Huaxia where... Nuwa patched the sky and created humans, Hou Yi shot down suns, and the Great Yu conquered the flood?” Rowling also asked in surprise on the side.","Having played the Legend of Sword and Fairy and watched Journey to the West, they had found that the world named Huaxia was bigger and more complex than any world that they had known. Even if they studied each game carefully, they only understood the surface of it.","Now, they felt like they were standing in the middle of the legendary nation...","It was probably the legend in legends!","“You... what do you see?!” Kellybel stood behind them alone with sweat popping on her forehead due to impatience. She had the urge to pull the elves off their chairs so she could watch the TV Series. “Is it good?!”","“So magnificent... it’s hard to imagine that it’s a primeval nation...”","...","“This era seems to come right behind the Xia Dynasty built by King Great Yu...” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Shen Qingqing, a fan of stories, obviously was an expert in this field. “This era is probably considered the primeval times even for the people in Journey to the West.”","“Is it this ancient?!” Su Tianji and the others who watched the TV Series in a group looked at the ancient dynasty in amazement. Without comparison, they wouldn’t understand the meaning of this TV Series. But after playing all kinds of Xianxia-genre games and watching Journey to the West...","Thinking of an era even more ancient than the world in Journey to the West, they couldn’t find words to express their astonishment.","Journey to the West was a legend in itself. Then this... story should be a legend in the legends!","At this moment, like the Elf Queen, the Valkyrie in the Heavenly Realm could do nothing but look at the people who were watching Investiture of the Gods.","“What Huaxia? What primeval nation?! What are they watching?!” Valkyrie Isabela lay in the pool in puzzlement. “What’s so good about the stuff that they are watching? How come I can’t see it?!”","“Isn’t it just a human nation? What’s so good about it?” Black Dragon Gulth was also watching the TV Series. Not understanding the amazement of other viewers, he mumbled to himself.","Then, he continued to watch.","...","At this moment, inside the Golden Royal Palace, military and civil officials assembled, and Premier Shang Rong asked for King Zhou’s approval to offer incense to Nuwa to celebrate her birthday.","King Zhou asked, “What virtue and merits does Nuwa have? Why should I go with 10,000 carriages and offer incense to her?”","“This king!?” Not only Black Dragon Gulth, but the saint-level masters from different nations were stupefied.","Isn’t Nuwa a major goddess in the primeval times?! Could they ignore the major deities if the latter didn’t have virtue and merits!?","Everyone in the palace looked as if nothing was unusual.","“Is this still a human nation!?” Not only the viewers in the new shops in Canglan City and the East Continent, but those in the old shops also exclaimed in astonishment.","It was something unimaginable for the people like Mage Merlin who had stayed in a nation of faith.","At this moment, Shang Rong reported, “Goddess Nuwa has the virtues of a sage. When Gong Gong, the God of Water, crashed his head onto Buzhou Mountain and caused the sky to tip in the northwest and the earth to sink in the southeast, Nuwa collected five-colored stones to patch up the sky. It’s a great deed for people, and it’s natural for people to build shrines to worship her to show gratitude. Now, as Morning Song offers sacrifice to this fortuitous goddess, we will receive long-term prosperity and peace in all seasons with enough rain and mild winds and no disasters. She’s the main goddess who protects our nation and people with blessings. You Majesty, it’s your duty to offer incense to her!”","[TL Note: Morning Song was the Capital of the Shang Dynasty.]","...","At this moment, the story was uneventful. No one imagined that under the peaceful veneer, an extremely horrifying catastrophe involving Heaven, Earth, humans, and deities was brewing!","When the Heaven emitted murderous spirits, the stars would change positions. When the Earth emitted murderous spirits, dragons and snakes would fly out. When humans had murderous spirits, the Heaven and Earth would be turned upside-down!","The viewers watched as King Zou listened to the malicious officials’ suggestion of choosing imperial concubines. In order for Daji, who was a thousand-year-old fox that had transformed into a beauty, to enter the palace, King Zou tortured and killed people on blazing copper pillars, and Premier Shang Rong killed himself by smashing his head into a pillar in the Golden Royal Palace. The scenes became more and more horrifying. In the short two episodes, the viewers were filled with a feeling that a storm would come, and the grand hall would collapse.","This nation was so prosperous that it had the power to ignore primeval gods if the latter had no virtues or merits. It was probably the most radiant human nation that the viewers had ever seen, and one could call it a godly nation on Earth without exaggeration since it was that brilliant.","– But at this moment –","Before the viewers, this nation turned into the demons’ palace on Earth!","Demons danced and roared around in disguise, and demonic essence shot up high into the sky. Almost overnight, the Heaven and Earth were turned upside-down, and the mortal world was gradually turning into a realm for demons and ghosts.","“How can Su Daji be so vicious!?” The peace-loving elves huddled together and covered their eyes in fear when some people were tortured and killed after being tied onto blazing metal pillars.","“This King Zhou is also cruel and vicious...!” Right now, the viewers in the old shops regarded King Zhou as an evil demon.","Perhaps he was even more horrifying than the devil...","...","“Look! Isn’t he Pagoda-Bearer Devaraja Li Jing?!” In the old shop at Jiuhua City, the viewers had come to the part of Nata’s reincarnation.","Su Tianji, Shen Qingqing, and all the other people in the shop couldn’t believe what they saw.","Devaraja Li, who had fiercely battled with the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal in Journey to the West, is just a small marshal in Chentang Fortress at this moment?!","This almost changed their understanding of the world.","How powerful is this human nation? It dares to let such an existence be one of its marshals?","“But... where’s the pagoda that he was always holding on his palm?”","Is this the story before he became a god-!? A horrifying thought dawned on Su Tianji and others.","“Then, this dynasty...!!??”","...","The Heaven emitted murderous spirits. It was time for this dynasty to reach the end of its destiny. Like a withered leaf in the autumn, it floated down from the tree.","The Earth emitted murderous spirits. Dragons and snakes flew out, and demons appeared everywhere to make trouble in the mortal world, signaling the imminent catastrophe.","The humans emitted murderous spirits. As loyal and upright old officials were killed by King Zhou one after another, the entire mortal world was turned upside-down.","Heaven, Earth, and Humans... the three elements were all here. At this moment, the biggest catastrophe that had only previously existed in legends would come silently.","It would implicate Heaven, Earth, humans, deities, and the whole world... even the immortals and gods couldn’t stay out of it, let alone humans.","At this moment, everyone including Su Tianji and the others in the old shops and the masters in the new shops turned silent as they watched. They didn’t have a deep understanding of the situation yet, but intuitively, they felt a horror that they had never imagined before as an acute feeling of suppression from a huge catastrophe hit them.","In such a catastrophe and a screwed up human dynasty, what kind of a stunning legend would unfold at the hands of the countless grandmasters and the immortals who had lived as hermits in remote immortal mountains and seas?","At this thought, fear, excitement, shock, and other feelings mingled with each other as people’s minds trembled subconsciously.","These feelings and emotions had never been so intense before!","Watching such a vast mythical scroll, Su Tianji and others felt overwhelmed, thinking that their heads weren’t big enough to handle all this."]},{"number":911,"title":"Chapter 911 - Fuxi’s Connate Eight Trigrams!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","For the whole day, most of the players in the shops were watching the newly released Investiture of the Gods.","On the morning of the next day, a large group of people walked in as soon as the shop opened. After finding seats to sit down, they began to talk about the new TV Series eagerly.","“Sister Su, did you finish Investiture of the Gods yesterday?” With a mug of Cappuccino in his hand, Song Qingfeng hadn’t even taken a seat yet. Seeing an acquaintance nearby, he began to talk with her. “I just came back from my family and haven’t watched it yet. Is it good?”","“Yesterday, I just watched the Shang Dynasty go corrupt. My goodness! You can’t imagine how powerful the Shang Dynasty is! Do you remember Pagoda Bearer Devaraja Li, the grand general who led an army to surround and attack Flower Fruit Mountain and later did many favors for the Great Sage in Journey to the West?” Su Tianji said, “He’s in Investiture of the Gods; he’s only a marshal in the Shang Dynasty!”","“F*ck?!” About to turn on Investiture of the Gods, Song Qingfeng was startled and shouted, “Then, who is the emperor!? Is he the Great Jade Emperor?”","“I don’t think so,” Su Tianji said.","“I wonder if some more powerful immortals are acting as officials in the Shang Dynasty!” Shen Qingqing said, “Goddess Nuwa is so powerful, but when King Zhou read the lewd poem, she didn’t dare to touch one hair of his, at least on the surface.”","“What...? Isn’t Nuwa the primeval sage? The one who patched up the sky...? In Journey to the West, even the small Jin River Dragon King dared to take the emperor’s life.”","“Who’s the most powerful person in the Shang Dynasty? Is there anyone more powerful than Pagoda Bearer Devaraja Li?”","“I don’t know. Right now, there’s a man named Huang Feihu, and his title is King Wucheng. I don’t think he showed up in Journey to the West. There’s also a Grand Preceptor Wen who is outside suppressing rebellions.”","“Huh? Did these people appear in Journey to the West? Are they more powerful than Devaraja Li?” After all, Song Qingfeng and the others had only watched Journey to the West and knew that the gods had different powers.","“I can’t talk with you guys now. I’ve got to watch it!” Seeing that Investiture of the Gods had begun on her screen, Shen Qingqing was eager to find answers to her questions.","Hearing her words, the others also stopped their chat and entered the magnificent and miraculous mythical world in the primeval times.","“Qingqing, do you want to watch it together?” Su Tianji and the others also put on their virtual reality headsets and began to watch today’s new episodes of Investiture of the Gods.","“Yes! Yes! Yes! Being tied to a blazing metal pillar is so scary that I almost had a nightmare last night.”","Remembering yesterday’s experience, the girls decided to watch the new episodes together, afraid that Su Daji would invent some new frightening torture methods.","“What’s that...!?” Song Qingfeng, who hadn’t watched the TV Series yesterday, looked at them in bafflement.","...","At this moment, they stepped on the land in Kunlun Mountain which was covered in white snow and ice that were tens of thousands of years old. The terrain was different from the Kunlun that they saw in the Legend of Sword and Fairy, which was way later in the timeline. Auspicious clouds and mists rose, and purple clouds floated around while countless immortal lights shot out from the immortal palace at the Kirin Cliff.","It was a prosperous immortal scene that no words could describe.","After entering the palace, the viewers saw the Primeval Lord of Heaven quietly sitting with his eyes closed on the Eight Treasure Cloud Light Platform.","They had never seen this immortal before. He didn’t look solemn or majestic, but they had an indescribable feeling when they saw him, and a sense of respect and fear hit them abruptly.","This feeling was even more intense than the feeling that they had when they saw Patriarch Subodhi on the Mountain of Heart and Mind.","“Who... is this immortal?!” Su Tianji sensed it more since she had learned the Palm Thunder at the Mountain of Heart and Mind and used it to block true immortals with only a mortal’s cultivation strength!","The indescribable sense of respect and fear that this old immortal induced in her was even stronger than Patriarch Subodhi!?","She couldn’t imagine what realm this immortal had reached.","“Master, what kind of an immortal is the Primeval Lord of Heaven...?” Fenghua and Yuexin looked horrified as they thought about the situation, and so did Shen Qingqing and Xu Zixin, who were watching the TV Series with them.","Something more astonishing came...","“There are two other deities on the same level as the Primeval Lord of Heaven?!”","It was hard to imagine. The people felt as if they were standing before a mountain that they couldn’t see the peak of. Feeling as tiny as dust before the grand mountain, they suddenly discovered that there were more taller mountains behind the first one, which they had thought was the tallest mountain in the world!","“Look! They are going to sent Jiang Shang down the mountain for the investiture of the gods!” The viewers were thrilled at the thought of the investiture of the gods. They were amazed that such an unimaginable thing would happen in the primeval Huaxia.","...","While the Kunlun Mountain was peaceful and tranquil, the human world was in an uproar.","“King Zhou has killed two major feudatories... half of the four big feudatories are gone...?”","“This West Feudatory Ji Chang is in danger...!”","At this moment, West Feudatory Ji Chang was doing divination for himself before he set off. The hexagrams showed that the Shang Dynasty had only 28 years left. Fei Zhong and You Hun, two evil officials, would die violent deaths while West Feudatory Ji Chang would have a natural and peaceful end.","“Is this prediction accurate or not?!” The viewers exchanged a look. It would be fine if the prediction was kept a secret. However, the two evil officials, Fei Zhong and You Hun, heard of it, which worried the viewers.","After all, it was taboo for heavenly secrets to be leaked. More importantly, the prediction was leaked to King Zhou, who had killed two major feudatories.","They continued to watch as King Wen (Ji Chang) was imprisoned, and he derived the connate 64 hexagrams from the connate eight trigrams. Later, he was actually released and returned to his homeland with glory. Then, King Zhou went back on his words and wanted to kill King Wen. The ups and downs of the story were thrilling.","At Lintong Fortress, tens of thousands of soldiers chased after King Wen with thunderous shouts. He was about to reach the border of West Zhou when they caught up with him. Then, a figure descended from the sky with wind and lightning energy on his wings, and he stood before the tens of thousands of soldiers!","[TL Note: King Zhou and the West Zhou aren’t related. Even though they are all pronounced Zhou, the actual Chinese characters are different.]","With his eyes big like bronze bells with lightning energy flashing inside, he was ‘the first one with wind and lightning energy on his wings and who inspired descendants with countless changes!’","“Leizhenzi! My goodness-!” Remembering the foreshadowing where West Feudatory Ji Chang had saved an abandoned infant in a thunderstorm, the audience exclaimed in elation.","[TL Note: Leizhenzi is a character featured within the famed classic Chinese novel Investiture of the Gods. Leizhenzi is a celestial being that had been created by a certain great thunderstorm at Mount Swallow. He is also known as Thunder-quaker.]","“King Zhou couldn’t kill him! My goodness... his divination was right!”","“I’ll watch that Fuxi Eight Trigrams again. It is amazing... such accurate predictions were made!”","Su Tianji said immediately.","Then, she began to watch Investiture of the Gods for the second time.","At this moment, many other people also went back to watch the extremely mysterious Eight-Trigram Pattern with eager eyes.","Especially, the cultivators such as Fairy Qing Yun who exceled in divination immediately went back to watch the process again. “Fuxi Eight Trigram... Fuxi!?”","She suddenly widened her eyes in amazement. “Is it the origin of the divination and the Zhou Yi Technique in the legendary land of Huaxia!?”","Even the weak-looking feudatory knows such powerful stuff?!"]},{"number":912,"title":"Chapter 912 - Ten Ultimate Arrays! Members of Jie Sect began to show power!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","...","On the other side, the story of Li Jing and his son unfolded. The cultivators and warriors in different shops watched Nata cause an uproar in the ocean beside the Chentang Fortress. Knowing that he had made big trouble, Nata killed himself, returning his flesh to his mother and bones to his father. It was an unsettling story.","Different from Journey to the West, Investiture of the Gods revealed the grand mythical scenes from ancient Huaxia. Perhaps no other legend or myth in the history of the whole world had so many powerful immortals and gods appearing at the same time. It was like a huge mythical scroll.","The mythical heroes from this huge mythical scroll stepped onto the huge arena one by one.","Among this mythical group of heroes, no one was absolutely good or bad. Deities could also make mistakes, since they had once been humans.","On this ultimate arena, legendary stories with strange twists unfolded.","“So, Li Jing was still cultivating under Du’e Immortal at this time...”","“This Taiyi Immortal is so powerful. He rebuilt Nata’s physical body with lotus flowers and roots!”","The viewers watched the scenes with widened eyes.","“So, Pagoda Bearer Devaraja Li’s jade tower is a gift from Lamp-Burning Daoist... it’s used to suppress Nata, so they are forced to reconcile with each other?!”","“Huh-!? Isn’t he Buddha Dipamkara?!” While talking about the story with others, Su Tianji froze at the scene.","It must be noted that Buddha Dipamkara had appeared in Journey to the West many times. But in this era, he was Lamp-Burning Daoist!?”","He was... a disciple of the Primeval Lord of Heaven!?","At this moment, the screen dimmed.","“Ahh-! That’s the end again-!?”","Instantly, she lounged on the computer chair as if she had lost all her will to do anything.","Su Tianji and the others sat before their computers for a while.","“Master, should we watch it again? I feel unsatisfied!” Fenghua said.","“What the heck. Can’t the shop owner release 100 episodes in one day?!” Su Tianji said indignantly, “Well, I’ll watch it again.”","“That’s miraculous...” The moment she said that, Song Qingfeng who was sitting beside her yelled, “This divination technique doesn’t need spiritual energy. It means that anyone can learn it?!”","“West Feudatory has derived connate trigrams. Fuxi Eight Trigrams are profound and hard to understand, but the derived 64 hexagrams are easy to understand even though the number of signs increased. You guys can watch it a few more times.”","They didn’t know that this was the beginning of Zhou Yi, the most famous divination theory and one of the fruits of ancient wisdom!","...","“Investiture of the Gods is miraculous...!” For the next few days, people in almost every shop were talking about this new TV Series.","Some tried to copy King Wen and deduce their fates using the divination technique.","“Um... but...” Sitting on a couch, Su Tianji was talking with others about Investiture of the Gods in high spirits, and she said, “The previous episodes focused on the Shang Dynasty and the three sects, and the most important part is the Connate Eight Trigrams. I guess the Daoist friends who study divination are thrilled.”","“It’s a pity that I study lightning spells, and divination is only my hobby,” Su Tianji said in frustration, “I wonder if there’s good stuff in the future episodes.”","“The three sects are so powerful. I wonder if any of the sect leaders will give lectures?” Sitting next to her, Nalan Mingxue turned her bright eyes. “I wonder who will...”","“It’s said that Chan Sect has closed the Dao field due to the imminent catastrophe. We haven’t seen members of the Ren Sect yet,” Shen Qingqing analyzed, “Maybe the Chan Sect...?”","Su Tianji said, “Goddess Shiji claimed to be a member of Chan Sect, but she was burned to death by Taiyi Immortal with the Nine Dragon Godly Fire Cover. Maybe the Chan Sect isn’t powerful at all?”","Nalan Mingxue agreed. “It’s possible...”","Seeing that the sky had turned dark, they stood up from the couches. “It’s exciting that we can watch new episodes of Investiture of the Gods tomorrow!”","“One week has passed before we noticed it!”","“We can do nothing but talk about Investiture of the Gods each day...” Su Tianji said, feeling like her life depended on this.","Then, she perked up at the thought that she could watch new episodes tomorrow.","...","– On the next morning –","“Huh-!?” Before they could sit down with cups of Cappuccino in their hands, they heard Su Tianji shout, “Look! It’s about Chan Sect! Grand Preceptor Wen has returned with the army!”","In the mythical TV Series with many gods, the main character Jiang Ziya, who was also known as Jiang Shang, mingled with them and didn’t look outstanding with his weak cultivation strength, calling almost every enemy and friend ‘Senior’. However, his shortcomings showcased the others’ radiance.","Seeing Grand Preceptor Wen returning to Morning Song with the army, the viewers had their hearts in their throats again. After all, even Shang Rong, the old official whom the previous king had entrusted with the duty to look after the new king, had killed himself by smashing his head onto the pillar in the Golden Royal Palace. Bi Gan, the uncle of the king, was cruelly cut open and had his heart dug out. In such an extremely unruly dynasty, the viewers thought that this old official Wen Zhong would be the next victim. However, when the old official showed up while riding on a black Kirin, King Zhou didn’t dare to utter any nonsense, When he punched the evil officials in front of everyone in Golden Royal Palace, King Zhou didn’t even dare to show his anger.","The viewers trembled inside. What’s the background of Grand Preceptor Wen... Even King Zhou must tread carefully around him...!","Although he was on the side of villains, he was almost the most admirable person in the whole TV Series!","In Golden Royal Palace, they drew up ten strategies to settle the nation. On Golden Turtle Island, they visited immortal friends to battle West Qi!","[TL Note: West Qi is West Feudatory Ji Chang’s land, and the nation was called West Zhou.]","At this moment, the viewers followed them to the Golden Turtle Island. In one glance, they saw the tranquil green mountains overlooking and suppressing the great ocean and sharp cliffs. Colorful phoenixes chirped, long-living deer and immortal foxes roamed in the forest, and spiritual beasts and birds rested on trees. Ivies and veins crawled in the valley with creeks and bamboo remaining green all year round...","“Wow... so beautiful...!” The scenery-loving elves in the Canglan City Shop didn’t want to leave.","“Look! What are they making!?” At this moment, there were immortals coming and going on the island. In the Eight Trigram Brazier, something was being refined.","The refinery method was too complex for the viewers to understand. But after it was set up on the battleground in Xi Qi, all kinds of immortal lights of various colors rose from the array. The connate pure essence floated up, hiding hints of hundun inside. Wind and fire were unleashed together as the Heaven and Earth cracked. Murderous spirits spread all over the Heavenly Realm, and black smoke engulfed Mount Qi.","“This...” At this moment, not only Su Tianji, but everyone else, from new viewers to Ancestral Master Xiaoyao and other patriarchs, looked at the array in horror.","They had never seen a major array with such intense murderous spirits; it could kill immortals and gods. “What array is this?!”","As Ten Ultimate Arrays came out, the Daoist spells of Green Touring Palace began to reveal their powers to the viewers!"]},{"number":913,"title":"Chapter 913 - I want to learn this!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Outside West Qi was a vast wasteland where sand and small rocks flew in the wild winds, and dust filled the sky.","In front of the West Qi army was Nata, who stood on the Fiery Wheels with the Fiery Tip Spear in his hands, Huang Tianhua who was riding on the Jade Kirin, Leizhenzi with his weird and fierce looks, and Yang Jian, emanating a magnificent presence as he looked into the distance.","On the side of the Shang Dynasty that was ruled by Yin Shang, Grand Preceptor Wen was standing before others while riding on the black Kirin with a gold whip in his hand. Behind him were ten Daoists with chilly expressions. Their faces looked very weird, being green, yellow, red, or white in colour. Riding on immortal elks, they stood in one line.","The two armies formed their formations with intense murderous spirits!","The viewers had never seen such a scene before. They were amazed that the mortal troops were led by immortals whose powers were unimaginable.","When they built the arrays, the soldiers and generals took their positions. The formation looked even more mysterious as heavy dust and sand filled the air.","Su Tianji and some other cultivators, such as the Wuwei Daoist Alliance Master Lan Mo, followed Jiang Ziya into the arrays to observe them. The moment that they passed the border of the array flags which acted as invisible portals, they felt as if they had entered another world in which the sky was dim and the earth was dark. Even though it was only a part of the arrays that weren’t completely finished, it could scare ordinary people witless!","As the two sects battled, they only used their techniques and Dao spells. Even though they didn’t use any cunning and strange military schemes, the arrays full of dangers looked more frightening than military tactics!","At this moment, on one hand, the viewers in the new shops and the ones in the Continent of Immortal Relics admired Grand Preceptor Wen’s loyalty and the indigenous Ten Ultimate Arrays built by the Ten Heavenly Masters from the Golden Turtle Island. They were eager to see the great power of the major arrays. On the other hand, they hoped that the great West Qi army would reach Morning Song immediately and teach the cruel king a hard lesson. For one moment, they were worried that Jiang Ziya couldn’t break the arrays. For the next moment, they were worried that old Grand Preceptor Wen would be defeated. They felt torn.","...","“There’s indeed no one who can break these arrays...?” Artifact masters such as Li Haoran and Jun Yangzi from the Wuwei Daoist Alliance stared at the major arrays. Instead of activating the arrays, the Ten Heavenly Masters invited Jiang Ziya to enter the arrays and observe them so he could return and think of a way to break it, which showed how confident they were in the Ten Ultimate Arrays.","Obviously, the arrays didn’t let them down since no one in the whole West Qi army could think of a way to deal with them!","“So horrifying! There’s such a horrifying thing in ancient Huaxia!” In the new shop in Canglan City, Black Dragon Gulth howled in astonishment, “I feel like its presence is even more scary than some of the powerful gods... Is it an array?!”","In his mind, arrays were just magic arrays, not this thing that contained so many dangers and mysteries!","“Ten Ultimate Arrays?! What good stuff are you watching!?” At this moment, Valkyrie Isabela, who was lying in the Heavenly Realm, could only obtain some clues by eavesdropping on the murmurs of the viewers as she waited for the livestream on the big screen at 8 PM. She was so impatient that she wished that she could leap out of the pool and go to the shop to watch the newest episodes of Investiture of the Gods.","Despite her impatience, she perked up her ears to eavesdrop on the elves, afraid that she would miss some details that they had let slip about the TV Series.","At this moment, the elves exclaimed, “How come the Master of the Desolate Array is so powerful?!”","[TL Note: Hun and po are types of souls in Chinese philosophy and traditional religion. Within this ancient soul dualism tradition, every living human has both a hun spiritual, ethereal, yang soul which leaves the body after death, and also a po corporeal, substantive, yin soul which remains with the corpse of the deceased. It is believed that people have three hun and seven po.]","“He stole Jiang Ziya’s two hun and six po with only a scarecrow!?” They saw Heavenly Master Yao set an earth platform and an incense desk in the Desolate Array and place a scarecrow on the platform with Jiang Shang’s name attached on it. Three lamps were placed on the scarecrow’s head while seven lamps were placed by its feet. By using talisman paper and seals in front of the platform, he had taken almost all of Jiang Ziya’s souls in about 20 days as the latter tried to think of a way to deal with the array!","Even the cultivators on the East Continent had never seen such weird and powerful Dao spells before!","It was hard and even impossible to defend. Even though they knew the causes, Yang Jian and Nata were clueless as to how to block the spell.","It was a technique that went beyond their scope of knowledge!","They couldn’t understand the connection between the scarecrow and Jiang Ziya and why it could break through all defenses and target his hun and po with ease.","It was so dangerous!","“A scarecrow?! What? What? Another powerful object?!” Lying in the pool, the Valkyrie wished that her hands could move and ease the itching sensation caused by her impatience to watch the TV series.","“Say something more, guys!” She was desperate.","At this moment, the viewers began to understand the great power of this array. After all, the disciple sent by the Primal Lord of Heaven lost his souls and almost died there after just coming out of the sect!","At last, Jiang Ziya, with only one hun and one po left and desperate to return to Kunlun, floated back to Kunlun Mountain and encountered the South Pole Immortal Elder, who stopped the last hun and po from being taken. If this didn’t happen, Investiture of the Gods would end soon after it began.","Then, the viewers watched as the Primeval Lord of Heaven’s second disciple, Chijing Zi, went to take back Jiang Ziya’s hun and po. Instead of taking them back, he almost died in the array. Seeing this scene, the viewers were shocked beyond words!","After all, Chijing Zi was one of the Golden Immortals and only second to Guangcheng Zi among the twelve Golden Immortals!","“What’s the background of the Ten Heavenly Masters? It seems like everyone from the Jie Sect is powerful!” the viewers had been a bit worried that the old Grand Preceptor Wen Zhong would be defeated. But now, they were full of worry for Jiang Ziya and West Qi, wondering if anyone in the world could break this array!","Even more unbelievable was that even the Primeval Lord of Heaven couldn’t give them a good method to enter the array and take back Jiang Ziya’s hun and po. With his decree, the people of West Qi went to Eight-View Palace in Xuandu Cave of Daluo Palace and visited Laozi, who then gave them a Tai Chi Scroll. But this scroll could only deal with the array that took Jiang Ziya’s hun and po, and there were ten arrays.","Chijing Zi, whose combat strength ranked top among the twelve Golden Immortals, entered the array with that Tai Chi Scroll, and he only made a narrow escape after taking back Jiang Ziya’s hun and po but lost the Tai Chi Scroll in the array!","When he escaped from the array, he was scared senseless!","“This... can we learn this array?!” Suddenly, many cultivators yelled. After all, they had watched every detail including when the Heavenly Masters refined these array blueprints!","Su Tianji also stared at the Ten Ultimate Array and shouted, “I’ll learn it too! I’ll learn... the Golden Light Array made by Golden Light Saint Mother!”","“Huh?! Aiya!” Su Tianji was delighted when she saw that the Golden Light Saint Mother also used lightning spells!","“Ya! I’ll learn this one! I’ll learn this one!”"]},{"number":914,"title":"Chapter 914 - Head-Nailing Seven Arrow Book... Can also be learned?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After watching today’s episodes of Investiture of the Gods, Su Tianji took out her communication jade to contact the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and analyze the array that she had seen today","At this moment, almost all the people in the shop were talking about the Ten Ultimate Arrays.","“Which of the Ten Ultimate Arrays do you think is the most powerful...?” Su Tianji heard An Huwei discussing with some grand cultivators. “I’m sure that the Golden Light Array is the most powerful!”","“It’s obvious that the Desolate Array is more powerful!”","“F*ck the Desolate Array! It just appears more often than the others. The Heavenly Ultimate Array is the most powerful! It ranks No.1 among the Ten Ultimate Arrays. It’s natural that the Heavenly Ultimate Array is the most powerful array!” Ye Songtao, the Cloud Ocean Faction Master and one of the most veteran customers in the shop, said, “I think we can learn these arrays. After I return to my faction, I’ll gather the faction resources and see if we can make a copy of the array blueprint...”","“We can’t find those high-level materials they used in the arrays! The materials that we have aren’t up to the standard,” Su Tianji said, “I think the best we can is making a mimic, just like the Heavenly Mirror that we previously made.”","“High-level materials?! Aren’t up to the standard?” Seeing Nalan Mingxue passing them, An Huwei’s eyes lit up as he said, “If we can get some rare and precious materials from the Heavenly Realm to refine the array blueprint...”","“Then, we can...”","They exchanged a look and yelled together, “Make duplicates!”","Hearing these words, they were stunned by their own bold thoughts.","After all, this was not a spell but something like spiritual treasures which didn’t consume much spiritual energy. Anyone could use it and release the same power!","At this thought, Su Tianji sat on a couch just like how the Golden Light Saint Mother sat in the array. She emitted lightning-like lights from her palms as if she was controlling the godly mirror in the array without touching it. “Daoist friends, what do you think of my Golden Light Array?!”","“Master, this array has the essence of the sun and the moon and contains the essence from Heaven and Earth. It’s extremely miraculous!” At this moment, Fenghua praised while moving her head back and forth, “The mirror is neither copper nor gold and can’t be found in the fire inside the brazier. Even heavenly immortals would be melted if they are trapped in the array!”","“Ahaha! I knew that I haven’t wasted my love on you!” Su Tianji smiled smugly.","“Ya! You stole all my lines!” Yuexin was sulky.","“Hahaha! Watch my Heavenly Ultimate Array!” At this moment, a figure walked up from behind. It was the Xue Daolv, the Liuyun Daoist Palace Master and Su Tianji’s senior brother.","Sitting on a couch, he formed a spiritual seal with both hands.","“Ahahahaha! Very good!” The people of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance who loved to try new things moved immediately. Jun Yangzi said, “I’ll try it as soon as I return.”","Alliance Chief Lan Mo said, “Mr. Nalan and I will contact the Immortal Realm and ask Senior Nalan and others to find some rare materials that we don’t have. Okay?”","[TL Note: It seems like Godly Realm, Immortal Realm, and Heavenly Realm all refer to the same place.]","“These materials are not cheap,” An Huwei said with worry, “I’m afraid that they won’t have enough money...”","“We will try with all the forces in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance first!”","...","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu and Gu Tingyun in the distant Innumerable-Immortal Sea looked sulky. “I say, our storage space is not big enough for the immortal crystals. What should we do?”","“Don’t worry.” Gu Tingyun said, “The teleportation array leading to the Lower Region is about to be completed. We’ll have no problem with communication and transporting goods.”","At this moment, they received messages from Wuwei Daoist Alliance and Nalan Mingxue. “Huh...? They’re asking us to find these precious materials...?”","They were curious. “Why do they need these materials?”","Nalan Hongwu glanced at the materials and found that some of them didn’t even have names and only had pictures.","Some of the pictures seemed to be screenshots from some TV Series.","“Huh...? What are these?!”","“What are you talking about?” Zong Wu immediately looked over.","Nalan Hongwu said, “They seem to be trying to re-create something... Ten Ultimate Arrays. But they lack lots of materials and are asking us to find them here...”","“And the mages from the West Continent...” Gu Tingyun said in bafflement, “I just made the plan to open arcade game halls and sell mobile lwearning machines in the Gods’ Palace in the Western Heavenly Realm. How come the mages in Canglan City Shop are sending messages to me...?","“They are offering to go there and open a branch shop in the Gods’ Palace...?”","“This whole thing sounds... very suspicious!” Gu Tingyun said, “How come I’ve never heard of the so-called Ten Ultimate Arrays before?!”","“It seems like... the shop has released a new TV Series...?”","“These guys! How could they not tell us about the new TV Series?!”","“I want to watch this Investiture of the Gods too!” He wanted to quit the job immediately. “We can summon a few people in the Ascendance Realm up here, so they can manage the shop while we go and watch the TV Series!”","They each had a big bag of immortal crystals. They had earned a lot of money by taking their share. They exchanged a look...","“It seems like we can buy lots of stuff with the money that we’ve earned...?!”","“Then, we can also learn the arrays that they mentioned!” Gu Tingyun laughed.","“Good idea!” Zong Wu said, “They are practicing that Ten Ultimate Arrays. I wonder if there’s more powerful stuff?!”","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang suddenly received a new upgrade task from the System.","[System Upgrade Task: Acquire Many Energy Crystals (2)","Task Description: You can repeat this task five times","Task Reward: Mythological Gift Bag*1]","“Huh...?” Mr. Fang glanced at it. “I can do this task several times?!”","It must be noted that previously, he could only do each task once, and the rewarded gift bags didn’t get him any good things.","For example, after receiving the God-Thrashing Whip, Mr. Fang was so angry that he almost disassembled it immediately. What use did he have for such a thing?!","But this time, he had several more chances to receive mythological rewards.","“The System can’t give me a God-Thrashing Whip every time, right?”","Thoughts raced in Mr. Fang’s mind...","...","The Ten Ultimate Arrays were indeed dangerous.","The twelve Golden Immortals of the Chan Sect came to help the West Qi, and they borrowed spiritual treasures from many places and spent lots of time on the discussion of strategies before they could finally break these arrays.","Despite their powerful Dao spells, the ten Heavenly Masters from the Golden Turtle Island couldn’t escape from their fates. It was a sad scene when they didn’t die peacefully with their heads cut off.","Regardless if it were the customers of the old shops, the elves in the new shop, or even people from other races, the first thing that they did after entering the shops was talk about the newly released Investiture of the Gods.","They always forgot about the time when they were engrossed in their discussions of the spiritual treasures and all kinds of techniques and spells.","“Under the masters of the three sects, which immortals do you think is the most powerful?” When they got offline, they studied the Ten Ultimate Arrays. When they were online, they also worked hard. In the Jiuhua City Shop, Su Tianji and Xue Daolv sat before their computers. Instead of watching the new episode, they talked about the previous plot.","“It’s Zhao Gongming, of course! The Ocean-Settling Bead and Dragon-Binding Rope are unrivaled. The twelve Golden Immortals and even Lamp-Burning Daoist are not his match!” Jun Yangzi said excitedly.","Whenever they talked about the battles, they were thrilled beyond words.","In the Canglan City Shop at the West Continent, even Elf Queen Kellybel clicked on the TV Series and talked with the large group of elves around her in high spirits. “I wonder where this Lu Ya Daoist Daoist Master comes from. His Head-Nailing Seven Arrow Book killed Zhao Gongming. Is he even more powerful than the three sect masters?!”","“That Treasure-Falling Golden Coin... and the Golden Dragon Scissors... How come there are so many powerful treasures in Investiture of the Gods!” Elf Girl Sala also exclaimed.","It felt as if they were learning a lifetime’s knowledge by watching Investiture of the Gods. They had never heard of so many miraculous treasures anywhere before!","...","“Do you think that we can learn the... Head-Nailing Seven Arrow Book?!” In the old shop, the people exclaimed in appreciation while staring at the screen intently.","They watched as Lu Ya Daoist Master took out a book that clearly listed the spells, seals, and pithy formation in the order of use. After setting a camp in the West Mountain, they put a platform in the camp and created a scarecrow with Zhao Gongming’s name on it. After putting a lamp on its head and a lamp at its feet, they walked in star patterns and burned the talisman paper and the seals.","Su Tianji and other cultivators watched this part many times and then exclaimed, “How come I feel like I can learn this too?!”"]},{"number":915,"title":"Chapter 915 - Nine-Turn Yellow River Array!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the episodes released in recent weeks, West Qi and Yin Shang were in fierce battles. Members from the Chan Sect and Jie Sect and hermit immortals from everywhere entered the fray one by one. With all kinds of spiritual treasures, arrays, and techniques, they showed their ultimate skills in the arena of Investiture of the Gods!","Almost everyone in the shops was thrilled. They wanted to watch each episode and each battle at least ten times!","They had never imagined that they could see such grand battles among immortals and gods in the mortal world. In addition, the techniques and spiritual treasures that the gods and immortals used were almost unheard of and unimaginable!","This TV Series was different from any previous legends that they had watched. Even in Journey to the West, they only remembered some of the figures, such as the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal and Buddha Tathagata. But in Investiture of the Gods...","The viewers could easily remember names such as Grand Preceptor Wen, Jiang Ziya, the Ten Heavenly Masters, and Zhao Gongming. They could describe every detail of the spiritual treasures and techniques in discussions.","Perhaps this war in the mortal world was an ultimate terrifying catastrophe. But without this war, how could these hermits and talented figures reveal themselves to the world?! How could so many ultimate treasures show up and shock the world throughout history?!","How would people know the great immortal power of these cultivators who had lived as hermits and never cared about worldly affairs?!","Previously, the Ten Heavenly Masters built the Ten Ultimate Arrays which troubled the West Qi army for a long time and almost killed its head commander. It wasn’t broken until the 12 Golden Immortals descended to the mortal world and helped them. Then, the Three Sky Fairies from Three Immortal Island built the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array!","Zhao Gongming had extremely high cultivation strength and tempered his jade-like skin and immortal physique. He came down the mountain to avenge the Heavenly Masters of the Jie Sect and had obtained a great victory by defeating the 12 Golden Immortals. However, he later was shot by the Head-Nailing Seven Arrow Book. He could do nothing but wait for death and finally died with a shout of pain.","Due to his loyalty to his friends, Zhao Gongming’s death induced the Three Sky Fairies from Three Immortal Island to come out and avenge him. Cloud Sky Fairy handpicked 600 soldiers and drew patterns on the white earth. The beginning and the end of the patterns contained connate secrets concerning life and death. The outside was arranged according to the pattern of Nine Palaces and Eight Trigrams while the entrance and exit connected each other orderly.","The array had only 600 soldiers, but it contained the power of a million soldiers. Even immortals and gods would lose their hun and po in this array. After practicing for about half a month, the array was ready.","Seeing this scene, the viewers were speechless.","“The three sky fairies’ understanding of Dao is so powerful?!” At this moment, Gu Tingyun finally caught up with other viewers. Seeing this, he was as shocked as everyone else.","“After picking a group of ordinary soldiers and training them for half a month, they can build such a major array in haste...?!”","It was hard to imagine!","When the array was formed, it looked as followed: with the array reaching the Heaven and Earth, its presence rivaled that of the Yellow River. Yin wind whistled as black mist blocked the sun and the moon. Floating everywhere, the ghostly presence shot up into the sky, and the chilly and gloomy yin mist engulfed the ground.","“It will destroy all your hun and po even if you have cultivated for 1,000 years. It will damage your spirit and essence even if you have survived 10,000 tribulations. Even immortals and gods will have the three flowers on the top of their heads cut off. Even the buddhas will have their five essences removed from their chests. In this array, even immortals can’t escape from tribulations.”","[TL Note: Three flowers and five essences are concepts of Daoism. Only the grandmasters could have these things.]","This array looked simpler than the Ten Ultimate Arrays but had greater power than the latter!","“Look! The 12 Golden Immortals are here to break the array!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, the viewers exclaimed. Even the cool and calm people couldn’t stay level-headed today. It was the first time that these people lost their composure.","“The first one entering the array is Guangcheng Zi?! The first immortal in Jade Void Palace!? The second Golden Immortal Chijing Zi even came to help him?!” Nalan Hongwu was always calm, but at this moment, he couldn’t control his excitement as if watching such a battle was the proudest moment in his life!","Stepping on lotus flowers, Chijing Zi came forward with miraculous immortal spells. He was equipped with all the ultimate treasures that he had taken from the cave to break the previous Ten Ultimate Arrays such as Purple Belt Immortal Garment and Yin Yang Mirror. He still had them with him.","Guangcheng Zi stood in the air with sword in hand, engulfed in light and dust.","Cloud Sky Fairy circulated the Chaos Essence Golden Dipper and shot out a golden beam which looked as blinding as a lightning bolt. Then, for some reason, Chijing Zi fell into the array.","Once he was in the array, the Niwan Acupoint on the top of his head was sealed. Stumbling in the array, he couldn’t use any of his great Dao spells!","Guangcheng Zi didn’t fare any better. He was captured together with Chijing Zi after only one round of attacks!","Then, a scene that no one could believe happened. The three sisters unleashed the power of the major array and charged forward with spiritual treasures. They captured Manjushri Lord of Heaven, Samantabhadra Immortal, Cihang Daoist, Qingxu Dao Immortal Master, Daoxing Lord of Heaven, and Jade-top Immortal...","None of the 12 Golden Immortals escaped! They were all captured by the array!","The Chan Sect’s 12 Golden Immortals who had broken Ten Ultimate Arrays with great immortal power were captured within one round of attacks!","“So... so horrifying! The Nine-Turn Yellow River Array is the most horrifying major array that I’ve ever seen!” In the Canglan City Shop, a black dragon yelled, “It’s the No.1 Array in the world!”","“It’s so powerful and miraculous. Who can break it?!” In the new shop on the East Continent, even the ancestral masters were horrified by this scene.","The 12 Golden Immortals from the Chan Sect had the three flowers on their head chopped off in the array, which destroyed almost all their cultivation strength! They were reduced to mortals!?","The viewers were more than shocked. They yelled inside, “These are the 12 Golden Immortals!”","In the huge battleground with many golden immortals descending, only Lamp-Burning Daoist and Jiang Ziya were standing.","Seeing the danger, Lamp-Burning Daoist turned into a streak of wind and dashed into the ground to escape.","“This...!?” When they watched Journey to the West, Buddha Dipamkara gave them the impression that he was on the same level as Buddha Tathagata!","But in this show, the now Lamp-Burning Daoist was escaping from the battle in defeat!? He had no choice but to go to Jade Void Palace and ask for help from the Primeval Lord of Heaven!?","The battles became grander and more magnificent. The viewers were enthralled by the unimaginable battle. They had a clear view of the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array and could recreate it! After the 12 disciples of Chan Set were captured, they were eager to know what their master, the Primeval Lord of Heaven, would do!","“Aiya! How come Investiture of the Gods is so fascinating!” Jiang Xiaoyue begged, “Sir, can’t you release a few more episodes each day?!”","“Um...”"]},{"number":916,"title":"Chapter 916 - The Power of the three Sect Masters!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","On the morning of the next day, before the shop was opened, a large group of people gathered at the door, blocking the entrance.","The moment that the door opened, they swarmed in. It was early morning, but the shop was almost full!","Glancing around the shop, Fang Qi saw people bustling in the huge space. Cultivators and warriors sat down in long rows, and some of them had bowls of instant noodles in their hands because they hadn’t had time to have breakfast yet. Some had Cappuccino or iced tea on their desks and sipped them with great enjoyment.","When Fang Qi first came to this world, he had found that this land and people on it were strange, and the prospects were boundless. But he had never imagined that his internet café would expand to such a big scale.","While resting his hands on the counter, he gazed at the bustling scene in the shop and inhaled deeply.","One Dao was passed to three people, and two of them created the Chan Sect and Jie Sect. The enthralling legends that had circulated in his homeland named Huaxia for thousands of years had begun to spread on this land.","They were stories about the Erlang Immortal Master, Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal... the Three Emperors who established systems of ceremonies and customs, Nv Wa who patched up the sky... Now, in Investiture of the Gods, people watched as the immortals experienced tribulations in their lives.","By now, the customers in the shops probably had gotten used to stories of life and death and the magnificent legends shown in the TV Series, which was why they no longer panicked when something unbelievable happened.","Still... right now, the people in the shops were watching the scenes before them with a sense of awe. In here, they saw mortals turning into immortals and gods through cultivation, super-powerful Dao spells that they had never heard of before, the Chan Sect Immortals who did the right things in the name of the Heaven, and the Jie Sect immortals who looked ferocious but were loyal to friends.","These immortals looked even more real than the immortals and gods that they heard from the legends and myths in their own world. Perhaps these immortals would die in battles in this story, but the viewers would forever remember their great deeds.","Perhaps the viewers also wondered about what kind of endowments that this place, allowing it to create such a legend and give births to these immortals and gods.","Gradually, admiration rose in their hearts.","Look! This is the true presence of an immortal!","For some reason, Fang Qi felt emotions surging inside him and was going to burst out like currents from the Yanzi River and Yellow River as he looked around at the people in the shop.","Perhaps he was deeply touched.","“Boss!” At this moment, a melodious and familiar voice sounded by his ears, “Ya! How come you are standing here all by yourself?! Why aren’t you watching Investiture of the Gods?!”","A small head appeared from the other side of the counter. Standing on her tiptoes, Jiang Xiaoyue looked at Mr. Fang with her big eyes.","“What? What?” Mr. Fang snapped back to reality. “How come you’re here?! Aren’t you supposed to be in school?!”","“Today is June 1st, Children’s Day. We don’t have school today!” Jiang Xiaoyue said nonchalantly.","“What?! You guys have no school even on Children’s Day?! Don’t you need to do extra lessons?! Don’t you live in the academy?!” Mr. Fang widened his eyes and said, “How come you have more and more breaks in your academy?!”","When I was in school, I got fewer and fewer breaks as I grew older!","“No. Tomorrow, I’ll go and talk to your instructors. Why do they give so many breaks to the kids? You are supposed to stay in the academy and study!”","“Aiya! The instructors are all watching Investiture of the Gods and have no time to teach lessons.” Jiang Xiaoyue stomped her foot and said, “Today, new episodes are released!”","“I asked Sister Su, Sister Xue’er, Senior Nalan, my older brother, and many other people to watch today’s new episodes. Why don’t you come and watch it with us!”","“There’s nothing to watch...” Before he could finish, the girl dragged him to watch the TV Series.","...","“Sir, what is the background of Heavenly High Emperor? Why did the 12 immortal masters have to submit to him as subordinates when he told them to? It seems like he has something to do with the Investiture of the Gods too?”","“Sir, the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array is so powerful. How can they break it?”","Jiang Xiaoyue bombarded Fang Qi with questions in great curiosity.","Meanwhile, Demonic Woman Ning Bi and Fairy Qing Yun were also talking about it. “This array is miraculous and fits our style. Perhaps we can learn some of it...?”","Having not organized a TV Series Group Tour for a long time, Mr. Fang found that this group was quite big.","Familiar players and customers ranging from the Continent of Immortal Relics in the east to the Orc Kingdom and Elf kingdom in the west all gather.","Standing on the battleground where West Qi and Yin Shang fought, they looked at the major array in the rising dust and found that it indeed looked like the Yellow River with nine turns and surging turbid waves.","At this moment, Jiang Ziya lit incense in a welcome ceremony. In the floating smoke of incense which spread across the battleground, a voice came from the sky, singing, “Since the chaos, Daoism has always been miraculous. Profound theories pinpoint significant opportunities. Tai Chi gave birth to Yin and Yang, which in turn gave birth to four directions. After Heaven was born at Zi (First) Hour, Dao can do anything under it. Ever since the Earth was born in Chou (second) Hour and the humans were born in Yin (third) Hour, I’m the master of the sect, helping confused people to ascend by writing on jade...”","“Yellow Towel Strongmen hear my order, immortals follow me in floating smoke of incense. The Primeval Lord of Heaven, the true master of Chan Sect, is leaving the Jade Pool and going to spread the religion of Chan.”","“This is...!?”","“Primeval Lord of Heaven?!”","Then, more scents rose. In the rich rare fragrance, red clouds filled the sky as elk barks resonated in the sky. The Primeval Lord of Heaven said, “Daoist Elder Brother from the Eight-View Palace is here.”","Just as the poem stated, “Breaking the chaos and revealing the Heaven and Earth, he established five elements in the mortal world. Guiding Xuanyuan to immortality, he showed power at Han Fortress with Dao that is eternal.”","The figure came down from the sky while riding on a black ox.","“He’s... the Eight-View Palace Master...!?”","“Laozi is here?!”","Two sect masters showed up before the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array?!","“This array can only be broken by the sect masters!?”","Instantly, the viewers looked at Three Sky Fairies’ strength in a totally new light.","This array made two sect masters show up?!","At this moment, they knew that even if the Three Sky Fairies were defeated, they would win their admiration!","“It’s a pity that all their powerful Dao strength will be turned into nothing,” Gu Tingyun and Nalan Hongwu said in regret.","When Laozi entered the array to observe, Jade Sky Fairy used the Golden Dragon Scissors. Seeing the scissors falling from the sky, Laozi, sitting on the ox, waved his sleeve upward. The scissors dropped in the sleeve silently like a tiny seed falling into an ocean without causing any disturbances.","Casually, Laozi took away the Chaos Essence Golden Dipper and Golden Dragon Scissors.","When Jade Sky Fairy charged over with her sword, the Primeval Lord of Heaven ordered the White Crane Disciple to launch the Three Treasure Jade Ruyi into the sky, which hit and broke open the top of Jade Sky Fairy’s head. Her soul flew out of the opening, toward God Investiture Platform.","Then, the Green Sky Fairy charged at the Primeval Lord of Heaven with a flying sword, and the White Crane Disciple knocked her sword away with the Jade Ruyi. The Primeval Lord of Heaven then took out a box from his sleeve, opened the lid, and tossed it into the sky. The box took in Green Sky Fairy and her horse and shortly turned them into a puddle of blood. Her soul also flew toward the God Investiture Platform.","At this moment, people began to understand the great powers of these sect masters.","“These two sect masters are so strong?!” Everyone had known that they were powerful but never expected that their powers were as great as this!","The sect masters had had easily suppressed the Three Sky Fairies who had built the horrifying Nine-Turn Yellow River Array!"]},{"number":917,"title":"Chapter 917 - Daoist Friend, Please Wait!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, in everyone’s mind, these sect masters were symbols of invincibility among all immortals and gods. Their powers went beyond the viewers’ imagination. 0","Led by Mr. Fang, the tour group stood before the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array and looked up to watch the battle of immortals.","“What are the backgrounds of these sect masters? With such great power, aren’t they unrivaled in the world?” Su Tianji asked while watching the battle. “I wonder how they have cultivated and achieved such great power!?”","“Still, they are big bullies!’ Demonic Woman Ning Si said with a snort, They even came together. In my opinion, the Re Sect is the most powerful sect. Only the three disciples under the fie Sect Master could beat the disciples under the Chan","Sect Master senseless. But they were killed by the big bullies who were their seniors!”","“Right!” Some people from the Half City Cultivator Alliance agreed.","“I don’t agree.” The Fifth Prince of the Royal Clan Guild said, “They indeed didn’t do anything wrong. But King Zhou and Su Daji have killed and tortured many good officials in Morning Song. The people in the nation live in untold suffering. Leaving other things aside, just watching the torture with blazing poles and basins filled with poisonous bugs sent chills down my spine.”","“Every moment they block the West Qi army is another moment longer that the evil king and the demon fox can live, which means that they were aiding the evil people to torture others. You might think that they didn’t deserve to die, but Queen Jiang and the dozens of imperial concubines who were tortured and killed by","being sent into basins full of poisonous bugs, the old and conscientious officials such as Shang Rong who were tortured to death, and the people who live in untold suffering wouldn’t think so!’ As a member of the royal family which ruled a nation with peace and prosperity, he naturally knew what the corruption inside the royal family meant for a kingdom.","Hearing his words, they nodded, thinking that his argument was solid.","“Ya! No! Nor Ning Si agreed with him when she first heard the words. After all, the mention of King Zhou and especially Su Daji piqued great hatred in her since the evilness of the demon fox went beyond everyone’s imagination.","Without her influence, King Zhou would have had a chance of being a good king.","However, after some consideration, a thought dawned on her. She shook her head and said,","“You guys are wrong! The Three Sky Fairies from the Three Immortal Island didn’t plan to block the West Qi army; they just wanted to avenge Zhao Gongming, and their target was only the spellcaster, Luyaa Daoist Immortal. Except for Jiang Ziya who might be implicated, all other people wouldn’t be affected.”","“Anyway, Luya Daoist Immortal had just helped the West Qi army. The others couldn’t just sit and watch as they killed him, right?” Xichi Spiritual Master from the Nanhua Faction waved her whisk and joined the debate in front of the West Qi army.","As the topic went on, a heated discussion erupted among the large group of viewers who watched the TV Series together.","They offered different opinions one after another.","“Then, whose fault is it?” Fairy Qing Yun had always been mild and cool. However, seeing the","Three Sky Fairies from the Three Immortal Island ending up like this despite their great strength, she couldn’t remain calm. They lived a free and relaxed life in the Three Immortal Island, searching for truth in Dao and Immortality. Why did they come here and mess with the sect masters and shout that they would deal with the two sect masters as they had done with the Golden Immortals?”","They even threatened to break the sect masters’ heads by using the Golden Dragon Scissors and Chaos Essence Gold Dipper. After they issued such a threat and no one could dissuade them, they will certainly receive a good beating!” As a faction master, Xue Daolv could relate to the two sect masters in the TV Series.","If that little Xiao Yulv dares to threaten me, I would certainly make sure that he couldn’t see tomorrow’s sun!","At this moment, Xiao Yulv standing behind the counter sneezed for no reason. He glanced around in confusion, “Achoo! Who’s talking about me?”","Its all because of Zhao Gongmings pathetic death!” Jiang Xiaoyue joined the discussion in a huff, The three Sky Fairies must have been beside themselves with fury. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have come out of their island to take a part in this business. How come no one could dissuade them otherwise?”","“Luya Daoist Immortal is to blame! By now, he has slipped away! He must be the one!” Mo Xian and other disciples of Nanhua Faction got an idea and said while pointing at the sly Daoist.","“But...” Many people were still on the side of the good officials and people in Morning Song. After all, some of them were civilians and small aristocrats. If not for Luya Daoist Immortal, the","army wouldn’t be able to reach Morning Song!”","“Who is to blame for the deaths of Three Sky Fairies?” The heated debate finally returned to the original question.","“Who is to blame?!”","“West Qi!”","“Zhao Gongming!”","“Luya Daoist Immortal...”","“Definitely the two sect masters!”","In the group, there were grand cultivators, faction masters, members of the Demon Clan, and cultivators with unorthodox practices.","Since they had different backgrounds, their perspectives were different. If 1,000 people watched Investiture of the Gods, 1,000 different understandings would appear. Before the episode was over, the big group of people was engaged in","a heated debate even fiercer than the war between West Qi and Yin Shang on the battleground!","“Zhao Gongming is to blame!”","“What did you say?!” While rolling up her sleeves, Ning Si glared around and revealed a small part of her two silver shiny fangs. She looked as if she would explode the head of the person who just","spoke.","cold.","As she glanced around, the independent cultivator in Half City who had shouted that Zhao Gongming was to blame shrunk his neck.","“Humph!” The weak cultivator with the cultivation strength of the True Lake Realm was beneath her notice. She glanced at another weak warrior who yelled Grand Preceptor Wen, and the latter","shrunk his body as well, afraid that the Demonic Woman would beat him.","Divine Ocean Realm; he probably would get his head broken after getting offline.","At this moment, a sneer came from one side. “Haha! Do you think that you are powerful by bullying these viewers with negative combat strength?! I don’t agree! Today, I will speak for the people and dead officials on the side of Yin Shang!”","A smirk face emoji squeezed out from the crowd and looked like a troll. He yelled smugly, “I said it! Come and beat me if you can!”","In the Half City Shop, a girl put down her virtual reality headset and stood up. ‘You, a demon, care","about people and good officials?! I’ll see what a troll you are!”","“Ah-! Ahyaya-! Sir! Someone’s beating people! Someone’s beating people!”","“Beating a smirk face emoji doesn’t count as beating people. Hehe.” Mr. Fang continued to watch the TV Series.","“Ah-! Ahya! Where’s the lightning punishment?! Where are the rules?!”","At this moment...","[The System has finished upgrading. The Host’s privileges have been increased.]","Mr. Fang glances at it and said casually, “I make the rules.”","“Ahyayayaya! I won’t troll anymore! Heroine forgive me! Hero! Forgive me! Wayaya—!”","While the viewers were fiercely debating and even fighting over the deaths of immortals from the fie Sect without a result, a Daoist riding on a tiger appeared on the screen.","Before the Daoist was a heroic-looking young man dressed in an Eight-Trigram purple belted immortal robe with a Water-Fire Bell in his hand. He was walking down the mountain.","At this moment, the Daoist came out from the forest behind him riding on the tiger. He said with a smile, Your Highness, please wait!”","The big group of viewers suddenly turned quiet and looked at this person. “Huh-!?”","“Huh-!?”","This person?!” The people who had been yelling all widened their eyes as if they had just discovered something...","They stopped arguing and stared at this person.","How come this scene looks so familiar!?"]},{"number":918,"title":"Chapter 918 - Who’s This Person Named Kong Xuan?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, the Daoist with a white face and a long beard walked toward Yin Hong and bowed. Yin Hong received him with the greeting for a senior and asking, “Senior Daoist, can I have your name please?”","The Daoist said, “Your master and I are from the same sect. We are both from the Jade Void Palace.”","Yin Hong asked, “Uncle-Master, what’s your name? What teachings do you have for me today?”","“I’m Shen Gongbao.” The Daoist didn’t give more information. Instead, he asked, “Where are you going?”","...","“He’s Yin Hong?!” The viewers looked at the heroic-looking young man. After Queen Jiang was killed, Yin Hong, the second prince, almost died as well. With great efforts, he escaped and would have died long ago if not for the help of an immortal.","By now, he had learned many techniques and even brought all the spiritual treasures from Chijing Zi’s cave abode, including the Yin-Yang Mirror and Purple Belted Immortal Garment with him. The viewers had seen the great powers of these treasures!","“Whoa! He can finally go and avenge the murder of his mother!” The viewers were excited when they saw that the desolate Second Prince had finally grown up. “I’ll see if Daji dares to walk all over him again!”","...","The viewers watched as Yin Hong answered, “At my master’s order, I’m going to West Qi to help them fight King Zhou.”","With a sincere expression, Shen Gongbao demanded, “Nonsense! Who is King Zhou to you?!”","Yin Hong said, “He’s my father.”","The Daoist yelled, “In the whole world, I’ve never heard of a case where a son helped others to fight his father. Besides, if King Wu succeeded in defeating King Zhou with your help, and your ancestors’ shrine was destroyed with your nation being taken by others, would you dare to face your ancestors the day of your you death?”","“Hiss... it seems like he have a point...?” At this moment, Su Tianji and others nodded. “Shen Gongbao has a point...”","Yin Hong thought so too, and he looked hesitant. Then, he shook his head and said, “But I swore to my master that if I went back on my word, my limbs would be turned to dust. Besides... my master saved my life and gave me all my abilities...”","Shen Gongbao interrupted him with a laugh, “In the whole world, I’ve never heard of anyone’s physical body had been turned into dust. How can this oath hold true? Listen to me and change your mind; go and fight Zhou instead, and you’ll surely create great accomplishment one day, which will be a comfort to the spirits of your ancestors and my sincere attitude.”","“...” With the Water-Fire Bell in hand and draped in Eight-Trigram Purple Belted Immortal Garment, Yin Hong turned around and went to fight Zhou in high spirits.","“This...!?”","“This guy...!?”","Everyone stared at the scene dumbfoundedly. “What’s happening???”","“You forget about your mother’s murder?!”","...","Before long, the viewers saw Crown Prince Yin Jiao leaving the Nine-Immortal Mountain and going to West Qi by traveling through the earth. As he went, a light beam floated onto a high mountain.","A Daoist came over, riding one a tiger.","“Your Highness, please wait.”","Obviously, Yin Jiao had taken the oath that if he changed his mind, he would be killed by a shovel and a hoe.","Shen Gongbao just smiled and said, “With your great strength, how can you be killed by shovel and a hoe?”","“...”","– Three minutes later –","The viewers watched as Crown Prince Yin Jiao, equipped with twin swords, Desolate Bell, and Sky-Turning Stamp that Guangcheng Zi had given to him, went to fight Zhou with heroic spirits.","People like Su Tianji, Jiang Xiaoyue, and Gu Tingyun exchanged a look...","“???”","“How come this guy is also going to fight Zhou!?”","“What’s...happening?!”","...","After a while, the viewers saw a dwarf playing on a cliff in front of the Flying Cloud Cave in Dragon Trapping Mountain. He was Tu Xingsun, the disciple of Ju Liusun, one of the 12 Golden Immortals.","He was about to leave when a Daoist rode out on a tiger. This time, the Daoist’s skill seemed to be even better. He said, “Daoist Friend, please wait.”","“...” People like Su Tianji, the elders, faction masters, and Gu Tingyun all stared at the scene intently as if they were afraid to miss any tiny details.","-Five minutes later –","They watched as Tu Xingsun stole the Immortal-Trapping Rope and a jade bottle of pills from his master and then went to Three-Mountain Fortress to fight Zhou...","“This... This... This...!?”","“This man...!?” Everyone stared at Shen Gongbao in puzzlement.","On the screen, Shen Gongbao stroked his short beard. “Hehehe...”","Then, they saw the following scenes:","Yin Hong was turned into dust inside the Tai Chi Scroll, realizing the oath.","Yin Jiao was trapped in the mountain, and then Guangcheng Zi pushed a shovel and a hoe up to the mountain with an expression of pain.","Tu Xingsun got the top half of his body cut off. Of course, this would happen much later.","“Whoa-!” Even Gu Tingyun yelled in surprise, “This man... This-?!”","What’s happened-!?","Everyone looked at each other as if they had discovered something extraordinary.","After they finished today’s episodes, they all went back to watch the scenes when the immortals made their entrances in the TV Series. For example, the part when the Three Sky Fairies left the island...","In Three Immortal Island, mist and clouds leisurely floated among the tall and green pine trees. The floating auspicious mist and clouds filled the gate with green pines standing on both sides. Logs were paved on the bridge as ivies grew all over the big boulders.","Then, sure enough, a Daoist riding on a tiger came...","He yelled at the gate of the cave abode, “Daoist Friends...”","“!!??”","Everyone exchanged a look of horror. As if they had discovered a huge secret, they exclaimed, “Sir! What powerful Daoist spell did this man use?!”","Standing up immediately, Su Tianji ran to Mr. Fang and dragged him over to her computer. While pointing at the screen, she yelled in astonishment, “Can we learn this-!?”","Hearing her words, everyone looked over and stared at Mr. Fang. “Sir! I want to learn it too!”","“Ah! I want to learn it as well!” Even Jiang Xiaoyue skipped over.","“Um... Um...” Mr. Fang said solemnly, “This is a primeval forbidden spell. It depends on your fortune if you can learn it or not.","“If one has the fortune, even a ten-year-old kid can learn it with ease.” Mr. Fang looked at Jiang Xiaoyue when he said these words.","“Ya! Do you mean I have the fortune?!” Jiang Xiaoyue beamed happily.","“I mean...” Mr. Fang said solemnly, “You, a little girl, would even help your enemy count the money that they earned from selling you. How can you learn that?!”","“Scummy shop owner!” Jiang Xiaoyue stomped her foot in fury. “You’re the one who would count money for your enemy after you were sold!”","Then, Mr. Fang continued, “If one doesn’t have the fortune, the can’t learn it even if they were a faction master or an elder.”","As he said the words, he glanced at Su Tianji.","Huh!? Su Tianji was secretly pleased. A moment ago, the scummy shop owner looked at Xiaoyue when he talked about the people who could learn this skill, but it turned out that Xiaoyue can’t learn it. Now, he is looking at me as he is talking about the people who can’t learn it... does he mean the opposite again...!?","Su Tianji said in delight, “Does it mean I can...!?”","“You can learn the opposite skill.”","“...” @ Damn it!","“Then, who can learn it?!”","Mr. Fang shrugged.","“But...” At this moment, Gu Tingyun said, “After the powerful Three Sky Fairies died and Grand Preceptor Wen died at Dragon-Ending Ridge, Shen Gongbao can only trick people away from the Chan Sect. I guess Yin Shang will soon come to its end. Right?”","At this moment, someone yelled, “The trailer for tomorrow’s episodes is out! Kong Xuan blocked the army at Golden Rooster Ridge!”","Everyone froze and then looked at Mr. Fang while asking, “Who’s this person named Kong Xuan?! Is he even more powerful than the Three Sky Fairies!?"]},{"number":919,"title":"Chapter 919 - Five-Colored Godly Light!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, with the aid from the saint-level masters in the West Continent who had ascended to the Godly Realm with the Valkyrie’s feathers, the shop clerk, Grand Mage Merlin, opened a branch shop of the Arcade Game Hall in the Godly Realm.","The five repeating tasks of earning crystals had obtained obvious progress with the sales of the mobile games such as Journey to the War and Fantasy Westward Journey. As the new arcade game hall was opened in the Godly Realm, the task was close to completion for the first round.","As they collected all kinds of array materials in the Heavenly Realm, they were also planning to build portals to connect the two realms and thus restore the world to the prosperity that people had enjoyed in the ancient times.","...","In the shops, the discussion about Investiture of the Gods and the content of tomorrow’s episodes continued.","It must be noted that the Three Sky Fairies had defeated all the disciples of the Chan Sect and forced the Chan Sect Master to make a move. Otherwise, they couldn’t continue with the process of the investiture of the gods.","Their strength was so powerful that they forced the sect masters to show up.","Are there people more powerful than that?!","This legend was indeed stunning. The viewers couldn’t imagine what super powerful skills could be better than the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array.","The viewers didn’t take the three sect masters into consideration since those existences had been born in extremely distant times when hundun was first separated, and their power went beyond the viewers’ imaginations.","But this Kong Xuan...?","“Xiaoyue, what powerful skills do you think Kong Xuan will use tomorrow?!” Right now, a large group of people sat on the couches and talked among themselves.","“I have no idea...” Jiang Xiaoyue furrowed her brows, feeling like she had been thinking so much that her head hurt.","“I think he must have many miraculous spiritual treasures!” Shen Qingqing said, “Chijing Zi was no match for his disciple after he gave the latter all his spiritual treasures. Perhaps Kong Xuan has even better spiritual treasures and isn’t even afraid of the sect masters!”","“I think that he might have an array even more powerful than the previous ones!” After some consideration, Nalan Hongwu said, “The Nine-Turn Yellow River Array was built in half a month with hundreds of soldiers. If someone put more effort and built an even more powerful array, perhaps it can even trap the sect masters?!”","“It can’t be that powerful!” Su Tianji disagreed, “How can anyone be as powerful as the Three Sky Fairies from the Three Immortal Islands?!”","The Primeval Lord of Heaven took the accusation of being a bully when he showed his hand. Even the sect masters didn’t want to be branded with such a bad name.","If the new person was even more powerful than the Three Sky Fairies, would the Primeval Lord of Heaven be so cheeky as to show his hand again?!","“I’m sure that he’s not as powerful as the Three Sky Fairies!” Su Tianji emphasized. Otherwise, this sect master would be too ashamed if he made another move. However, if he doesn’t show up, the investiture of the gods would come to a dead end!","...","In the lounge area of the shop, whenever one group of customers left, a new group would arrive. By midnight, many groups of customers had sat in this area and then left, but the topic remained the same.","When the TV Series was broadcast on the big screen at 8 PM, many civilians living nearby would come and watch this weird but grand legend even though they would obtain no benefits from it.","Some people even stayed in the shop until the closing time. On the early morning of the next day, people would stand before the door in heated discussions.","Obviously, the people in this world liked this ancient legend more than others. The only other legend that had aroused such passion was Journey to the West.","On the morning of the next day, as soon as Mr. Fang opened the door, figures swarmed in around him, hurrying into the shop.","“Hurry! Let’s watch the new episodes!” Su Tianji beckoned at her disciples and clicked on Investiture of the Gods quickly.","Jiang Xiaoyue and the others sat in a row and clicked on it immediately as well.","Even the elves in the West Continent looked eager.","At Jiang Ziya’s command, the army marched toward Morning Song like a long snake. At this moment, Yin Shang had come to the end of its reign and couldn’t find any troops to block its enemies. However, at this moment, an army of about 100,000 soldiers was stationed on the Golden Rooster Ridge, and their flags blocked the sun!","With great magnificence, the leader of the army rode out on a red horse while carrying a big saber. With five-colored light behind him, his eyes looked as bright as burning flames or the light of the sun and moon right after the sky was separated from the earth!","Dressed in gold armor that was as bright as fire, this man was Kong Xuan!","His magnificence induced a wave of exclamations the moment that he made his appearance. In addition, the five-colored light behind him spread out.","Teal, yellow, red, white, and black! The fine light beams spread all over the world, and even Heaven seemed to shake under the force!","“Is... this guy... Kong Xuan!?”","No one had expected that Yin Shang, which was on the verge of collapse, could have such a grand master!","Right now, Jiang Ziya’s camp had grandmasters such as Nata, Yang Jian, and Leizhenzi, military geniuses such as Huang Tianhua and Deng Jiugong, and even powerful immortals such as Lamp-Burning Daoist who had obtained much more power than before!","Lamp-Burning Daoist now had the ultimate treasure, Ocean Settling Bead, that Zhao Gongming had used to defeat the 12 Golden Immortals. His mount was the Golden Feather Roc that he had just tamed. Right now, his power was probably greater than those of the 12 Golden Immortals when they were in their prime, moving closer to his final form as Buddha Dipamkara.","When the West Qi army spread out in a line, it was a grand sight.","Out of the 100,000 soldiers of Yin Shang that were stationed at Golden Rooster Ridge, only one man rode forward as the five-colored godly light rose!","At this moment, everyone saw a scene that went beyond their imagination!","Countless soldiers and generals including Nata and Leizhenzi...","All kinds of powerful spiritual treasures including Ocean-Settling Bead and Golden Pot...","All the godly beasts and rare beasts...","All of them vanished instantly like dust entering the ocean without a ripple!","When the Western Sect’s Second Master, Zhunti Daoist, came, he was also turned into nothing when the light touched him!","“This... what superpower is the five-colored light behind Kong Xuan?!” Seeing this, everyone yelled in horror!","What the heck is this superpower?!","This is a sect master!","He was taken just like this?!","“Sir!” All the people in the shops including Su Tianji, Gu Tingyun, and the ancestor from the East Continent were stupefied. Su Tianji pointed at the screen and said, “How come this guy is more powerful than a sect master?!”","...","Of course, Kong Xuan couldn’t really defeat the Western Sect’s Second Master, Zhunti Daoist.","For the viewers in this world, this was a legend from another land. They were enthralled by the great powers exhibited by the immortals, but they loved the characters in this legend more than anything else, regardless if they were protagonists or antagonists.","Each of the characters was vivid and lively with their own unique personalities.","They stood proud and powerful in the world. They were the heroes of this era. Like stars in the sky, they lit up the nightly sky with flames of war during the final tribulation!","In this most horrifying catastrophe, they emitted the most radiant starlight!","“Now... Kong Xuan got defeated by the Western Sect’s Second Master...”","The viewers exchanged a look. “Then, no one can block West Qi’s army against King Zhou, right?”"]},{"number":920,"title":"Chapter 920 - Immortal-Slaying Sword Array... The Descendance of gods and demons!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Now... even Kong Xuan was defeated by the Western Sect’s Second Master...”","The viewers exchanged a look. “Then, no one can block the West Qi army from defeating King Zhou...?”","However, they saw the title of the next episode, “Immortal-Slaying at Border-Sign Fortress!?”","“What’s Immortal-Slaying?!” Obviously, there was one more episode today. Eagerly, the members of Mr. Fang’s group tour in Investiture of the Gods began to talk among themselves.","They saw a major array at the Border Sign Fortress before them!","Red light engulfed the Heaven and Earth where the array was. Knowing members of the Chan Sect were here, Duobao Daoist cast a Palm Thunder from his hand and dispersed the red light, revealing the array.","It was as the poem explained:","[Not made of copper, iron, or steel, it was once concealed below Mount Xumi;","Not refined repeatedly with Yin and Yang, its blade was sharpened by water and fire.","Immortal-Slaying Sword is sharp, Immortal-Butchering Sword is deadly, and red lights rose when Immortal-Trapping Sword is launched;","With miraculous variations, Immortal-Exterminating Sword makes Daluo Golden Immortals soak in blood!]","Previously, only the disciples of the Jie Sect showed their powers, but the Jie Sect Master had never showed his hand. But this time, the Jie Sect Master, Sect Master Tongtian finally showed his hand!","[TL Note: Tongtian means heaven-connecting in Chinese.]","In the Immortal-Slaying Array, as the golden bell rang, a pair of flags moved to the sides and revealed Sect Master Tongtian sitting on the Grand Bull flanked by disciples of different generations.","Outside the array, the Primeval Lord of Heaven sat in the middle flanked by his disciples. At noon, auspicious clouds appeared above the Primeval Lord of Heaven’s head. From his jade headpiece with dangling pearls, countless golden flowers rose up, illuminating the whole place.","Previously, the viewers thought that the sect master had bullied the disciples from the other sect. Right now, seeing the two sect masters were going to go head-to-head, they almost screamed silently!","They had never imagined that they could watch a battle on this level!","Following him into the Immortal-Slaying Array, the viewers watched as the Primeval Lord of Heaven stood on the Agarwood Carriage with his hand on the Flight Chair.","A sword was hung on the Immortal-Slaying Gate of the array, and its name was the Immortal-Slaying Sword.","The Primeval Lord of Heaven patted his carriage, and tens of thousands of golden lotus flowers instantly hovered in the air. Sitting on the flowers, the Primeval Lord of Heaven flew in through the gate of the Immortal-Slaying Array.","This series of technique and powers were dizzy to watch. On the day when the Primeval Lord of Heaven broke the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array, he didn’t show any of his abilities. Today, people began to realize that ‘The Dao of Jie Sect and Chan Sect are both orthodox. The two sects both deserve their great reputation!’","At this moment, Sect Master Tongtian launched a Palm Thunder which shook a sword. Then, the sword cut off a lotus flower from the Primeval Lord’s head!","“My goodness–!” The viewers exclaimed.","Everyone looked at this scene in horror. Even Though Sect Master Tongtian had the advantage of the array, they were still shocked by his great power; he even cut off a lotus flower from a sect master whom they regarded as unrivaled.","They were extremely horrified that even the Chan Sect Master couldn’t retreat from this ultimate array unscathed. They had never looked so horrified before!","It felt as if they weren’t facing an array, but an... abyss with countless tribulations!","When the Primeval Lord of Heaven got out of the array, almost everyone was drenched in cold sweat of fear. They shivered involuntarily!","Then, they saw Laozi enter the array.","Three strikes of essence dashed out of his head and turned into Three Pure Ones. Laozi began to battle Sect Master Tongtian.","Then, bells sounds came from the east as a Daoist rode over on a beast. Wearing the Nine Cloud Hat and a bright red silk robe with white crane patterns, he held a sword in his hand and sang, “Since hundun, Dao has taken the priority. Constant possession is constant nothing, which shows the way of nature. Traveling 30,000 li on purple essence from the east, it’s been 5,000 years since I traveled through Han Fortress.”","“Daoist Brother Li! I’m here to give you a hand!”","This was High Pure Daoist!","Bell sounds came from the south when a Daoist rode over on a heavenly horse. Wearing the Ruyi Hat and a pale-yellow robe with Eight-Trigram patterns, he had a Ganoderma Ruyi in his hand and sang, “Coming out Han Fortress and reaching Kunlun, every tribe now belongs to the Dao factions. Living as long as the Heaven and Earth, my spirit will still live on after Mount Xumi collapses.”","“Daoist Brother Li! I’ll help you subdue Daoist Tongtian.”","This was Jade Pure Daoist!","Then, the viewers saw a Daoist wearing the Nine Sky Hat and an Eight-Treasure Longevity Purple Cloud Robe. He rode over on an Earth Lion, and he had a Dragon Whisker Fan in one hand and the Three Treasure Jade Ruyi in the other!","This was Vital Pure Daoist!","“This is...!?” All the cultivators and warriors felt like a huge force was going to erupt in their hearts like a volcano.","This shocking force hammered their hearts like drums.","“They are... the Three Pure Ones!?” Everyone looked horrified.","Naturally, they knew about the Three Pure Ones. In the Legend of Sword and Fairy which gave them the deepest impression, the Three Pure Palace in Shu Mountain worshipped these three figures, the loftiest deities in Daoism!","But they had been summoned by one person!","One essence turned into Three Pure Ones!","The Three Pure Ones each had skills and strength as powerful as those of Laozi! At this moment, everyone felt the chaotic pure essence coming from the beginning of the world. It was the earliest and most horrifying presence in the world.","Not able to think, the viewers could do nothing but worship their super-powerful techniques and strength.","The three sect masters might have different power levels, but a battle like this...","“How come you’re watching on your knees...!?” Suddenly, a voice howled! They almost wept in fear!","...","“Laozi is so powerful-!” Even though the array hadn’t been broken yet, Sect Master Tongtian was hit by the crutch three times. The beating happened in the horrifying Immortal-Slaying Array.","Not only the cultivators and warriors but also the elves felt dizzy, thinking that every character in the TV Series was powerful.","How can so many horrifying masters appear in this place at the same time!?","Valkyrie Isabela who watched the scene on the big screen felt even more horrified.","Fortunately, she hadn’t recovered yet. Otherwise, she would have been paralyzed by fear and dropped back into the pool.","“This Tongtian, Laozi, Primeval Lord of Heaven... how come they are so horrifyingly powerful!?” She yelled in the pool with hair standing on end while cold sweat appeared on her forehead. “Where the heck is this place...!? It’s so terrifying!”","As a goddess who was born before the Heavens, she never knew what fear was after she was born.","But now, she felt it strongly!","The fear was heartfelt.","Then, it turned into unspeakable awe.","Awe for the Heaven, Earth, mortals, and deities!","Perhaps it was the first time that she had this feeling ever since she became a goddess!","...","“This Sect Master Tongtian is so powerful!” The viewers yelled in shock.","Although his strength wasn’t as great as those of Laozi, his array was so powerful that even Laozi couldn’t break it until four sect masters combined forces!","“Can we learn this array-!?” Su Tianji exclaimed.","“Can you learn it even if you have the chance?” Mr. Fang rolled his eyes at her. “Silly.”","“It seems like I can’t learn it...” Then, she glared back at him. “You’re the silly one!”","I’m only a bit lazy, not silly!","“Don’t slander me!”","“...”","...","– At this moment –","At the Demon-Slaying Platform in Innumerable-Immortal Sea, many immortals gathered with flags flapping in the wind!","-In Gods’ Palace-","Golden light gathered as the gods stood proudly between Heaven and Earth!","In the endless darkness at Nine-Fold Darkness, tens of thousands of demons lowered their heads as horrifying dark gods woke up in the primeval tombs.","“Once I descend to the mortal world... Heaven and Earth will submit to me...!”","“Our plans that have lasted tens of millions of years can finally be accomplished...!”","“The mortal world will be the battleground...! Even if we have to destroy the Heaven and Earth and crush this world, we must seize that ultimate holy item of fortune...!”","“I’ll...be eternal!”"]},{"number":921,"title":"Chapter 921 - Sect Master Tongtian’s Teacher?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Of course, the people in the shops were oblivious to the things happening outside their world. Each day, they just got online to play games and watch TV Series after doing their daily work. Some lazy people were even ignorant of the things happening nearby.","Spending each day on cultivation and the management of the shops, Mr. Fang naturally was always busy.","Today, he had completed the first round of tasks for earning crystals. With most of his time spent on the planning of the next-stage mobile games with Nalan Mingxue, he didn’t have time to mind other things.","When he had time, he would glance at the System Interface and found that the task progress increased at a swift and steady speed. “The people in the Immortal Realm and Godly Realm... are really loaded!?”","“I think we can activate the War between Nations in Journey to the War,” Mr. Fang said, “This should be very profitable!”","...","The atmosphere in the shops remained the same.","Some cultivators such as Su Tianji and An Huwei were busily gathering materials for the creation of array blueprints or learning super powerful spiritual spells.","Furthermore, they must watch the TV Series each day.","“Isn’t Investiture of the Gods going to end soon?!” The viewers waited eagerly for the end, but at the same time, they wished that the end wouldn’t come so soon. After all, this mythical TV Series enriched their daily lives.","In Investiture of the Gods, a few powerful spiritual treasures could enable weak cultivators to skip countless levels and obstacles of cultivation strength and even defeat Golden Immortals.","An array built by a group of mortals could make gods and immortals lose all their spiritual energy. Trapped in the array, the immortals couldn’t use any of their superpowers and could do nothing but wait for death. The viewers had never heard of such things before.","All kinds of techniques and skills made them feel dizzy. The super powerful abilities, such as the Five-Colored Godly Light and Head-Nailing Seven Arrow Book, could either shake Heaven and Earth or kill people without a trace in a strange way.","...","In the early morning, a group of people began to talk about it again with bowls of instant noodles or cups of Cappuccino in their hands.","“Now that Sect Master Tongtian’s powerful Immortal-Slaying Array has been broken, does it mean that the Jie Sect has been defeated!?”","“Do you think this Sect Master Tongtian has more powerful skills?!” Nalan Mingxue guessed, “I feel like things would look too easy if Sect Master Tongtian was defeated just like that.”","“No...” Song Qingfeng was startled by her speculation. “Class President, the Immortal-Slaying Array is so powerful already... How can anything be more powerful than that?!”","It must be noted that the Immortal-Slaying Array was only broken by the combined forces of four sect masters. It was much more powerful than the previous Ten Ultimate Arrays or the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array, and it had even cut off a lotus flower from such a mighty figure as the Primeval Lord of Heaven!","How can any technique be more powerful than that?!","However, when they entered the new episode that was released today, they saw the title...","“Three Sects meet at the Innumerable-Immortal Array?!”","“The Innumerable-Immortal Array?!” They exchanged a look...","“What array is that?!” Is it more powerful than the Immortal-Slaying Array?!","Immediately, they clicked on today’s new episode and watched it eagerly.","This time, almost all the immortals gathered before the Innumerable-Immortal Array, including Guangcheng Zi, Chijing Zi, Manjushri Lord of Heaven, Samantabhadra Immortal, and Cihang Daoist. Although the Jade Void Palace was no longer as powerful as before, the disciples of the Jade Void Palace still weren’t weak.","Opposite to them, vast mist and clouds scattered with a thunder, revealing the Innumerable-Immortal Array.","The viewers looked closer and saw five-colored golden light mingling with the mist and clouds. Groups of immortals stood densely in the mountains and oceans of clouds and looked endless in one glance.","They were hermit masters in the Heaven and Earth who were proficient with profound and complex spiritual spells and extraordinary superpowers.","The previous Nine-Turn Yellow River Array built by 600 mortal soldiers had made the 12 Golden Immortals fall into the dust. The current array was built by Sect Master Tongtian and supported by tens of thousands of immortals; how powerful would it be?!","More miraculous was that the Innumerable-Immortal Array contained many major arrays such as the Tai Chi Array, Yin Yang Array, and Four Direction Array which closely connected with each other. In addition, the rare treasure, Six-Soul Flag, fluttered and could damage any godly soul!","At this moment, the Primeval Lord of Heaven, Laozi, and the Two Sages of Western Sect had all come to the camp of the West Qi army. Even though the Innumerable-Immortal Array was much more powerful than the Immortal-Slaying Array, how could it survive under the combined forces of four sect masters?","The viewers watched as the four sect masters broke Sect Master Tongtian’s Innumerable-Immortal Array. Some of the immortals surrendered to the Western Sect, some escaped, and some were killed. Wudang Saint Mother left when she saw that the array would collapse, Shen Gongbao left as well, and Vairocana Immortal submitted to the Western Sect.","Sect Master Tongtian was disgraced when he was left with only about 300 independent immortals.","No one could stop a new era from arriving, not even the powerful Sect Master Tongtian. His Jie Sect now had fallen apart. The viewers felt regretful at this sight and heaved a sigh of relief, knowing that the corrupted Shang Dynasty would soon collapse.","In history, no dynasty could last forever, and Yin Shang was no exception. The dynasties all had their cycle of prosperity, decline, beginning, and end, just like people would inevitably experience birth, aging, sicknesses, and death.","The Heavenly Dao is constant and will not make any exceptions for anyone, regardless if it was Yao or Jie.","[TL Note: these two are ancient emperors in China.]","This huge catastrophe involving three realms and immortals, gods, and mortals finally came to an end.","At this moment, viewers such as Su Tianji, Gu Tingyun, and the ones in the West Continent suddenly saw auspicious clouds rise in the south. A Daoist came from the endless auspicious essence and rare fragrance who had a bamboo stick in his hand.","He sang the hymn, “Sleeping in the high ninth layer of clouds, I understood true Dao on a futon. Across the Heaven and Earth, I’m the almighty master. Pan Gu created Tai Chi which gave birth to Yin and Yang and then four directions; I passed Dao to three disciples, and two of them created Chan Sect and Jie Sect. They are leaders of Dao sects, all coming from Hongjun.”","“Who’s this guy!?” Su Tianji looked at the Daoist. “Is... Investiture of the Gods not over yet?!”","“He’s another sect master?!” Hearing the hymn, the viewers felt like this entity’s position was not inferior than that of Sect Master Tongtian.","But why was he never mentioned before?! Besides, in this world, the major sects included only the three sects and the Western Sect, right?","At this moment, Sect Master Tongtian hurried forward to greet him. Dropping to his knees, Sect Master Tongtian said, “I hope that Teacher can live forever! I didn’t know that you would come and thus couldn’t welcome you earlier. Please forgive me, Teacher!”","“Te... Teacher?!”","“An existence such as Sect Master Tongtian has a... teacher!?”","More astonishing was that even the Primeval Lord of Heaven and Laozi all called him Teacher?!"]},{"number":922,"title":"Chapter 922 - Investiture of the Gods!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The TV Series, Investiture of the Gods, finally came to an end.","When Daoist Hongjun came, the viewers realized that, when the three sect masters greeted each other by calling each other ‘Daoist brother’, it wasn’t a friendly gesture but that they were indeed brothers under one master! Now that the truth came out, the viewers had to believe what they had deemed impossible!","It turned out that the heaven-shaking war between immortals of the two sects was a conflict between brothers from one master!?","How powerful is this master?!","After Daoist Hongjun came, everything was settled. He reprimanded Sect Master Tongtian for his leniency on his disciples. As the creator of the Gods’ Investiture List, Sect Master Tongtian entered the fray and knew nothing but killing, not making peace for the immortals of his sect. On the other hand, Daoist Hongjun ordered the Primeval Lord of Heaven and Laozi to retreat and restrain from fighting in the future. Finally, they each returned to their own mountains to develop their own sects.","Su Daji and the other two demons from Xuanyuan Tomb were decapitated, and King Zhou set himself on fire in the Star-Plucking Tower. The Shang Dynasty was over, and the Zhou Dynasty succeeded it.","At this moment, the investiture of the gods began.","On the Gods’ Investiture Platform, stars lit up one by one as immortals stood in rows. Jiang Ziya held the jade talisman and golden book in his hands. After placing the talisman on the desk, he stood in the middle of the platform with a yellow flag in his left hand and the God-Thrashing Whip in the right hand. Pure Fortune God Bo Jian guarding the Gods’ Investiture Platform stood below the altar, waiting for orders.","“Bo Jian, can you hang the Gods’ Investiture List under the platform? Gods must come in order and can’t make a move without permission.”","The moment that he said those words, winds and shadows moved above the Gods’ Investiture Platform as if countless immortal souls were summoned!","“This... isn’t it the scene in the trailer?!” the viewers exclaimed.","“The Gods’ Investiture List is out!”","“So, this is the Gods’ Investiture List...!?”","Everyone was elated when they saw this scene since they were going to witness a huge event that had never happened since Heaven was separated from Earth – Gods’ Investiture!","Everyone trembled in excitement nontribally.","Pure Fortune God Bo Jian who guarded the Gods’ Investiture Platform hung the Gods’ Investiture List below the platform. Then, gods swarmed up and saw that the first one on the list was Bo Jian.","“Who’s Bo Jian? He’s the No. 1 on the list?!”","The viewers were puzzled. “Yeah. He has been guarding the Gods’ Investiture Platform... we didn’t see him in the war between Shang and Zhou...”","Jiang Ziya said, “Bo Jian once was a great general under Yellow Emperor Xuanyuan. He made great achievements in the battle with Chiyou before he died in the North Sea, contributing his life to his nation with commendable loyalty. It is a pity that he had been trapped in a ridge on the seashore! Luckily, he met Jiang Shang who had the mission of gods’ investiture. As a reward for successfully guarding the platform and your loyal soul, you’re granted the position of Pure Fortune Main God leading the eight departments of 365 gods in three realms. Now, show respect toward this command!”","“Emperor Xuanyuan?!”","“Battled with Chi You?!”","“Wasn’t that the origin of this ‘Huaxia’?!”","Obviously, the viewers were very curious about this mysterious and distant nation and were very interested in the legends. Even a few words about the distant history roused great excitement in them.","“Huang Feihu is granted the title of Great Emperor of East Mountain, the first of the five great mountains! He’s given the responsibility of looking after the 18 levels of Hell in the Underworld. Anything related to life, death, and reincarnation of humans, gods, immortals, and ghosts are to be determined by East Mountain!”","“Whoa! General Huang Feihu was granted godhood!”","“Great Emperor of East Mountain! It sounds awesome!”","As godly light lit up on Gods’ Investiture Platform, the viewers cheered. They had watched how this loyal King Wucheng was forced to rebel against Morning Son after King Zhou sexually harassed his wife and caused her death. When King Wucheng died in the battleground, everyone was sad for the loss of this great general.","They were surprised that he was granted the title of Great Emperor of East Mountain after death!","“Awesome!” the viewers exclaimed happily.","“I grant Wen Zhong the title of Ninth Heaven Thunder Lord, leading the 24 officials of the Thunder Department to create clouds and rain and guard the Heaven Immortals!”","“Ya! Grand Preceptor Wen became a god as well!” The viewers exclaimed again. This old official had served two kings and died for the nation. Although he had been on the side of Yin Shang, the viewers had high regard for him.","Besides, the 24 officials of the Thunder Department were the Ten Heavenly Masters who had built the Ten Ultimate Arrays and his previous subordinates.","“Mo Liqing, Mo Lihai, Mo Lishou, and Mo Lihong. The four generals of the Mo Family are granted the titles of the Four Heavenly Kings!”","The viewers exclaimed, “They are the Four Heavenly Kings?!”","As the gods were granted titles, the viewers let out waves of exclamations. They were not startled but touched and excited for a reason that they couldn’t describe.","“So, this is the background of the gods of Huaxia?!”","The 36 Celestial Dippers, 72 Nether Evils, and 28 Constellations were all immortals of the Jie Sect!","Li Jing was also on the list. “This is where the Pagoda-Bearer Devaraja Li come from?”","The viewers watched how the mortals, cultivators, immortals became the 365 Pure Fortune Gods on the Gods’ Investiture List.","“So, this is the story behind the gods that we saw in Journey to the West?!”","There is such a grand legendary story behind them!?","At this moment, complex emotions such as excitement, shock, and joy filled the hearts of the viewers. They were thrilled and touched since they had witnessed how the mortals in the story obtained super powerful strength, and how humans and demons were able to rank among the gods!","They had a different perspective from the viewers in the world where Fang Qi had come from. As cultivators and warriors who were still struggling in the mortal world where the Great Dao was dim and vague, the path of immortality was obscure, and the Heavenly Dao was cut off from them, it was understandable that they were excited, stunned, and inspired by what they had watched!","Look! Those gods in the great land of Huaxia have also cultivated in the mortal world. They had created grand mythical chapters in the mortal world.","It might be the worst era in a catastrophe, but it was also the most glorious era since it created so many heroes!","The four generals of the Mo Family, Ten Heavenly Masters, Grand Preceptor Wen, Three Sky Fairies...","Ten Ultimate Arrays, Nine-Turn Yellow River Array, Five-colored Godly Light...","Ocean-Settling Bead, Immortal Slaying Sword, Heaven-Turning Stamp, Chaos Essence Golden Dipper...","These names were familiar to the viewers while the legend of gods’ investiture had been branded in the minds of these cultivators and warriors.","By now, the images of the gods had been engraved in their heads.","The duties of the gods in the TV Series were not dominating over and suppressing mortals in the Lower Region, but...","For example, the Main God of the Thunder Department had the duty to create rain and clouds to aid the peaceful life and nurture living beings in the world. Following the decree of the Heavens, they would remove the evils and help the good people achieve a saintly reign.","Another example, the Main God of the Fire Department had the duty to monitor and investigate the good and evil doings in the mortal world.","Zhao Gongming, the Dragon-Tiger Mystic Shrine Immortal Master, led the four main gods under him to spread blessings and fortunes to the world...","They came from the mortal world, and now they kept order in one place and protected the mortals.","At this moment, not only the viewers in the shops, but Valkyrie Isabela felt reverent after watching the scenes on the big screen.","“These gods...!?” She had never imagined that there were such gods in another dimension.","With those gods as examples, she suddenly felt the heaviness of her responsibility as a goddess.","Then, she thought about it. “Ya!”","With limbs that didn’t follow her orders, she was still paralyzed in the pool. While harboring great ambitions, she continued to watch the TV Series."]},{"number":923,"title":"Chapter 923 - Gods’ Investiture List Opens; Killing Tribulation Begins!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“So, this is the background story of the gods and immortals in Huaxia...?” The viewers in this world finally reached the end of Investiture of the Gods.","“What about Jiang Ziya?” many people asked.","After all, even Shen Gongbao had been granted the title of East Ocean Water Splitting General.","“What godly title does he get?” many members in the tour group who were watching the TV Series with Mr. Fang asked him in a hurry.","Ignoring what the Chan Sect and Jie Sect had done, Jiang Ziya’s achievement in the gods’ investiture was unprecedented. Although he wasn’t as powerful as the immortals on the Gods’ Investiture List, he had done his best on this journey. During the process, he had almost died and lost his powers several times. For example, in the Ten Ultimate Arrays, he had been in mortal danger with only one hun and one po left.","However, the viewers listened to the investiture of the gods for a long time but didn’t hear his title.","Nalan Mingxue looked at the Gods’ Investiture List and said, “Now that all the 365 main god positions are given out, does it mean that Jiang Ziya won’t be able to become a god?”","“Does it mean...” Su Tianji also said in surprise, “He remains as a mortal?!”","It must be noted that even though Jiang Ziya had cultivated in Kunlun Mountain, it was only a couple dozens of years; he was still a mortal.","“Um...” Mr. Fang said, “Jiang Taigong has no godly title, but he has the God-Thrashing Whip. He is responsible for supervising the gods. Just as the saying goes, ‘Taigong is here, and gods must retreat.’”","[TL Note: Jiang Taigong is another name for Jiang Ziya who is also known as Jiang Shang. Taigong means great grandfather, which is a respectful title given to elders.]","“A mortal can supervise the gods?!” these people had never imagined that a mortal could have the right to supervise gods.","It was unthinkable.","Then, the viewers watched as King Wu of Zhou Dynasty granted titles to the feudatories. The world regained peace as the gods took their different duties. A new era began on this miraculous land.","“Wow-!”","“Awesome!” Not only the viewers in the old shops, but the elves at the West Continent also savored Investiture of the Gods and were reluctant to see it end.","Meanwhile, they were envious that this miraculous land named Huaxia had so many ancient gods and immortals guarding it.","They felt lost as the TV Series came to the end.","However, they were sure that this excellent legend would circulate and be passed down for thousands of years even in this land; it expressed their own beautiful wishes and hopes for immortals and gods.","“I feel uncomfortable at the thought that there’re no more updates to Investiture of the Gods in the future...” Elf Girl Sala said regretfully.","“Yeah.” Elf Queen Kellybel agreed, “I feel a little bit lost.”","“Let’s watch it again.”","“Okay! Okay!” The elves immediately went to watch Investiture of the Gods for the second time.","...","– At this moment –","Mr. Fang checked his task progress.","[Task: Challenger’s Tutorial","Task Reward: The Soul of Lords of Cinder*1, System Upgrade Big Gift Bag*1, 5-day access to the new upgraded system cultivation room]","[Do you want to claim the reward?]","“Yes.”","[System Upgrade Task: Acquire Many Energy Crystals (Completed)*2]","[Do you want to claim the reward?]","“Yes.”","[Do you want to open the System Upgrade Big Gift Bag?]","[Do you want to open the Mythological Gift Bag?]","Mr. Fang clicked on [Yes] to all these questions and opened three gift bags!","Instantly, several purple-golden light beams shot into the sky!","[You obtained item: Sky-Turning Stamp!]","[You obtained item: Chaos Essence Golden Dipper!]","[You obtained item: Ten Ultimate Arrays blueprint!]","[You obtained item: Nine-Turn Yellow River Array blueprint!]","[You obtained item: Advanced Carrier Rock*5, Godly Summon Rock*1!","[You obtained item: Immortal-Slaying Flying Saber!]","[Event Item: Gods’ Investiture List!]","System said, [Gods’ Investiture List can’t be stored in the system storage space. Please find a place to hang it.]","...","– On the Demon-Slaying Platform in Innumerable-Immortal Sea –","Almost 10,000 immortals gathered here. In the name of killing demons in the Lower Region, the eight major families had recruited countless hermit immortals living in the mountains and oceans. With miraculous superpowers, these immortals were a great force for this imminent war!","Furthermore, this expedition to the Lower Region was personally led by the immortal masters and supervised by sages. If necessary, they would reveal the biggest hidden cards in the major families – the primeval sages and saints might even show up!","“The Ultimate Holy Item of Fortune...” A sense of coldness appeared in Wondrous Spell High Holiness’s eyes. “Regardless if it’s true or not, since you dared to have contact with this item, even the demonic gods from the Nine-Fold Darkness can’t protect you!”","Meanwhile, 10,000 godly light beams surged up outside the Gods’ Palace as troops were getting ready for the war. Dressed in a golden suit of armor, the God of Radiant Light Judgement sat on a huge gold dragon.","About ten of the greatest gods who were born before the Heavens and lived in the central godly mountain of the Gods’ Palace now looked at the great army by lowering their heads.","The downfall of the Radiant Light Godly Palace meant the complete rebellion of the lowly humans in the Lower Region. It concerned the reputation of all the gods, and they wouldn’t allow anyone to bring shame to the gods!","“I’m the Godly King of Radiant Light!” A booming and magnificent voice came from the godly palace. “We must show the mortals in the Lower Region the horror of gods’ fury!”","“The ultimate holy item belongs to us!”","When the gods were furious, the whole world would collapse!","Meanwhile, below in the Plane of the Nine-Fold Darkness...","A gloomy voice came from the total darkness. Before it, countless figures were on their knees. Even demonic gods trembled in the deep darkness from which many greedy eyes stared at the mortal world. “Through the endless void, we will enter the vast Heavenly Realm.”","Perhaps in their eyes, mortals were only bugs that they could trample at will. In their eyes, their enemies were only in the Heavenly Realm.","The mortal world was just their battleground!","“I wonder how much of my power can this world withstand?”","This day, at the Yellow Spring Sea outside the harbor of Half City in the Continent of Immortal Relics.","The cultivators at the monitor station on the Heaven-Swallowing Turtle saw winds and clouds surging up in the sky. Huge waves shot up from the dark ocean, and the land beneath their feet shook as if the whole world would collapse!","Above the ocean, mist surged up like a primeval huge mountain. Then, they saw giant shadows slowly emerging from the mist!","In the East Continent, thunder boomed in the sky! Lightning bolts pierced the thick clouds in the Ninth Heaven. As if the heavenly gate was opened, several golden clouds flew out with surging purple essence. Different from the ancient sages who were in seclusion cultivation, these immortal masters were the rulers of the major families. Led by them, members from the eight major immortal families, various elders, and countless masters from overseas immortal mountains gathered together. Above the layers of clouds, figures stood in dense rows with flapping immortal flags. The presence spread all over the Heaven and Earth!","In the ruins of the Radiant Light Godly Nation at the West Continent, countless godly light beams shone on the mortal world like golden light that had separated the Heaven from the Earth. The golden light beams turned almost the whole sky above the vast West Continent golden!","“Look!” In the Canglan City Shop, many people put down their virtual reality headsets in puzzlement and followed the others out of the shop. They looked up and saw that the entire sky and the clouds seemed to be covered in a layer of gold dust!","“What’s happening?!”","“Heavenly and Earthly Phenomenon!” Elder Hyru looked grim. “This is a Heavenly and Earthly Phenomenon... ”","In the new shop at the East Continent, Elder Senior Sister Yu Yin, one of the core disciples of the Heavenly Faction, led a group of disciples out of the shop after watching Investiture of the Gods. They saw groups of immortals standing outside the shop as murderous presence swept across the land and murderous shouts resonated in the sky.","The whole shop was tightly surrounded!","“Where’s the owner of this place?! Hand over the item that you’re not supposed to touch, and we’ll let you die in one piece!” a voice boomed in the sky like a clap of thunder. It was from the Wonderous Spell High Holiness.","He had been defeated last time. But this time, he had immortal masters behind him! He had primeval sages of immortal families behind him!","Murderous presence swept across the streets outside the shop as the temperature dropped to zero. The whole place became chilly with murderous spirits!","“You people repeatedly invade our territory in the mortal world. Considering that it is hard to obtain your cultivation strengths, I’ve let you go several times,” a voice sounded from the shop. Different from the mild tone in the past, this time, the voice was full of murderous spirit. “You don’t show any repentance. Do you really think that you won’t experience killing tribulations in the mortal world?!”","“Gods’ Investiture List! Open!”","The killing tribulation began!","A bright golden light fell from the sky!","Stars moved as if they carried primeval essence. The chaotic sky opened as a huge stone tablet on a round platform appeared on the top of Phoenix-Cry Mountain in the Continent of Phoenix-Cry Mountain. It pointed at the vast sky like a sharp sword!","In the dazzling light, three huge ancient golden words on the tablet illuminated the Heaven and Earth!","The Heaven and Earth shook violently as if they were answering to its appearance!","A figure walked out of the shop. Everyone looked up and saw clouds gathering and immortal light floating in the sky while several golden seal-script-style words appeared beyond the sky.","[Gods’ Investiture List!]"]},{"number":924,"title":"Chapter 924 - Ten Ultimate Arrays!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What was... that?!” Seeing the golden light gradually dimming in the sky, all the immortals from the Innumerable-Immortal Sea looked alarmed.","“Don’t panic!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness stared at Fang Qi as the latter walked out of the shop, and he said in a cold voice, “He only relies on a demon ape. It’s not his own strength, and he can’t last long!”","After they were forced to retreat in fear, they found that Fang Qi’s strength couldn’t last long after some investigation. Although he wasn’t Fang Qi’s match, he could extend the battle by dodging the attacks. When the strange energy on Fang Qi ran out, he would defeat Fang Qi easily!","He had taken his defeat as a big disgrace and wanted to redeem his reputation this time. He yelled in a harsh tone, “I’ll see how long you can bluff!”","After all, in the last expedition, he was the only leader of the troops. But this time, countless masters from the Innumerable-Immortal Sea were here!","With a jade token in his hands, he moved back among the immortals. Above the high auspicious clouds, most of the 28 elders from the eight primeval immortal families stood around him.","This time, they had many hermit immortals from different places of Innumerable-Immortal Sea, and Wondrous Spell High Holiness was only one of them!","In fact, a force on this scale wasn’t meant for mere mortals. It was formed to deal with the demonic gods from the Nine-Fold Darkness.","In his opinion, it was overkill to use this great force against the mortals!","At this moment, Wondrous Spell High Holiness said with a snicker, “It’s ridiculous that you don’t know that your death will be upon you very soon! Go and summon that demon ape! Today, we’ll kill it too!”","“Sir...” At this moment, not only the forces at the East Continent such as Heavenly Faction, but even the ancestral masters looked uneasy. Having returned to the faction after her break, Jiang Xiaoyue’s small face paled as she hid behind Mr. Fang. “There are so many of them...”","In addition to the larger troop, they looked fiercer than last time!","Extremely horrifying presences shot down from the sky and suffocated the people like mountains.","They had never seen so many powerful immortals in one place. Vaguely, they could even feel that the horrifying presences were the same as those of Golden Immortals!","“There are so many... Golden Immortals?!” many people looked horrified.","Previously, they had managed to deal with the immortal soldiers and generals. But how could they resist figures on such a high level!?","Their biggest concern was that their enemies would be sneaky and capture them instead of fighting Mr. Fang and then threaten him with the hostages!","Seeing their fear, Wondrous Spell High Holiness nodded in satisfaction. “Why don’t you summon that demon?!”","“36 heaven spirit generals!”","“We are here!” The 36 immortal generals with godly presence stepped out.","“Since the demon ape didn’t show up...” Wondrous Spell High Holiness pointed at Fang Qi and all the other people and said, “Take all of them into the Green Ocean Darkness Prison for later orders!”","“Yes!” The 36 generals took the order and flew down on a golden cloud with immortal soldiers, looking fierce with intense murderous spirit!","At this moment, a shadow behind Fang Qi split into ten! Then, the ten shadows stepped out from the void and gradually solidified.","Instantly, the 36 heaven spirit generals paused and looked at the ten figures cautiously.","The ten Daoists’ faces looked extremely weird and ferocious, each with a different color, such as green, yellow, crimson, white, and red. The moment that these ten figures appeared, cold mist rose between the Heaven and Earth, killing light flashed, gloomy winds turned chilly, and murderous spirits filled the whole space!","The Advanced Carrier Rocks that Fang Qi had received this time were perfect items after the upgrade of the System. On the one hand, they could carry more powerful existences’ powers. On the other hand, they could summon closely-related people at the same time!","With a cold expression, Wondrous Spell High Holiness said in a vicious voice, “We eight families are the orthodox immortals in the immortal land. What immortals are you?! How dare you block the path of orthodox immortals of Innumerable-Immortal Sea?!”","“We eight major immortal families are here! You insignificant immortals, back off!” The leader of the heaven spirit general yelled, “We’ll spare your lives!”","Under everyone’s stare, Fang Qi took out a scroll of array blueprint and bowed to the ten figures, “Please!”","One Daoist moved forward. This man was Heavenly Master Qin, and he was wearing the dark-red silk robe with embroidered white crane patterns, holding the Four-Edge Gold Sword Breaker, and hiding the Immortal Capture Wondrous Rope on him.","Heavenly Master Qin said, “I’m essence cultivator Qin Wan from Golden Turtle Island. What Dao spells do you have that make you act so aggressively?!”","Hearing his words, all the elders and holiness including Wondrous Spell High Holiness laughed. “Listen up! I’m Yuanjue Wondrous Spell High Holiness, the Sword-Carrying Elder of the Gui Family, one of the eight major orthodox immortal families!”","Beside him, a middle-aged elder dressed in a pale-grey robe yelled in a sharp voice, “A mere essence cultivator from the mortal world dares to block the immortal generals from our eight immortal families? Standing before us, you’re like a firefly standing before the bright moon!”","The ten figures were not angry. They cast Dao spells and spread out the array blueprint. Ten black light beams shot up into the sky, and the murderous spirits went straight up into the Heavenly Realm!","The ten arrays were connected one after another. Inside them, the smoke of war rose in waves as dark clouds covered the sky. The murderous spirits shot up into the sky as ghostly cries and godly howls filled the whole world!","Heavenly Master Qin laughed, “If we want you to die in the morning, you won’t dare to die at noon. Unorthodox independent immortals, do you dare to come into the array and die?!”","“Outrageous!”","“Even the independent mortal cultivators are so audacious?!” Standing next to Wondrous Spell High Holiness, the middle-aged man dressed in pale-grey clothes yelled in fury, “It’s a minor array. Where are the Four Direction Spirit Generals?!”","“We are here!” Four immortals walked out together.","One of them looked to be a middle-aged man with a green face. Dressed in green clothes and standing on flying black dragons, he came out with booming heaven thunder.","The second one looked to be in his prime with a black face. Dressed in black armor and holding a huge gold hammer, he was more than six meters tall. The moment that he took a step forward, the Heaven and Earth shook!","The third one was a white-clothed young Daoist. Standing on auspicious clouds, he had a smile on his face. As he lightly waved the paper fan in his hand, gusts swept around. The awe in the eyes of the immortal soldiers grew stronger as he stepped out.","The last one was a white-haired old man. While sneering, his eyes seemed to have the power to suck out people’s souls.","The four immortals were the Four Direction Spirit Generals who were more powerful than the 36 heaven spirit generals!","“36 heaven spirit generals and 72 earth spirit generals! Hear my order!” the first spirit general who was dressed in a green robe and stepping on two dragons yelled with his green expression, “Follow me and shatter the mortal array!”","“Yes!”","...","“This is...?!”","All the elders and disciples of Heavenly Faction and the ancestral masters of other factions in the new shop at the East Continent stared at the ten figures and the array in a daze. Of course, they knew them.","“These are... the Ten Ultimate Arrays?!”","When the four spirit generals led immortals into the array, they saw thick dust filling the air, and the paths in the array became complex and disorderly. Even the lights of the sun and the moon couldn’t penetrate this chaos. Giant killing tribulation surged up from under their feet!","Taught by Sect Master Tongtian, this array derived connate abilities and concealed chaotic secrets. With the three elements of Heaven, Earth, and Mortal as well as Yin and Yang, it could derive endless miraculous variations!"]},{"number":925,"title":"Chapter 925 - Declare war against the three realms; retreat or die!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Ten gates stood between the Heaven and Earth. At a closer look, they saw the chilly-looking ancient words on the arrays. The words ‘Heavenly Ultimate Array’ were displayed above the first array, ‘Earthly Fierce Array’ was above the second array, ‘Wind Howling Array’ was above the third array, ‘Chilly Ice Array’ was above the fourth array, ‘Golden Light Array’ was above the fifth array, ‘Blood-Melting Array’ was above the sixth array, ‘Blazing Fire Array’ was above the seventh array, ‘Desolate Array’ was above the eighth array, ‘Red Water Array’ was above the ninth array, and ‘Red Sand Array’ was above the tenth array.","Looking down from the high clouds, the immortals saw the middle-aged green-faced spirit general lead the others into the Heavenly Ultimate Array while standing on a pair of black dragons.","“I’m the Eastern Spirit General, Fierce Dragon Immortal! Hurry up and summon the demon monkey, or I’ll break the damn Heavenly Ultimate Array and destroy all the mortals in the shop!”","With a furious shout, he entered the array. Suddenly, the space before them changed, and they were horrified by what they saw!","The world before them was so chaotic that it looked like they had returned to the moment right after the universe was born without the sun or the moon. The vast land was dim and desolate!","Thunder boomed in the sky.","An endless line of steps hovered in the air and extended up high into the endless sky!","The primeval land beneath their feet was covered in blazing flames, bottomless abysses, and deep valleys!","In the distant sky, a cloud platform hovered high in the air. A Daoist sat on the platform with his legs crossed and his hands forming a seal. It looked like the scene at the beginning of the world!","The Daoist suddenly opened his eyes, and heavenly thunder boomed!","The immortal soldiers behind Fierce Dragon Immortal were instantly turned into dust!","It was just as the poem said, “With Three Elements of Heaven, Earth, and Mortal working together, the mysteries are too hard to solve! Trapped in the Heavenly Ultimate Array, even immortals will be turned into dust.”","The Fierce Dragon Immortal and the other heavenly spirit generals all looked horrified. They tried their best to block, but when a thunderbolt flashed, two of the immortal spirit generals behind the Fierce Dragon Immortal screamed as they were struck. Half of their bodies were shattered instantly. Horrified, the remaining half of their bodies looked over.","The other spirit generals’ blood ran cold in fear!!","Even Chijing Zi, one of the 12 Golden Immortals, had been scared witless by the Ten Ultimate Arrays. He even dropped the Tai Chi Scroll that he borrowed from Laozi in the array when he made a narrow escape from it in a panic!","In less than half an hour, several people scrambled to run out of the array. The Four Direction Spirit Generals lost all their arrogance!","One of them had his immortal body shattered by a thunderbolt that struck him from behind!","Another was covered in red water. When he ran out of the array, his whole body turned into a puddle of pus the moment he stepped outside!","One of them caught by a streak of godly flames. The moment that he got out of the array, the flame leaped up and burned him up instantly. It was the Samadhi True Flame containing Samadhi flame, air flame, and stone flame. Even the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal’s body couldn’t resist this fire, let alone ordinary immortals!","Instantly, he was turned into ashes!","“Stop!”","“B*stards! How dare you!?”","Furious curses came from the sky, but it was too late to save them!","The spirit generals entered the array and encountered killing tribulations. Except the three people who died right after escaping the array, the others had all been killed in the array!","At this moment, all the immortals from the eight major families were stunned, and their faces changed color.","“What’s this... evil array!? Who are you?!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness demanded in a trembling voice.","Heavenly Master Qin came out the array and sneered, “I told you that I’m an essence cultivator from Gold Turtle Island.”","“Does anyone else want to try our arrays?!”","“Don’t be so cocky!” Standing beside Wondrous Spell High Holiness, the middle-aged man dressed in a pale-grey robe sneered, “Do you think that you can kill our spirit generals so easily?”","“The spirit generals each has a soul lamp in their respective families,” He said in a cold voice, “As long as the soul lamps are not extinguished, they won’t be destroyed by even 10,000 tribulations!”","He took out a green jade flag and waved it while yelling, “Come back, immortal souls!”","Gusts howled between the Heaven and Earth as several souls floated out from the array and toward the jade flag.","But at this moment, the Gods’ Investiture List lit up again in the eastern sky.","The souls instantly went out of control and floated toward the Gods’ Investiture List!","That green jade flag was rendered useless on the spot!","“The Gods’ Investiture List!?”","“It’s the Gods’ Investiture List!” the people in the shop exclaimed in elation.","Looking at the sky, Fang Qi said, “Use whatever skills you have now!”","“Evil beings!” The Wondrous Spell High Holiness shook in fury. “Regardless of how powerful you are, you’ll be defeated!”","“Immortal friends, do you have ways to break these arrays?” Wondrous Spell High Holiness looked at the crowd and saw only horror on the immortals’ faces.","None of them had imagined that the eight immortal families with many fierce spirit generals and a large group of grandmasters would be blocked by this array, which stood before them like a natural barrier! They couldn’t move forward at all!","“Take your time and see if you can break the array!”","At this moment, Fang Qi suddenly heard the familiar beeping noise from the System Interface.","[New Task: Unlock the Highest-level Privilege","Task Description: The internet café needs a peaceful environment. Host, please severely punish the immortals, gods, and demons who have invaded the internet café repeatedly!","Task Instruction: After years of test, Host has barely met all the requirements for a qualified shop owner. After this task is completed, you will get the highest-level privilege of the shop.","Task Reward: the highest-level privilege.]","...","Fang Qi returned to the shop with murderous spirits on his face. “All the cultivators and warriors who are proficient with the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array, come with me!”","– Meanwhile, in the Yellow Spring Sea outside the sea area of Half City –","Demonic waves surged up as extremely horrifying giant beasts revealed their vicious looks from the darkness.","Countless chilly eyes appeared in the demonic mist.","It could be vaguely seen that countless pitch-black tentacles entered the depths of the ocean as a horrifying shadow slowly came out from the bottomless abyss-like black ocean!","No one could imagine how huge and horrifying the monsters from the abyssal ocean were. In the endless gloomy and killing presence, huge waves crashed onto the shore, and the huge spiritual essence shield around Half City was instantly shattered!","However, at this moment, a figure dressed in silver armor stood upon the surging huge waves with the Three-Pointed Spear in his hand, facing the pouring water and blocking the herds of demons that were swarming up and covering the horizon!","“That’s...”","The godly eye between his brows shot out a golden beam!","Circulating the Eight-Nine Profound Technique, he extended his head and limbs. Instantly, with his head touching the sky and feet on the land, a giant god stood proudly in the world, blocking millions of demons all by himself!","“That’s...!?” On the shore, countless cultivators and warriors let out thunderous exclamations.","“Erlang Immortal Master! It’s Erlang Immortal Master!”","Meanwhile, countless light beams shone on the border between the Godly Realm and the mortal world. As winds howled, and thunder boomed as a huge golden cloud flew toward Canglan City.","-At this moment-","Teal, yellow, red, white, and black. The five-colored light shot up into the sky and shook the Heaven!","“Who dares to block the gods’ way?!”","“An important treasure is coming out. Anyone who dares to block us will die!”","A voice laughed, “Born at the beginning of the world as the initial chaos was divided, I’ve freely searched through Yin and Yang of Tai Chi. After understanding the great way, I’ve surpassed the Three-Vehicle Great Technique.”","“I’m Kong Xuan!”","Today, the three armies were all blocked!","A thunderous voice sounded in the sky, “Today, my shop declares war against three realms – Immortal Realm, Godly Realm, and Demonic Realm! Anyone who dares to disturb the shop’s business must retreat or – die!”","“Declare war against three realms at the same time? Ignorant mortal, how dare you!?”","“You will die!”","At this moment, the immortals standing above Wondrous Spell High Holiness were also furious, and they shouted, “Ignorant Ant! You dare to be so arrogant just because you have a rare treasure. After we take that treasure, we’ll turn you to dust!”"]},{"number":926,"title":"Chapter 926 - The Immortal Master Has Descended!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This kid is indeed arrogant!”","“That’s ridiculous! How can you mortal ants imagine the scope of our knowledge, immortal spells, and Dao techniques??” Standing next to Wonderous Spell High Holiness, the grey-robed middle-aged man said furiously, “You are so arrogant. Do you really think so little of our eight major immortal families?!”","He yelled, “Daoist friends, who is willing to come with me to break this sh*t array?!”","“I’ll go with you!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness said proudly.","“Daoist Friend Guyin, how can you leave me out?!”","Three immortals floated out of layers of thick clouds. In addition to the grey-robed middle-aged man and Wondrous Spell High Holiness, there was a lean old man with white hair.","Obviously, he intended to show off his cultivation strength when his robe billowed out, and extremely aggressive immortal spiritual energy shot out with howling noises and swept all over the land!","All the people around him including Wondrous Spell High Holiness looked serious. “Daoist Friend Cangjie... I’ve not seen you for years, and your cultivation strength has grown so much?!”","The white-haired old man stroked his beard and laughed, “Just a little; just a little.”","The elders around him all congratulated him, “Congratulations to you for advancing to a level above us! Congratulations!”","“It seems like we have the Heaven’s help in breaking this array!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness said with a sneer, “Daoist Friends, let’s enter the evil array and see what tricks it has!”","“I agree!”","While laughing, the three Daoists used various spells and entered the array in the form of three rainbows.","“I’ll show these mortals what true immortal power looks like!” The white-haired Cangjie High Holiness said,","“I’ve brought many rare treasures to deal with that demon monkey.” The grey-robed middle-aged man who was known as Guyin High Holiness said, “However, the demon monkey somehow has got the news about our power and doesn’t dare to show its face. Today, we’ll first defeat the so-called Ten Heavenly Masters!”","They walked forward in the array with hands clasped behind their backs. Then, they came to the array gate with a sign on it, and words on the sign read [Desolate Array].","“You’re right!” Cangjie High Holiness said in a cold voice, “The people who built this array dare to block our way with it. Those people deserve to die! I’ll enter this array first and see what power it has!”","With a wave of his big sleeve, mist and clouds that were floating before him suddenly gathered to one spot and formed a vague white jade bridge which extended into the array, carrying him on it!","“Good Dao technique!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness exclaimed in appreciation, “Condensed by connate pure essence, the jade bridge can repel and block all evils. This way, we won’t be touched by any filthy stuff in the array. I’ll see what the Desolate Array can do about it!”","The three Daoists stepped onto the jade bridge and entered the array. Inside the array was a dark space full of gloomy white flags.","Lamps dotted the place like starry light or floating ghosts in the dark night...","The land was covered by divinatory runes, and light pierced the surging black clouds. A Daoist sat on the Eight-Trigram platform cross-legged, waving a white flag. Ten straw dummies stood in ten directions.","Under the wavering white candle light, the straw dummies looked very creepy.","The Daoist waved the white flag, and gloomy winds rose in the array, sweeping black sand from the ground onto the jade bridge. Instantly, black stinky smoke rose from the jade bridge. Like the howling of fierce ghosts, the gloomy winds brushed the three immortals’ faces and made them unable to use any of their superpowers. Then, the three stumbled as their visions blackened. They almost fell from the bridge.","As the creepy and chilly wind entered their bodies through the pores, the immortal spiritual energy inside them was rendered useless, and their superpowers couldn’t be used! They couldn’t understand why this gloomy presence was so weird and creepy!","The presence didn’t enter their physical bodies or their meridians, but their souls got fuzzy and were about to come out of their bodies!","At this moment, they shivered and looked horrified!","There were countless Dao techniques and superpowers in the world, but they had never seen such a weird and fierce array, such a ferocious killing method, and such aggressive attacks!","At this moment, it seemed like all the people who had entered this array lost their life energy as the presence of nature swarmed toward them.","“No!” Their expressions changed again. The power of this creepy array went beyond their imaginations! If they stayed one more moment in it, even their immortal souls would be drawn out!","Almost at the same time, the three Daoists unleashed their best spiritual treasures and circulated all their immortal spiritual energy, flying out of the array in great horror.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The immortals outside the array were talking about how the three of them were going to break the array when the three shot out of the array like lightning bolts. Pale-faced and panting, they were scared out of their wits.","Astonished, the other elders and high holinesses asked, “Daoist friends, what happened?”","When they calmed down, they held their breaths and concentrated on checking their bodies with pale faces. After checking, they said, “I thought that they had some abilities, but it turns out that they were just bluffs!”","“Right!” The grey-robed middle-aged Guyin High Holiness said, “The array is indeed creepy but couldn’t hurt us. Anyway, it has some power, and you guys can...”","At this moment, the chilly white light of the three lamps inside the Desolate Array swayed, and then one of them extinguished!","Before he could finish his words, Guyin High Holiness stumbled, and his face turned as white as a dummy made of paper!","“Daoist Brother Guyin, what’s wrong?!”","“I’m fine!” Guyin High Holiness shook his head and said, “Maybe I over-consumed my spiritual energy when I got out of the array.”","Three days later, the three Daoists almost dozed off before the array as they talked about ways to break it.","About ten days later, most of the light in the Desolate Array had dimmed.","One day, Wondrous Spell High Holiness was talking with others about ways to break the array when his vision turned black.","Colorless all over his body, he fell to the ground silently like a cold corpse. No breath or sound came from him anymore!","Such a creepy death sent chills down the spines of all the members of the eight major immortal families on the battleground!","“What... what’s happened?!” The other immortals saw these three die without any warning in person!","Only a short time had passed since they came down to the Lower Region, but they had lost all the heaven spirit generals and earth spirit generals. Now, even the three elders had died in such a creepy way.","“Their souls were drawn out!” One elder checked the three bodies and said with a dark expression.","“What?!” Almost everyone, including the members of the eight major immortal families and over 20 elders, all retreated several steps as if they had seen a deadly viper when they heard these words.","When they looked down on the array again, the look in their eyes had totally changed as if they were looking at a group of fierce ghosts set on taking their lives.","The 36 heaven spirit generals and Four Direction Spirit Generals had just entered the array to check the situation, but they couldn’t even get out of it. They had all died in the array!","The powerful Wondrous Spell High Holiness, Guyin High Holiness, and Cangjie High Holiness had suddenly died in a creepy way after they got out of the array less than a month ago!","Horror and endless panic appeared in their eyes!","Such things would be unbelievable even to their own ears, but they had to believe the truth before their eyes.","Regardless of how great their cultivation strength was, they couldn’t find a way to deal with this array. After staying here for more than one month, their casualties grew higher and higher!","...","The Heaven and Earth opened as if the initial chaos had just been cleared!","Immortal mist floated down with wondrous immortal music which resonated with the Heaven and Earth. Seven-colored light rose, and rare phenomenon appeared!","In the depths of Heaven, a group of immortals stood in one line behind a figure. Wearing a feather headpiece, the figure sat in a gold carriage decorated with dragon and phoenix engravings of gold and jade. This figure looked as glorious and noble as the Heaven and Earth.","A gaze fell from the Ninth Heaven.","“Immortal Master... Is he an immortal master!?”","“The Immortal Master has descended?!” All the immortals of the eight immortal families exclaimed.","Their horror and alarm instantly turned into elation and thrill. Some of them even said in a fierce tone, “Now that the Immortal Master is here, the array will be broken instantly!”","From the sky, a voice said mildly, “As the Immortal Master said, today’s immortal tribulations that you are experiencing had been foretold as early as 10,000 years ago. It is only a weak soul-separating array. Your troubles will be over after you enter the array and take back the souls.”","“Today, I’ll give you the Saint Spiritual Gold Stamp, the ultimate treasure from the Saint Emperor Palace. Once you cast this gold stamp, the array will be shattered. Do it now!”"]},{"number":927,"title":"Chapter 927 - The Ten Ultimate Arrays Aren’t That Powerful?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The elders of the eight major immortal families had been helpless before the Ten Ultimate Arrays, which stood like a natural barrier.","The immortal soldiers and immortal generals had been stationed in the mortal world for more than one month. After losing the heaven and earth spirit generals and the Four Direction Spirit Generals, now even the 28 elders and grandmasters with special talents from different immortal mountains had suddenly died throughout this time. The creepy deaths frightened them.","In this short time, they now truly understood the great horror of this major array.","No one dared to even venture into the array anymore!","After all, no one wanted to die like Wondrous Spell High Holiness and his companions who didn’t even know how or why they died.","They had come with great confidence, but now their confidence had received a heavy blow.","The high morale had come to the lowest point among the eight major immortal families.","The elders looked down at the Ten Heavenly Masters from the Golden Turtle Island. The latter’s techniques almost suffocated them.","However, all this came to an astonishing reverse as they saw the dazzling figure sitting in the gold carriage in the sky. Flanked by many immortals, he looked like an immortal king ruling his kingdom in the prehistoric era! No one dared to directly look at him!","“It’s the Immortal Master! Saint Spiritualual Gold Stamp... He’s Dragon Pool Immortal Master of the Saint Emperor Palace!” As the gold stamp flew down from the sky, the immortals bowed together and said, “We welcome the descent of the Saint Stamp!”","“After Dragon Pool Immortal Master understood the Great Dao, he collected the original pure essence of the Heaven and Earth and refined it with a nature-born rare stone before the Heaven and Earth changed. The stamp took shape after being refined in water and fire for 14,900 years,” one elder exclaimed in a low voice, “This item is one of the Saint Emperor Palace’s spiritual treasures, which can suppress a world. I never imagined that I’d have the honor to see it!”","“Saint Emperor Palace of the Gui Family!?” Almost everyone watched in elation as the spiritual treasure floated down. “This is an ultimate treasure that only the Immortal Masters have the right to use!”","Standing among other elders, an elder of Gui Family was short of breath as his hands trembled in excitement.","He was Profound Spell High Holiness, Gui Xuan. There were four elders with the title of High Holiness in the Gui Family – Profound, Vast, Vital, and Wondrous. Obviously, Gui Xuan’s position was higher than that of Wondrous Spell High Holiness even though they were both High Holiness Elders of Gui Family; the latter must call him senior brother.","“Elder Gui Xuan, congratulations!” When the old man took the gold stamp with shaky hands, the people around him congratulated him.","“With this treasure in hand, no evil can get near you.” Standing beside him, a white-clothed stout elder said, “I heard from Wondrous Spell High Holiness that the Desolate Array in the Ten Ultimate Arrays has the fiercest evil essence in whole world gathered in one place, and it couldn’t be broken by ordinary immortal treasures. But the Saint Spiritualual Gold Stamp is the source of pure essence in the Heaven and Earth, and it usually guards the Saint Emperor Palace.”","The old man laughed and said, “The evil array built by the unorthodox demons now meets its nemesis!”","“Cloud Crane High Holiness is right. Everyone, you can go with me to break the array!” Profound Spell High Holiness looked proud and heroic with the gold stamp in his hands, and he said in a loud voice, “With this item with us, are you still worried that we can’t break this evil array?!”","“We’ll go!” The voices resonated in the sky. Above the Ninth Heaven, immortals yelled like booming thunder!","Profound Spell High Holiness lifted the gold stamp and turned into a golden light, entering the array before others!","Immediately, the white-robed stout old man, who was Cloud Crane High Holiness, and the other elders dropped into the major array like shooting stars!","“It’s time to show these mortals the great power of the spiritual treasure that guards the palace!”","The elders and famous masters hadn’t seen the interior of the Ten Ultimate Arrays until now. Once they were inside the Desolate Array, they saw the gloomy winds that could suck out souls.","As the gloomy winds brushed them, they felt like their souls would leave their bodies. In the center of the array, the Daoist waved the white soul flag, and an ominous feeling instantly rose in them. They said in alarm, “Profound Spell High Holiness, hurry up and launch the gold stamp!”","Profound Spell High Holiness put the gold stamp before him respectfully and kowtowed while saying, “Please make a move, Saint Spirit Senior!”","The moment that he said those words, the gold stamp floated into the sky. Like the sun, it shone with golden light around it, illuminating this dark chaotic world! Only golden light could be seen!","Engulfed by the golden light, the gloomy winds in the array were suppressed. They turned still and stopped moving.","The white flag stopped waving at the same time. Profound Spell High Holiness looked at the Daoist in the array and said with a sneer, “This time, I’ll see how you can draw my soul!”","With a yell, he reached for the straw dummies on the array platform. “Hurry and take back the High Holinesses’ souls!”","Instantly, figures flew up like swift winds.","“You dare to take souls from my array?!” Heavenly Master Yao who set up this array snorted and took out a dipper of black sand from under his chair. Then, he tossed it out.","The black sand looked neither real nor virtual. It was as vague as a soul and not tangible.","It was the extreme Yin item in this ferocious array, and even Chijing Zi hadn’t dared to touch it. Once it was tossed out, Chijing Zi got so scared that he scrambled to flee, leaving the Tai Chi Scroll in the array.","It looked like ordinary black sand to the naked eye. But when Profound Spell High Holiness looked closely with the aid of the golden light from the gold stamp, he was so scared that he took several steps back.","Accompanied by endless roars and howls from fierce souls, each black sand grain emitted ferocious essence, looking even more lethal than the fierce ghosts and gods from the depths of the Underworld!","“No! Run!” Profound Spell High Holiness’s expression changed drastically, but it was too late to warn the others. The black sand covered the figures in the front of the group.","Profound Spell High Holiness circulated his spiritual energy and concentrated with his eyes, and he saw that although these people’s physical bodies were intact for now, their souls were being quickly eroded. Their souls released a stinky smell as if they were submerged in a pool of sulfuric acid.","“Evil being! How dare you?!” At this moment, the Saint Spiritual Gold Stamp suddenly released dazzling golden light!","Then, it moved swiftly toward Heavenly Master Yao and engulfed him!","“I’m the Gold Stamp Saint Spirit from the Saint Emperor Palace! Ignorant mortal, how dare you kill in front of me?!” The power of the golden light instantly multiplied several times!","The golden light filled each corner of this dark world almost in less than a second","“This is the origin of pureness and peacefulness and ancestor of all essence. I’ll see how you can resist it!”","Profound Spell High Holiness yelled, and the horrifying golden light from the gold stamp almost forced the array to stop operating. All the gloomy winds evaporated!","“Juniors, what are you waiting for? Break the array now!” A voice came from the gold stamp, “I’ve subdued this person. Hurry and kill him!”","The stout Cloud Crane High Holiness moved immediately, and his face was red with fury. “Evil Daoist, die!”","Around him, yells sounded as countless spiritual treasures and powerful spells crashed toward Heavenly Master Yao like a shower.","Boom! Boom!","The Desolate Array instantly vanished!","“We broke it!” Profound Spell High Holiness said in contempt, “The Ten Ultimate Arrays are not so powerful, after all!”"]},{"number":928,"title":"Chapter 928 - Three Sky Fairies Swept up a blood storm!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Then, Daoist friends, do you dare to come into my Heavenly Ultimate Array?!” The moment that Profound Spell High Holiness said those words, a cold and tough voice came from the outside. “You broke one array; there are nine more to go!”","“This... this...!?” The immortals were about to cheer when the words dampened their elation like cold water.","When they broke this array, their souls were almost melted. Now, they were astonished to find that nine more arrays were waiting for them!","Looking into the Heavenly Ultimate Array, they heard booming thunder and saw lightning bolts in there.","“This array...?!” Profound Spell High Holiness kowtowed toward the gold stamp with great respect.","“Juniors, don’t expect that I can help much.” The voice from the gold stamp said, “This array is created from connate pure essence which is almost of the same origin as me. It’s not easy to suppress it.”","“What?!” Everyone looked at the array in horror.","At this moment, outside the Ten Ultimate Arrays, immortal music floated out as colorful phoenixes and light beams danced at the horizon. A figure flew from the southeastern sky on a five-colored lion.","The figure floated over as if he was coming from a mysterious realm outside of the Heaven. He looked to be about 18 years old, but at a closer look, his facial features seemed to be engulfed by a layer of thin gauze. But from his deportment, people could feel a coolness that could regarded 10,000 years as nothing.","Looking up, they could see a vague purple essence beam rising from the top of his head. It almost reached the top of the sky with a length of tens of thousands of meters.","“Dragon Pool Daoist Friend, I’ve not seen you for years. How are you?","“I’ve foreseen that the ultimate holy item of fortune won’t be obtained with ease.” The immortal master waved his hand casually, and three colorful light beams floated up. The colorful light beams each contained a yellow silk scroll with pictures of auspicious clouds and beasts, a white jade lamp with bead-like blinking light dots, and a transparent treasure bead that seemed to emit light of the sun and moon.","“Another immortal master?!” The immortals and elders from the eight immortal families all had excitement and elation in their eyes.","“Another immotral master! This battle... alerted two immortal masters!”","“With two immortal masters with us, there is no array in the world that we can’t break!”","After breaking the Desolate Array, they saw another immortal master descend. How could they not be thrilled?!","These immortal masters were existences that they couldn’t usually see and were only next to the sages in the major immortal families!","“These three treasures are Mystic Sky Treasure Scroll, Qian Vital Li Fire Lamp and Vital Suppression Bead.” The immortal master said with a faint smile, “They are the ultimate treasures from my Avidya Saint Palace and can surely break three arrays.”","[TL Note: Avidya is a Sanskrit word whose literal meaning is ignorance, misconceptions, misunderstandings, incorrect knowledge.]","“They can break three arrays?!” The Profound Spell High Holiness had just got out of the array and was frustrated by the lack of good ways to break the Heavenly Ultimate Array. Now, he heard these words...","We can break three more arrays?!","At this moment, another figure came from the north.","Riding on a lotus flower platform made of blood jade, this figure was dressed in a bright red long robe with red hair fluttering in the wind. Blood-colored heavenly light shot up into the sky, and the phenomenon in the Heaven and Earth dyed the whole northern sky red!","His voice came before him, “Dragon Pool Daoist Friend, I’ll help you!","“How many arrays do you think my treasures can break?!”","Shortly, immortal light flashed above the layers of clouds on Ninth Heaven as the extremely powerful and horrifying presence descended to the mortal world!","The presences of each ultimate treasure were stronger than the last! Each of them seemed to possess the primeval connate presence.","The three immortal masters stood together in the sky and looked down on the major array which emitted strong murderous spirits with contempt.","“This array is interesting.” Dressed in a red robe, the immortal master with red hair said.","Then, he let out a contemptuous sneer. “Unfortunately, they met me!”","With a wave of his hand, two rare treasures floated down from the sky. One was the Gold-Locking Ring, and the other was a blood-colored gourd. He said smugly, “Look! Do you think my two treasures can break two arrays?”","“Hahahaha!” Seeing these two treasures, the Dragon Pool Immortal Master said after a long laugh, “Now that Innumerable Tribulation Daoist Friend took out the Qian-Kun Gold-Locking Loop and Blood Jade Treasure Gourd, how can any array in the world remain intact?!”","Pleased, the Dragon Pool Immortal Master summoned the Profound Spell High Holiness and the others before saying, “I’ll teach you how to break the Heavenly Ultimate Array. Take these two ultimate treasures with you. If he hits you with thunderbolts, open the Blood Jade Treasure Gourd, which was refined in the nine killing tribulations with ancient saint demons’ bones, blood, essence, and flesh. Immortals and gods will be turned into dust by one touch of it!”","“If that being dares to flee...” the immortal master dressed in the red robe and had red hair said, “You just activate the Qian-Kun Gold-Locking Loop. He dared to kill our disciples, and I’ll make sure he won’t get away with it!”","“The array builder has insignificant strength; he’s not worthy of our attention!”","“Yes!”","“As you wish!”","The Profound Spell High Holiness and all the people around him were elated.","Instantly, 28 elders and several high holinesses from the eight major families entered the array with their treasures. With so many ultimate treasures gathering at one place in this world, the Heaven and Earth shook. Winds and clouds changed colors, purple essence shot up into the sky, and golden light overshadowed the blazing sun!","The immortal soldiers and generals yelled in surprise, and their cheers sounded like thunder and tsunamis!","“This... is indeed the power of ultimate treasures! The power of ultimate treasures!”","“With these ultimate treasures from the immortal masters, who in the world would dare to block the way of our eight immortal families?!”","In the past, no one had dared to challenge the eight primeval immortal families, which was why they had never seen their immortal masters show their hands or witnessed the great power of the spiritual treasures on this level.","However, at this moment, they saw the horrifying power that these spiritual treasures could gather, which made them wonder if anyone in the world could resist their families!","“So powerful! I didn’t know that we had such great powers!” Connate Cliff Commander Gui Ye, the vanguard who had descended to the Lower Region but got his physical body destroyed by Qi Tiandi, now recovered his physical body and was standing among the immortals. Seeing this scene, he was so exhilarated that he almost raised his head and howled.","Heavenly Supervisor Green Sky Immortal also gazed at the Lower Region in excitement and said, “That day, that mortal dared to insult me. In a while, I’ll go into the shop and capture you first. I’ll see what you’ll say then!”","“Heavenly Ultimate Array, break!” At this moment, the spiritual treasures in the hands of Profound Spell High Holiness and others were more powerful than the Saint Spiritual Gold Stamp. They all came from primeval times and were ultimate treasures that had been refined by fire and water for tens of thousands of years and had passed tribulations!","After entering the grand array, they broke the array with ease as if they had finally broken through an acupoint which had been blocked for more than one month! In less than one day, they broke five arrays successively!","With five of the ten arrays broken, the shop which had been engulfed by the major array began to show.","“You dared to kill our elders and holinesses. Regardless of who’s behind you, we’ll kill you!” With a wicked expression, Profound Spell High Holiness yelled in fury!","“Half of the arrays are broken!” Green Sky Immortal yelled, “Follow me and kill our way into the shop; capture that ignorant and arrogant mortal thief!”","“Kill!”","Green Sky Immortal was the first charging into the shop.","Clank!","With one foot in the shop, she felt as if she had crashed into a wall. After stumbling back several steps, she looked up and saw a familiar face looking at her coldly.","“It is you! Fang... Qi!” Green Sky Immortal was about to charge forward again when she felt that all the people around her paused.","Green Sky Immortal’s heart lurched with an ominous feeling.","She looked into the shop and saw Fang Qi walking out fiercely with about 600 people behind him.","Right behind him were three white-clothed fairies with frosty expressions.","One of the fairies waved her hand, and a scissors-like golden light shot out. Then, the immortal soldiers before the shop were cut down like harvested wheat stalks! The street before the shop was covered in blood!","Green Sky Immortal looked back and felt chills running down her spine. She shivered and opened her mouth wide as if something strangled her; she wasn’t able to utter one word!","“Who... who are you!?”"]},{"number":929,"title":"Chapter 929 - Heaven-Reaching Abilities!?","paragraphs":["Chapter 929: Heaven-Reaching Abilities!?","Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Seeing that five of the Ten Ultimate Arrays were broken, and the immortals had charged into the shop, Dragon Pool Immortal Master, Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master, and Avidya Immortal Master were discussing about the ultimate holy item of fortune. The Profound Spell High Holiness and the other elders stood behind them after returning the spiritual treasures which had been used to break the arrays.","Suddenly, they heard the uproar blow them.","“Huh?”","“What’s happening below?!”","After this powerful major array is half broken, the remaining part will be broken sooner or later. what other power can these junior mortals have after such a great array of theirs is broken?","...","Heavenly Supervisor Green Sky Immortal had thought so as well. After the countless spiritual treasures from the eight major immortal families broke the horrifying Ten Ultimate Arrays, the ignorant juniors who had barely reached the borderline between immortals and mortals should be horrified and waiting for death in the shop.","Anyone would be scared witless when their trump card was broken!","However, what she saw was the opposite!","The 600 people behind Fang Qi had bright light in their eyes while fierce presence filled the sky. As for the three women who had came out of nowhere, their cultivation strengths were absolutely on the immortal-level!","...","“You guys once compiled a list of namest of hermits living in major mountains at the Innumerable-Immortal Sea. Have you ever seen these three women? Do you know who they are?!” At this moment, sitting in the gold carriage, Dragon Pool Immortal Master summoned the Profound Spell High Holiness and the other elders and asked, “That golden light was fast, but I could see that it was a pair of gold scissors with great power. They shouldn’t be people unknown to the world.”","The elders shook their heads repeatedly and said, “We’ve never heard of any immortal living remotely having a pair of gold scissors as a protective spiritual treasure.”","“But...” The Profound Spell High Holiness said with a sneer, “Regardless of where they come from, I think if they try to fight us with spiritual treasures...”","He took out the gold stamp and said, “Then, they will meet an iron wall!”","“You have a point.” Dragon Pool Immortal Master nodded.","“It seems like these mortals don’t know the power of true spiritual treasures or a saint items.” Beside him, Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master dressed in a red robe said with a chuckle.","With one wave of his hand, he took off the Blood Jade Treasure Gourd from his belt and said, “This treasure is the fruit from a plant that blooms once every 30,000 years and bears fruits once every 30,000 years. Condensed by the blood of the demonic gods who had died in primeval times, it has countless miraculous uses. It hasn’t been used to break those arrays. Take it and show its power to the mortals!”","Dragon Pool Immortal Master laughed and said, “Vast Spell, come and thank Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master!”","The Vast Spell High Holiness, another elder of the Gui Family standing next to Profound Spell High Holiness, took the Blood Jade Treasure Gourd and said in pleasant surprise, “Thank you, Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master!”","At this moment, the white-robed Avidya Immortal Master, who looked to be about 18 years old, took out the ancient yellow scroll and said, “You can take my Mystic Sky Treasure Scroll with you too.”","“Hahahaha!” Dragon Pool Immortal Master laughed, “Vital Spell can take it. Come and thank Avidya Immortal Master!”","Another Daoist named Vital Spell High Holiness standing next to Profound Spell High Holiness hurried over and thanked him. Except for Wondrous Spell who couldn’t be with them, the other three of the four high holiness elders were thrilled. “Since these mortals are still overestimating themselves, we’ll go and give them a good lesson!”","Then, they lowered their clouds and landed before the shop with the spiritual treasures.","At this moment, the first group of immortals from the eight major families charging at the shop had fallen to the ground. Seeing this sight, Profound Spell High Holiness was furious!","For countless years, no one had dared to do such outrageous thing to them! No one dared to kill immortal soldiers right under their noses!","“How dare you kill our immortal soldiers!”","Engulfed in the golden light from the gold stamp in his hand, he looked like a famous ancient god who controlled everything between the Heaven and Earth. “Who are you? Give me your names if you dare!”","Cloud Sky Fairy shouted, “Having obtained Dao since Heaven was separated from Earth, we show true forms on the Three Immortals Island. Dumping six essences and three bodies, I’m one step away from flying to Jade Capital riding on Green Phoenix and becoming a sage.”","“We are Cloud Sky Fairy, Green Sky Fairy, and Jade Sky Fairy from the Three Immortals Island!”","“You sound so boastful!” Profound Spell High Holiness was even more furious after hearing her words. “You juniors dare to claim that you have obtained Dao since Heaven was separated from Earth?! Today, I’ll teach you a lesson!”","He dropped to his knees respectfully with the gold stamp in his hands. “With great respect, Disciple Profound Spell asks Saint Spirit Senior to make a move!”","Extremely horrified, Heavenly Supervisor Green Sky Immortal of the Innumerable-Immortal Sea yelled and retreated to stand behind Profound Spell High Holiness. She thought, “This woman’s Dao name is the same as mine, but how come her cultivation strength is so horrifyingly high...!?”","But... now that Saint Emperor Palace’s gold stamp is here, she can’t escape regardless of how powerful she is! This thought calmed her down.","At this moment, the Saint Spiritual Gold Stamp released dazzling golden light, and the whole stamp suppressed the surrounding space with an invisible force like a huge mountain!","“The gold stamp can suppress eternity. This is the primeval ultimate treasure protecting our Gui Family’s Saint Emperor Palace!” Profound Spell High Holiness yelled, “Even if you have heaven-reaching power, you can’t escape from it!”","The moment he said those words, he saw a gold dipper rising into the sky effortlessly despite the force that was enough to suppress the world!","Chaos Essence meant that it came from the most ancient time when Heaven was separated from Earth. Containing three elements of Heaven, Earth, and Mortal, this small gold dipper held all the mysteries of the world.","It was an ultimate treasure that Sect Master Tongtian passed down in Green Touring Palace, and its power was only next to the connate spiritual treasures of the sect masters, such as the Primeval Lord of Heaven and Sect Master Tongtian!","Once the Chaos Essence Gold Dipper was used, fine light beams as high as 30,000 meters rose from the ground, rendering 72 variations and all the superpowers of spiritual treasures useless. Like a bottomless black hole, the vortex of golden clouds pulled the Saint Spiritual Gold Stamp from the sky.","Seeming to know that it was no match, the gold stamp immediately turned into a golden light to flee. Instantly, with metal-colliding noises, the gold stamp fell into the gold dipper!","“What!?” The three holinesses’ eyes almost popped out of their eye sockets at this sight.","That’s the Gold Stamp from the Saint Emperor Palace! It had been...drawn in by this small gold dipper from nowhere?!","“It’s an ultimate treasure. Even though you have heaven-reaching abilities, you can’t...”","“You’re ignorant. My master is Sect Master Tongtian.” Before he could finish, Green Sky Fairy, the youngest of Three Sky Fairies said, “You keep calling my master’s name but don’t know if we have heaven-reaching abilities?”","[TL Note: Tongtian means heaven-reaching in Chinese.]","“You... you!?” With the ultimate treasure taken, he knew that the punishment from Dragon Pool Immortal Master would be too much to bear even for all the elders, let alone him. After spewing out a mouthful of blood, Profound Spell High Holiness pointed at the three fairies and almost passed out in fury!"]},{"number":930,"title":"Chapter 930 - Greedy for Treasures","paragraphs":["Chapter 930: Greedy for Treasures","Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This is absolutely impossible!” Vital Spell High Holiness also said grimly, “This stamp was refined by Dragon Pool Immortal Master with the original pure essence of the Heaven and Earth from a nature-born rare rock before the world experienced the great change. It had taken the stamp’s shape after being refined in fire and water for 14,900 years.”","“It can even suppress one world. How could it be subdued and taken by a mere gold dipper...?!”","“Don’t waste time on her!” Vast Spell High Holiness took the Blood Jade Gourd from his belt and said in a cold voice, “The immortal masters gave us more than one treasure, and each of them is more powerful than the last. I don’t believe that she can take them all!”","They exchanged a look. “Attack together!”","While waving spiritual seals in the air with their hands, they launched the blood jade gourd and the yellow silk scroll into the sky.","Instantly, the world was plunged into darkness as blood-colored light engulfed the thick clouds in Ninth Heaven!","These two treasures were super spiritual treasures made by the fortune of Heaven and Earth of this world. Once they were used, the whole mortal world was engulfed in their power and didn’t look the same anymore!","However, the Chaos Essence Golden Dipper seemed to contain a universe of its own, and its force was like a bottomless black hole. The two spiritual treasures struggled for a little while before falling into the gold dipper and turning silent!","At this moment, Vast Spell High Holiness and Vital Spell High Holiness froze in a daze, and their limbs turned cold!","They couldn’t even take the punishment for losing one treasure. But now, they lost all three treasures!?","“What... what demonic spell did you use!?” They pointed at the Three Sky Fairies and yelled.","The two almost went crazy! Each of the spiritual treasures from the immortal masters were unimaginably powerful. In the past when these treasures were used, almost nothing could face their power head-on since they could shatter anything with ease.","Almost everyone in the immortal families knew the great reputations of these ultimate treasures.","“This treasure gourd was condensed by the demonic gods’ blood when the primeval demons fell in ancient times, and it has countless miraculous uses. Also, the Mystic Sky Treasure Scroll is an even better ultimate treasure... how could they be taken by a so-called gold dipper that we have never heard of before?!”","At this moment, Green Sky Immortal, the Heavenly Supervisor of the Innumerable-immortals Sea, couldn’t help yelling, “You... where did you get these treasures?!”","It feels like these mortals had just picked them up randomly on the streets?! Otherwise, how come we have never heard of them before?!","Cloud Sky Fairy snickered and said coldly, “Listen up. This dipper was born when the world was created, and it contains three elements of Heaven, Earth, and Mortal. Handed to us in Green Touring Palace, it brings disaster to immortals, gods, mortals, and ghosts!”","Jade Sky Fairy also laughed, “This is an ultimate treasure of the Heaven and Earth when the world was created, and it can easily contain the universe. What abilities do you have that can resist this treasure?!”","Instantly, bedlam broke out among the eight major immortal families!","“Outrageous! So outrageous!” At this moment, the two elders, Vast Spell and Vital Spell, were too frightened to worry about the punishment that awaited them. With Profound Spell High Holiness, they scrambled to flee by riding on clouds, leaving behind Heavenly Supervisor Green Sky Immortal and the immortal generals who trembled uncontrollably, standing where they were.","Mr. Fang walked up and said to her, “What did I tell you?”","“You... you... you...” Looking at Fang Qi and then at the Three Sky Fairies beside him, she was so scared that she couldn’t speak.","Which immortal had seen such a situation!?","“I’ve warned you, but you didn’t listen. So, you can go to the Gods’ Investiture Platform,” Mr. Fang said mildly, then he opened his hand and showed an ancient-looking stone stamp.","“The three immortals behind you are indeed powerful.” Feeling slighted that even Fang Qi dared to attack her, Heavenly Supervisor Green Sky Immortal put on her brave face despite the fear inside. She shouted, “Even you dare to try and kill me?!”","Instantly, Mr. Fang launched the stone stamp, and they heard a scream in the next moment.","“Ahh!”","She fell to the ground immediately.","Her head looked as if it had been smashed viciously with a brick, and brain matter sprayed into the air. With an astonished expression, her soul directly flew toward the Gods’ Investiture Platform.","...","After giving their spiritual treasures to the elders, Dragon Pool Immortal Master, Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master, and Avidya Immortal Master sat down on the clouds and talked about Dao.","Naturally, the battle wasn’t their concern. After all, they had given out three ultimate treasures, and it should be a piece of cake to subdue some insignificant immortals from nowhere.","To their surprise, in less than 30 minutes, Vast Spell and Vital Spell fled back in panic, looking disheveled!","Subconsciously, the three immortal masters looked down and saw that the three fairies and the young man named Fang Qi, who was the source of all the trouble, were all intact!","“What’s going on?!” Dragon Pool Immortal Master was instantly furious. “What’s wrong with you guys!? Why didn’t you capture them with the gold stamp that I gave you?!”","“The gold... gold stamp...” The two elders said haltingly.","Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master interrupted them, “Why are you so frightened?!”","“Those three’s spiritual treasures are too powerful. Even our gold stamp was taken by their treasure called the Chaos Essence Golden Dipper!” they said in panic.","“But you still have the Mystic Sky Treasure Scroll!” Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master said coldly, “And you have the Blood Jade Treasure Gourd that I gave you. It’s...”","Before he could finish, the other two stammered, “They were... taken as well.”","“What did you say!!!”","“Morons! You’re all morons! You even allowed such ultimate treasures to be taken! You’re useless!” Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master lashed out at them instantly. “Did you just watch as they took the spiritual treasures from you?!”","Even if their enemies’ spiritual treasures were more powerful, there should have been a battle of some kind. But the treasures had been lost in less than half an hour!","However, Dragon Pool Immortal Master looked chilly as he said coldly, “The Saint Spiritual Gold Stamp has obtained Dao for many years and acquired its own spirit long ago. Even if you had misused it, it could have attacked by itself. How was it taken?”","“This...” the two elders shook their heads and said, “We have no idea. A golden light flashed from the Chaos Essence Golden Dipper, and the gold stamp fell in it without letting out a sound!”","“What!!??”","“It took the Saint Spiritual Gold Stamp so easily?!”","The three immortal masters exchanged a look. “Perhaps... it’s another ultimate treasure...?!”","“It doesn’t matter if it is or not!” Innumerable Tribulation immortal Master who was dressed in a red robe had chilly light in his eyes. “If we have this treasure, who would dare to mess with us? Not even demonic gods from the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness or the Gods’ Palace!”","Even if they could get the ultimate holy item of fortune, it wouldn’t be theirs. But this thing was different...","They looked at the Three Sky Fairies, and greed appeared in their eyes. They hadn’t been so tempted by one treasure for a long time. “Such a rare treasure has fallen into the hands of these unknown fairies. What strength do they have that deserve such a treasure...?”","The three of them exchanged a look as chilly smiles appeared on their faces. “Treasures belong to the powerful beings. It seems like... it’s time for us to obtain another fine spiritual treasure!”"]},{"number":931,"title":"Chapter 931 - If Strength Is Not Enough, Use Brains","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Immortal Masters,” Profound Spell High Holiness said uneasily, “What... should we do now? The three fairies have that spiritual treasure... I’m afraid we can’t defeat them...”","The immortal masters exchanged a look and said while laughing, “If any unknown and insignificant immortals can suppress us just because they have one or two powerful spiritual treasures, then anyone in the world can overthrow our families after taking a tour in the Primeval Relic!”","“Immortal master, you’re right...” Profound Spell High Holiness suddenly understood the situation. If the eight immortal families that had existed countless years was rendered powerless by one treasure from nowhere, wouldn’t they have been destroyed countless times long ago?!","“But...” Profound Spell High Holiness asked again, “Do you have any immortal spells to teach us, three Immortal masters?”","The three immortal masters exchanged a look and then glanced at Profound Spell High Holiness before laughing.","Then, Avidya Immortal Master said, “But some problems in this world don’t need strength to solve them.”","He smiled and said, “We don’t need to confront them head-on.”","“Do you mean...?” Profound Spell High Holiness’s eyes lit up as a chilly smile appeared on his face.","“Everyone has weaknesses. If we can find their weaknesses, then isn’t it a piece of cake to defeat them?” If not necessary, they wouldn’t let these elders take risks since the families had spent lots of energy to raise them, and they were human resources that the families couldn’t afford to lose. “The ignorant beings who know nothing but using the power of spiritual treasures look powerful, but without a solid foundation, they are just rootless trees.”","He smiled in contempt. “When the wind blows, they will fall.”","Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master looked as if he was no stranger to this idea. After all, over many years of history, the eight major immortal families had collected countless treasures, and not all of them were obtained by their own merits.","“Then...” Hearing his words, Profound Spell High Holiness was delighted and said, “With that ultimate treasure, this being has possessed the power of a true immortal, and even we can’t defeat him. But he must open the shop to teach cultivation methods to people and has formed a close relationship with these mortals. The other day, they even used the so-called resurrection spells when the legion under the evil god from the Nine-Fold Darkness invaded. I think that they must have used a lot of their vital essence and can’t use such skills again for a long while.”","“In other words, even though that being has some power due to that treasure, he still has a mortal mindset which indulges in all kinds of feelings and desires such as kinship and friendship, which could become his weak points.”","“Then, it’s easy,” Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master said.","Avidya Immortal Master said calmly as well, “I heard that this figure wanted to battle the godly army and demonic army at the same time with his own power. Despite his abilities, he is a bit too arrogant.”","“Fighting on three battlegrounds, he must be under tremendous pressure and will surely show weaknesses. We only need to bypass the primary battleground and catch him off guard,” Avidya Immortal Master added.","Hearing his words, Profound Spell High Holiness looked grim and said, “Wondrous Spell High Holiness had people investigate him. This figure has some secret tricks up his sleeves, and the shop must have something to do with that ultimate treasure. I heard that someone tried to launch sneak attacks in the shop and was instantly suppressed by lightning bolts the moment he walked through the door. I’m afraid that this being knows his weaknesses, so he is well protected.”","“The shops are protected, but what about outside the shops?” Avidya Immortal Master said, “He has friends, and his friends have relatives who have their own friends, so on and so forth, involving almost all the people in the world. The mortals are so stupid with their connections,” Avidya Immortal Master said with a smile, “I heard that a little girl from the demon clan is very close to him, and the girl’s relatives all live in the Demon Nation, far from the humans. Am I right?”","Profound Spell High Holiness replied in surprise, “Right.”","Then, he said in a low voice, “There are more. The Nalan Family, Liuyun Daoist Palace, Heavenly Academy, and the other races living in the Elf Forest on the West Continent are all close to him...”","“One who aims big must disregard the trivial things and know when to forgo things. But unfortunately, this being’s way of doing things is ridiculously naïve. I’m afraid that he is still living in his idealized world. He can protect the people in his shops, but can he protect these weak mortals related to them?!” Dragon Pool Immortal Master said with a snicker, “He’s doomed to fail and work for others.”","“So, this treasure is a gift to us from the Heavens. If we don’t take it, isn’t it disrespecting the great treasure?!” Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master said with a laugh.","“Indeed!” Dragon Pool Immortal Master clapped his hands in appreciation and said to Profound Spell High Holiness and others, “We’ll stay here to stall the three fairies. For now, we can’t loan you other treasures, but...”","The immortal masters exchanged a look and said gravely, “Your mission is very important, so...”","Dragon Pool Immortal Master took a token from his belt and said, “You guys take my token and return to Saint Emperor Palace. I’ll loan you an ultimate great treasure, which was born in the time before the heavens formed, for seven days. Take this treasure to the Lower Region and quickly capture all his friends and their relatives.”","“Perhaps it’s not enough.” Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master said, “Avidya Daoist Friend and I will also give you our tokens. Vast Spell, Vital Spell, you two go and take the three spirit treasures I left in Innumerable Tribulation Palace, just in case that he has some secret trump cards. Be quick!”","“Yes!” they immediately answered.","“By that time, I’ll see what he’ll do!”","“When the mission is accomplished, you will all be well-rewarded!”","They were immensely delighted at the promise. “Thank you, Immortal Masters!”","...","At this moment in the battlegrounds in the mortal world, swords were drawn, and murderous spirit filled every corner. In contrast, the Saint Emperor Mountain was full of delightful atmosphere.","Yao Ji was holding a square-shaped strange communication jade.","It was the back garden of the Gui Family. Some young men sat at a stone table in a circle, each holding an identical strange communication jade in hand.","“Brother Yao, look at my auspicious beast. It has techniques such as Advanced Countershock, Suppression of Mount Tai, and...”","Before he could finish, they heard noises outside. The disciple with surname Gui stood up immediately and looked outward.","At this moment, a middle-aged man who looked quite like the young man walked in. “What are you guys doing here? Come with me and welcome the return of high holiness elders!”","“Elders?” The young man of Gui Family asked in bafflement, “Dad, didn’t the elders go to the Lower Region to kill the demons? How come they have time to come back?”"]},{"number":932,"title":"Chapter 932 - Daoist Friend, Please Wait!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I’m not sure,” the middle-aged man said, “It’s said that those demons are too powerful. Even the high holiness elders don’t want to battle them head-on. So, they plan to attack from the side.”","“Attack from the side?”","“What else can it mean? Who doesn’t have relatives and friends? It’s said that Profound Spell High Holiness will go to the territory of the Demon Clan in the mortal world.”","“Why do they need treasures if they’re going to the mortal world?” The young man was even more puzzled, wondering why the lofty elders would come back to get treasures before descending to the Lower Region again.","“No one knows what other dangers the mortal world will present. With even Wondrous Spell High Holiness killed, this issue is important. Don’t tell anyone about it.” the middle-aged man said in a low voice, “It’s an extraordinary issue that seems to concern an ultimate treasure in the mortal world.”","“What did you say?” The young man waved his hands in boredom. “I have no interest in these things.”","Then, he returned his attention to the games on his device.","The middle-aged man asked curiously, “What’s in your hands?”","“This is a small gadget popular lately in Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market.” The young man with the surname of Gui said with great interest, “It’s quite interesting and seems to understand our language.”","He said to the communication jade, “Power off.”","The game was turned off shortly as the communication jade dimmed.","“Look, this is called Artificial Artifact Intelligence which can execute some simple commands.”","...","– Meanwhile, in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance in Dajin at the distant Continent of Immortal Relic –","In a room full of circulating light of spiritual artifacts, Nalan Mingxue gazed at the messages before her in concentration.","“How is it going? Have you found anything useful?” Sitting around her were artifact masters of Wuwei Daoist Alliance.","“Ms. Nalan.” At this moment, Li Haoran walked in and said, “You secretly connected to all the audio artifacts in the mobile devices. Isn’t it a bit sneaky?”","“Besides, you didn’t tell us about this important issue!” Li Haoran said in displeasure, “Ms. Nalan, I hope that you don’t bring the sneaky schemes of the big families into our research room.”","As messages flashed before her, Nalan Mingxue said coldly, “Now, we’re in an unusual time. Besides, you’ve always known what kind of person I was since long ago.”","She shook her head indifferently and replied, “I can’t change my habits.”","“You!” Li Haoran was angered by her attitude.","Nalan Mingxue answered Li Haoran absent-mindedly since her eyes were caught by one of the messages. Her expression changed as she said, “Come and look at this!”","At this moment, each word of the conversation in the courtyard of Gui Family came to their ears!","“It’s said that those demons are too powerful. Even the high holiness elders don’t want to battle them head-on. So, they plan to attack from the side.” It was the middle-aged man’s voice!","“What else can it mean? Who doesn’t have relatives and friends? It’s said that Profound Spell High Holiness will go to the territory of the Demon Clan in the mortal world.”","At this moment, Li Haoran stopped reasoning with Nalan Mingxue as his expression suddenly changed. “Demon Clan... Xiaoyue!?”","“Not only Xiaoyue...” Nalan Mingxue put her arm on the desk and tapped her exquisite chin with her slim and long fingers while saying in speculation, “It seems like they got setback at the shop owner’s hands and are planning to do something dirty.”","Li Haoran looked grim. “What should we do then? Even though we can manage to resist these immortals, even that senior can’t protect everyone! After all, our strength is limited.”","“That senior is probably not as powerful as we think.” Nalan Mingxue rubbed her temples and looked as if she was having a headache. “Otherwise, he wouldn’t only show his hand at the last moment each time.”","“These rats!” Li Haoran gritted his teeth and said, “Not able to fight us with strength, they are resorting to these dirty methods! They defile the name of immortals!”","Then, they all fell silent.","“They use dirty and despicable methods. So what?” Nalan Mingxue’s tone was still mild. “History is always written by the victors. I’m sure that if the shop owner is defeated, he will be described as the No.1 Evil Demon in the whole world in less than 100 years.”","“As for the destruction caused by this war... it will all be blamed on this biggest evil demon.”","She continued, “Although I don’t know why these lofty immortals keep going after this tiny mortal world, I’m sure that they are doing it to obtain huge secret benefits. Besides...”","“They have felt that these ants have grown powerful enough to threaten them!” Nalan Mingxue said, “They’ve felt the threat, and they certainly want to kill it in the cradle!”","Li Haoran shrugged. “I’m only an artifact master and don’t care so much. Let’s inform the shop owner of these messages immediately.”","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang was still in the new shop at the East Continent.","Stationed about 15 kilometers away from the shop under the leadership of the immortal masters, these immortals sent out some elders to taunt Mr. Fang everyday. Mr. Fang felt harassed by them. He didn’t go out and beat them, afraid that it was their trick to draw him away. But if he did go out, these old farts ran so fast that they were gone before the Three Sky Fairies could appear.","Mr. Fang began to wonder if he should ask Three Sky Fairies to ambush these immortals. After all, the people in Investiture of the Gods always fought fairly and didn’t use any dirty tricks.","At this moment, he received a message from Nalan Mingxue. [Be careful, they are just doing it to pull your attention while their real targets are the Demon Clan, Elf Forest, Heavenly Academy, Liuyun Daoist Palace, etc.]","“...” Mr. Fang replied immediately, [They are playing dirty?!]","[I’m afraid so.] Soon, he received another message from her. [What’s your plan?]","[With Half City fighting the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness, the West Continent fighting the Godly Realm, and the East Continent fighting the Immortal Realm, you’re fighting on three fronts. They know that you can’t split forces to other places and have almost reached the limit.] Nalan Mingxue added. [Their intention is to further split your force.]","“...” There was a while of silence.","Fang Qi looked at the Advanced Carrier Rock in his hand. The condition for using the Carrier Rock was that he must reach 10% synchronization rate with the characters in the Cultivation Room. The Three Sky Fairies were his limit now.","At this moment, the sect masters were beyond his reach.","Of the five Advanced Carrier Rocks, he had used four to summon Yang Jian, Kong Xan, the Ten Heavenly Masters, and Three Sky Fairies respectively. Now, only one rock was left.","There was only one Carrier Rock, but it must block enemies in many places.","Remembering his joke of fighting three realms, he felt like it was ridiculous. “I can’t get out of it now...”","However, what else could he do anyway? Almost everyone knew that he had an ultimate treasure and wanted to take it from him by force.","[If you can’t find a solution...] Nalan Mingxue seemed to be stating a fact. [I suggest you make a choice and give up some people.]","[No!] Mr. Fang replied.","[What can you do then?]","At this moment, he thought of someone!","[Haven’t you heard that only kids do multiple-choice questions?] Mr. Fang reached out his hand and said, [I want them all!]","Nalan Mingxue was at a loss for words.","...","Meanwhile, after taking several ultimate treasures that had guarded the Saint Emperor Place for countless years, Profound Spell High Holiness was walking down the Saint Emperor Mountain with great smugness.","“If this trip is successful...” While riding on colorful clouds, he led some elders to cross the vast ocean and travel toward the Demon-Slaying Platform.","On the way, they suddenly saw a bright light beam lightly landing on a high mountain and illuminating a large territory. It turned the sun and created many clouds. These immortals were surprised and said, “How come I’ve never seen this mountain before?”","Lowering the clouds, these immortals entered the mountain curiously and clicked their tongues at the wonders they saw. It was indeed a great immortal mountain with evergreen pine trees and boulders that had existed for tens of thousands of years. “I wonder which mountainous immortal lives here.”","They were about to venture deeper in when a voice came from behind, “Daoist friends, please wait.”","“!!??”","“Who is it!!??”","[TL Note: FBI liked this chapter.]"]},{"number":933,"title":"Chapter 933 - Shen Gongbao Instigates Profound Spell High Holiness’ Defection","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Despite his surprise, Profound Spell High Holiness wasn’t alarmed with his hands resting on his belt. After all, he had quite a few spiritual treasures that were even more powerful than the Saint Spiritual Gold Stamp!","To ensure that they could hit Fang Qi’s weaknesses without error, the immortal masters had given several excellent spiritual treasures to these elders.","With these spiritual treasures, he was sure that few people in this world could harm him.","Therefore, regardless of the stranger’s cultivation strength, Profound Spell High Holiness looked back with great confidence, thinking, Humph! If he dares to show any ill intentions, I’ll test my new spiritual treasures on him!","He turned around and saw it was a Daoist riding on a tiger.","Profound Spell High Holiness said cautiously, “Daoist friend, who are you? Where are you from?”","The Daoist said with a smile, “I’m Shen Gongbao from the Kunlun Faction.”","“Kunlun?” Profound Spell High Holiness thought for a long while but couldn’t remember a place called Kunlun. Thinking of the countless hermits in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, he thought it wasn’t strange that he didn’t know about this place. “Perhaps it’s a name that these mountainous immortals gave for the place, and it’s natural that I don’t know about it.”","“Daoist Friend Shen?” Lately, the eight immortal families had been recruiting masters with rare abilities from everywhere, and Profound Spell High Holiness showed his habitual benign face and said, “I wonder what business you have here, Daoist friend?”","Shen Gongbao said, “I came especially for you, Daoist friend.”","“For me?” Profound Spell High Holiness was even more confused. “I’ve never met you before...”","However, at second thought, he realized that even though he didn’t know this immortal, the latter might know him, the famous Profound Spell High Holiness from the immortal Gui Family.","He immediately corrected himself ad said, “What can I do for you, Daoist friend.”","He wasn’t worried that this immortal was here to block him. After all, with these powerful ultimate treasures with him, even 100 such independent immortals were not his match.","Then, he heard Shen Gongbao speak while laughing, “I heard that you and other members of immortal families encountered some difficulties when you went down to the Lower Region to kill demons. Now you have returned to the Saint Emperor Palace to fetch spiritual treasures and are on the way to the mortal world and fight the demons. Is it true?”","Despite the secrecy of his mission, Profound Spell High Holiness knew that he couldn’t hide the fact that he had returned to the Saint Emperor Palace. He thought this stranger only knew about his trip to fetch the treasures and not his true intentions.","Therefore, he nodded and said, “Yes.”","Shen Gongbao continued, “After the deaths of the spirit generals and several of your good friends, you still don’t understand the situation and will go down to the Lower Region so recklessly?”","“Have you discovered the background of those immortals and the treasures?”","Profound Spell High Holiness shook his head. “Isn’t it Sect Master Tongtian? I think he’s just a hermit from Innumerable-Immortal Sea, and he just gave himself the name of Tongtian.”","Shen Gongbao said with a smile, “This is a big issue. Throughout history, did anyone do such important missions without planning it first?!”","Profound Spell High Holiness thought for a moment and shook his head while replying, “No.”","“Why are you acting so recklessly then?” Shen Gongbao asked again.","Profound Spell High Holiness said, “The immortal masters have made the plan. Daoist friend, you don’t need to worry about it.”","He thought, You don’t know my true purpose; I don’t need to waste my time on you.","Shen Gongbao said, “I heard that the spirit generals had all been confident of themselves before they died. Before those high holinesses were killed, they also thought that they would obtain victory without question. Now, Daoist friend, you act so recklessly without knowing the dangers that are awaiting you. Aren’t you following your dead friends’ footsteps?”","Hearing these words, Profound Spell High Holiness’s expression changed a bit.","Shen Gongbao said solemnly, “According to my observation, you’re not a reckless person. Who instigated you to do this? They... are evil.”","“This...!?” Profound Spell High Holiness’s expression changed again as he said, “I’m not reckless. In fact, even the immortal masters haven’t gotten to the bottom of this issue.”","Shen Gongbao said with a smile, “Yes. Even the immortal masters didn’t get to the bottom of it, but they want you to venture into the depths of it? Aren’t they asking you to die without even knowing the situation?”","Hearing his words, Profound Spell High Holiness began to sweat as he considered the situation carefully.","The water in the pond is so deep that even immortal masters can’t get to the bottom of it, but I’m only a high holiness elder...","But we intend to launch sneak attacks this time instead of fighting head-on. How can there be dangers?","At this moment, he saw Shen Gongbao move his fingers, looking as if he was doing some calculations.","Startled, Profound Spell High Holiness immediately remembered that those immortal masters could also calculate with divination.","If they couldn’t find the answer but this immortal can, does it mean that this stranger’s skills at divination are higher than those immortal masters?","If they could find the answer but had concealed the results from me...","It would be more meaningful.","He thought for a while, and Shen Gongbao saw sweat popping out on his forehead.","Then, Profound Spell High Holiness asked in alarm, “Daoist friend, do you have a solution? Please tell me!”","Shen Gongbao shook his head and said, “I don’t know your mission. Since it concerns the immortal masters, I don’t dare to ask...”","“It’s okay!” Profound Spell High Holiness felt as if he was facing a huge unknown black hole that even the immortal masters didn’t understand. If he ventured into it without a plan, he might follow the path of Wondrous Spell High Holiness.","After all, those dead people’s souls hadn’t returned yet. If their souls survived, they could still reincarnate. But if the souls were gone...","He shivered at the thought.","Hearing Shen Gongbao’s words, he seemed to see a lifeline in an ocean as he was drowning.","“I can only explain it briefly to you and won’t say anything important. Daoist friend, you have a meticulous mind. Can you give me some advice?”","Then, he explained the plan briefly.","Shen Gongbao’s expression turned grim after hearing his words.","Seeing his expression, Profound Spell High Holiness looked even more anxious. He quickly asked, “Daoist friend, what do you think?”","Shen Gongbao said, “Daoist friend, you’ll be in big trouble; how come you are still not aware of it?”","“What do you mean?” Profound Spell High Holiness thought that even if he failed the mission, he could still flee with the help of these spiritual treasures. How come I’m in big trouble?","Shen Gongbao said, “Let’s not talk about if you’ll succeed or not. Daoist friend, have you ever considered what would happen if you succeeded?”","“If I succeeded?” Profound Spell High Holiness said in puzzlement, “Of course, I’ll be rewarded by the immortal masters. What do you think?”","Shen Gongbao said, “This is when the real trouble comes! Daoist, after you threaten that figure with the lives of his friends and relatives, will that person hate your guts?”","Profound Spell High Holiness laughed, “Of course. But... he will be turned into a fierce ghost. I’ll beat his soul out with one palm strike!”","“Daoist friend, don’t you understand?” Shen Gongbao said, “I think perhaps it’s you who will become a fierce ghost!”","“Me!?” Profound Spell High Holiness froze. “Why?”","“If you’re successful, that figure in the mortal world will hate you so much that he’d want to die with you. If he is willing to hand over the ultimate treasure at the price of your life, what would you do then?”","Profound Spell High Holiness’s heart lurched, feeling stupefied. “This...!?”","He had considered it carefully, but he still hadn’t thought of this move! If so...","Profound Spell High Holiness sighed heavily, “I’m in danger!”","“If you fail, then it means that the Lower Region conceal extreme dangers. Daoist friend, you might not end up better than your dead friends, I guess.”","“...” Profound Spell High Holiness instantly turned ashen-faced and said in horror, “You mean... I’ll die both ways!?”"]},{"number":934,"title":"Chapter 934 - Break the Array?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Shocked and furious, Profound Spell High Holiness pointed at the sky and cursed, “Old Farts! You’re despicable! I’ve cultivated for countless years at the Saint Emperor Mountain and obtained countless merits. But you b*stards treat me like this?! You are sending me to die for that treasure?!”","“Fortune and disaster are closely related,” Shen Gongbao said, “Whenever a treasure is about to come out, everyone in the world are faced with tribulations. There are people who obtain the treasure, and there are naturally people who are killed by the tribulations.”","Profound Spell High Holiness remembered that each time when a treasure came out, it had always caused a bloody catastrophe and the deaths of countless immortals.","Considering the words that the Daoist named Shen Gongbao had said, he instantly felt that this immortal was intelligent and mysterious.","“Then, do you mean that I’m the one being killed by the tribulation?”","“Not necessarily,” Shen Gongbao said, “Only some people want you to be the one who needs to go through the tribulation.”","“Daoist friend, don’t worry. I’m here to help you handle this tribulation!”","Hearing his words, Profound Spell High Holiness was elated. “What’s your plan?”","“I have two plans; one is so-so while the other is better. Hear me out,” Shen Gongbao said, “Daoist friend, if you follow the so-so plan, you can stay out of all this by hiding in a place, letting the gods, immortals, mortals, and ghosts turn the world upside-down with wars.”","“But... if you do this, you can’t come out ever again. Otherwise, you’ll get killed.”","“Then, what’s the better plan?!” Profound Spell High Holiness asked again.","“Working with the mortal world,” Shen Gongbao said.","“What?!” Profound Spell High Holiness was instantly displeased and said, “How can these mortals defeat the Innumerable-immortal Sea? If I work with them, won’t I also get killed one day?!”","Shen Gongbao said with a smile, “Daoist friend, didn’t you say that you couldn’t get to the bottom of the issue of the mortal world? Why don’t you take this opportunity to enter their camp and find out the real power that they have?”","“If they really can’t defeat the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, with your power, isn’t it a piece of cake to run? With these spiritual treasures in your hand, won’t you live a great life anywhere you want?”","“You’re right, Daoist friend!” Extremely delighted, Profound Spell High Holiness said, “Now that the ultimate treasures I took from the Saint Emperor Palace are mine to use, the least that I can do is finding an immortal abode to understand the mysteries contained in them and cultivate diligently. Regardless of how fierce they are, no one can mess with me after my cultivation strength grows to a higher level!”","“If that place has powers that I don’t know right now and defeats the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, you can take the position of the biggest hero with these ultimate treasures!” Shen Gongbao said, “Isn’t it a better life than being a chess piece under others’ manipulation?”","Understanding dawned on Profound Spell High Holiness. “Thanks for your advice, my deadly situation is now totally reversed!”","Then, he said farewell to Shen Gongbao and went to help the Origins Internet Club with all the ultimate treasures that he had taken from the Saint Emperor Palace.","...","Shortly, another Daoist dressed in green clothes was flying toward the Demon-Slaying Platform with his sleeves flapping in the winds.","He was Vast Spell High Holiness.","With a glowing face, he was feeling very good after taking some spiritual treasures from Innumerable-Tribulation Immortal Palace. “I’m impatient to see the faces of those ignorant and arrogant mortals when the time comes.”","“Hahahaha...” He burst out laughing. With these spiritual treasures, who in the mortal world could block him?","Suddenly, he saw an immortal mountain before him. With steep cliffs, the mountain had all kinds of immortal beasts wandering through the deep forests.","“Huh...?” As he was enjoying the scenery in fascination, a voice came from behind him. “Daoist friend, please wait.”","“Who is it?!” He looked back abruptly.","Looking around, he saw a Daoist flying over from the distant sky while riding on a tiger.","He looked at the Daoist curiously. “Where are you from, Daoist friend.”","...","-Three minutes later-","With the spiritual treasures from Innumerable-Tribulation Immortal Palace, the old man who was wearing a wide green robe descended to the Lower Region to help the Origins Internet Club, looking arrogant and aggressive.","...","At the Demon-Slaying Platform, a Daoist dressed in a yellow robe was about to descend.","He was Vital Spell High Holiness.","With ultimate treasures from Avidya Immortal Palace, he was about to descend to deal with the ordinary and powerless mortals. He said with a chuckle, “The immortal masters are too cautious. I can accomplish this mission with my own power. I’m afraid that I’ll have no chance to use these spiritual treasures.”","He had taken two steps forward when a voice came from behind him, “Daoist friend, please wait.”","“...!!??”","With a shiver, he put his hand on the spiritual treasures hanging at his belt subconsciously! He would attack without hesitation if any danger appeared!","He looked back immediately, “Who is it?!”","“I’m Shen Gongbao from the Kunlun Faction.” A Daoist came out riding on a tiger.","Vital Spell High Holiness chuckled. It is just a mountainous Daoist; I’m being paranoid.","I’m still in the Immortal Realm; what’s there to be afraid of?! He chuckled in his mind. Even if he’s an enemy, with his low cultivation strength, he’s no match for my spiritual treasures.","He walked over and asked, “Daoist friend, what’s going on?”","...","Less than five minutes later, a ferocious Daoist dressed in a yellow robe aggressively descended to the Lower Region to help the Origins Internet Club with the ultimate treasures that he had gotten from Avidya Immortal Palace in his pockets.","...","At this moment, the three immortal masters, Dragon Pool, Innumerable Tribulations, and Avidya, and the immortal troops were stationed dozens of kilometers away from the new shop at the East Continent","In the campsite, Avidya Immortal Daoist moved his fingers and did some calculations. “It has been days since Profound Spell, Vast Spell, and Vital Spell went to do the mission. They should be back any moment now.”","“They should,” Dragon Pool Immortal Master said, “We’ve done enough stalling with that kid. If we continue doing it, I’m afraid that he will see our true intentions.”","Innumerable Tribulations Immortal Master laughed and said with a nod, “I can feel the presences of Profound, Vast, and Vital. Let’s go! I’ll teach this evil being a good lesson for making me stay in the Lower Region for so long!”","He slammed his hand on the handle of his chair and stood up with an aggressive expression. With murderous spirit in his eyes, he gazed at the distance.","“It seems like we have a good show to watch today!” Avidya Immortal Master walked out of the tent while laughing, “Hear my command, troops! Follow me and destroy the demons in the mortal world!”","“Yes!” The thunderous yells shook the Heavens and Earth!","The sky above Mr. Fang’s shop had gradually calmed down, but now dark clouds gathered and swept across the sky. Shouts and yells rose from the ocean of clouds and shook the sky.","Mr. Fang walked out of the shop, looked up at the sky and saying, “What? You’ve come up with a way to break the array today?”","“Yes!” Dragon Pool Immortal Master sneered, “Today, I’ll show you how this array is broken without us doing anything!”","Before them, the 600 cultivators and warriors instantly built the array outside the shop. Yellow winds swept across the space and blocked the sun and sky. It was the Nine-Turn Yellow River Array.","Sitting in the array, the Three Sky Fairies waited for them to try and break the array.","The three immortal masters sat in their carriages while other immortals flanked them on both sides, showcasing the formers’ extremely noble positions. With a wave of his arm, one of the immortal masters yelled, “Vast Spell, Vital Spell, and Profound Spell, where are you!? Why don’t you hurry up and help us break this array!?”"]},{"number":935,"title":"Chapter 935 - Saint Patriarch Showing Up! You Have No Idea What Kind of Existences Are Behind Us!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Vast Spell, Vital Spell, and Profound Spell, why aren’t you coming out and helping us break this array?!” Dragon Pool Immortal Master yelled.","“Old B*stards!” At this moment, light from treasures flashed below as the ultimate treasures from the Saint Emperor Palace, Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Palace, and Avidya Immortal Palace lit up and crashed toward the immortal masters’ heads!","“Old farts, die!”","Before they could understand what was happening, the three immortal masters were instantly devoured by a big wave of spiritual light!","They all looked disheveled when they got out. Looking at Vast Spell, Vital Spell, and Profound Spell as if they were ghosts, the immortal masters said, “This... what has happened to these three?!”","Regardless of how hard they thought, they couldn’t understand the situation. The three immortal elders had been sent to fetch treasures in the Immortal Realm and travel back to the mortal world.","How come in the blink of an eye, they are attacking us with the spiritual treasures that we gave them?","“Could it be...?” The three immortal masters exchanged a look and felt extremely weird. “Perhaps this ultimate treasure can even bewitch people?!”","While they were wondering, a golden light shot out from the horizon.","The golden light swept toward them, intending to engulf them.","Horrified, the tree immortal masters launched several spiritual treasures which were all ultimate immortal treasures that had been in their precious collection for countless years. However, under the golden light released from the gold dipper, these treasures had all been instantly sucked away like straws in a tornado.","“What... the heck is this treasure?!” When Profound Spell High Holiness and other high holinesses lost their treasures earlier, it was blamed on their unfamiliarity with the control of those spiritual treasures. But now, even their best treasures couldn’t withstand that golden light for one moment before falling into the gold dipper.","The three immortal masters had thought that the three fairies could at most breakeven with them with this spiritual treasure, just like how Luya Daoist Immortal had boasted of his own strength in front of the Yellow River Array after the 12 Golden Immortals were captured. Realization only dawned on them after everything already took place.","“No!” Dragon Pool Immortal Master yelled, “The power of this treasure is far greater than we expected!”","Almost instantly, Avidya Immortal Master’s expression changed drastically.","Dragon Pool Immortal Master shook his hand, and a turbid and yellow ancient scroll spread out. Instantly, the scroll blocked the sky and the sun as well as the great golden light from the Chaos Essence Golden Dipper for one second.","Immediately, the three of them turned into three colorful light beams and fled!","From the direction of the colorful light beams in the distance, a voice said with shock and fury, “Hurry... hurry up and enlist the help of saint patriarch!”","...","“B*stards, don’t run!” With a crisp yell, Green Sky Fairy immediately followed them.","Then, the other two sky fairies chased after them with strong murderous spirits. The three immortal masters had stayed before the array for a long time but only sent elders to test the waters without revealing themselves. Now that they finally got a chance to capture these three, the Three Sky Fairies wouldn’t let this opportunity escape!","With the light of the golden scissors before them, the three flew up in clouds while riding on their mounts in the blink of an eye!","“Don’t let them go!” Mr. Fang’s face darkened. “The three immortals are evil; we can’t let them go!”","He immediately chased after them.","...","Chasing after the three immortal masters, the Three Sky Fairies went through the barrier between the Immortal Realm and the mortal world and crossed the Innumerable Immortal Sea. Chased by the Golden Dragon Scissors and the Chaos Essence Golden Dipper, the three immortal masters fled frantically to an unknown place.","In the distance, they seemed to see a tall immortal mountain with immortal clouds floating around it.","Without thinking, the three immortal masters shot into the immortal mountain frantically!","“Older Sister, let’s follow them!” Green Sky Fairy yelled and chased after them.","Coming after them, Fang Qi looked at the immortal mountain. After a moment of consideration, he also shot into the mountain, following them closely.","In the mountain, the peaks and green forests stood like strange barriers as birds and beasts ran through them.","The three immortal masters landed on the mountain and walked down a mountainous path. The moment that Fang Qi entered the mountain, a strange force pulled him down from the sky. He saw a stone table on one side of the path before him. Sitting across to each other at the stone table were two old men, one in a purple robe and the other in a yellow robe. They were engrossed in playing chess and seemed oblivious of the Three Sky Fairies and Fang Qi.","They blocked the path with mild expressions. The Daoist wearing the yellow silk robe and hemp shoes with his hair pulled up in a Daoist bun slightly looked up and glanced at the Three Sky Fairies and Fang Qi casually.","“Who are you? How dare you block our way?!” With cold expressions, the Three Sky Fairies demanded.","The yellow-robed Daoist sized up the Three Sky Fairies and Fang Qi coldly and yelled in a harsh tone, “Evil beings!”","“How dare you act so atrociously at Wild Tribulation Summit?!” The purple-robed Daoist glanced at them coldly. “Who are your masters? Maybe I know them. Even your masters wouldn’t dare to act arrogantly on this mountain. The juniors nowadays are getting more and more unruly.”","“Who are you?” Cloud Sky Fairy asked.","“Older Sister, don’t waste your breath on them!” Green Sky Fairy said, “Since they are blocking us, they must be accomplices of those three immortal masters. Let’s use the Golden Dragon Scissors and Chaos Essence Golden Dipper and give them a taste of our power!”","When she said those words, the two old men didn’t move a muscle. Instead, they sneered.","Then, a golden light of scissors cut toward the yellow-robed Daoist. Before it came close, it was sent to one side by an invisible force. The Golden Dragon Scissors couldn’t harm a hair of his!","Then, the Three Sky Fairies launched the Chaos Essence Golden Dipper. Before its golden light got close, the yellow-robed Daoist brushed it aside with his wide sleeve!","Only at this moment did the three immortal masters stick their heads out of behind the strange-shaped boulder.","Walking out from behind the boulder, they said with great respect, “Two saint patriarchs! We were hunted down by them and didn’t mean to offend you. Please forgive us!”","The yellow-robed Daoist waved at them and then looked at Fang Qi and his companions. “You hunted down immortal masters of our clan and even tried to commit murder on Wild Tribulation Summit; you’re audacious!”","Fang Qi couldn’t sense any presence from these two old men, and that made them feel like bottomless abysses. Fang Qi didn’t dare to make any careless moves.","He had only felt this way with only one kind of people.","They might represent the unreachable summit of this world. Standing before such existences, even Fang Qi felt a sense of fear instinctively.","“Are you afraid now?” Innumerable Tribulation Immortal Master said with a sneer, “Do you understand now? You were doomed to fail from the very beginning!","He looked at Fang Qi and his companions as if they were dead people. “People all think that us, the immortal masters who rule the immortal families, are the most powerful existences in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, but it’s a ridiculous misunderstanding. Defeating us means nothing. You have no idea what kind of existences are behind us!","“Now, do you understand?!”"]},{"number":936,"title":"Chapter 936 - One Essence Turns into Three Pure Ones; The Final Battle Is About to Begin!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Afraid? Saint Patriarch?” After a long while, Fang Qi said with an indifferent smile, “Perhaps.”","Dragon Pool Immortal Master’s face darkened. “Have you been driven crazy by fear?”","“I’m afraid that with such immortals and gods like you, how can this world have peace?”","“As the Heavens has lost order, the land is destroyed, and the sky is shattered, the world is on the brink of collapse. Have you guys ever experienced the suffering in the mortal world?! Have you ever tried to stop the collapse of Heaven and restore the order of Heaven and Earth?!”","“You sealed the void and stop mortals from obtaining Dao. In the passage of time, tens of thousands of Dao pursuers had ended their lives with regret...” Fang Qi pointed at the mortal world below them and said, “Have you heard the sad weeping and furious roars of the heroes who couldn’t realize their great dreams in the past tens of thousands of years?!","“The mortals worship you by burning incense sticks and holding sacrificial ceremonies. Do you deserve their worship in the past tens of thousands of years!?","“No,” Fang Qi said with a snicker, “How could you call yourselves immortal or sages?! What did you do to deserve the title of immortals and sages?!","“Who gave you the right to call yourselves immortals and sages?!","“I live a lawful life in the mortal world, but you threaten my life again and again. Now you dare to accuse me of acting atrociously and behaving recklessly?!”","“Ridiculous!” The yellow-robed Daoist was so furious that he laughed and said, “We were born with the Heaven and Earth, bear the fortune that equal to Heaven and share the Dao essence of the Heaven and Earth. Born as the masters of Heaven and Earth, our words are heavenly laws. You mortals broke the heavenly laws and will be punished with the death penalty!”","“You even dare to break into the Wild Tribulation Summit and try to kill these immortal masters!” the Daoist said with a ferocious sneer, “Evil being! You even dare to lecture us!”","“Don’t waste your breath on him,” the other Daoist said.","Then, the yellow-robed Daoist waved his big sleeve, and the Heavens and Earth, as well as the sun and moon, seemed to change positions. An extremely horrifying force crashed toward Fang Qi and the Three Sky Fairies.","Even the Three Sky Fairies turned pale, let alone Fang Qi who felt as if all his bones and meridians would break under this huge force. It felt as if the entire Heaven and Earth had received some order and were pressing down on Fang Qi from all directions with a vicious force!","Dragon Pool Immortal Master and the other immortal masters sneered at this sight.","They seemed to have foreseen this ending long ago.","“It reminds me of something.” At this moment, Dragon Pool Immortal Master said with a snicker, “Among the mortals, there was once a figure in the primeval time who taught these ignorant creatures the art of language and essence cultivation. Some even achieved a cultivation strength that could rival that of an immoral. After the transformation of the Heaven and Earth, they ascended to the Immortal Realm and had the honor to temper immortal physiques.”","“Some members of other races even became gods as well, and they were worshipped by their clansmen for tens of thousands of years. But...” Dragon Pool Immortal Master said coldly, “Unfortunately, they only taught a group of wastrels. In our eyes, ants are just ants. The scum don’t even have the right to be cannon fodder. Those who didn’t die on the battleground are all respectful to our families!”","“You’re immortals who have just obtained your immortal physiques. If you think that you can now mess with our patriarch, that is ridiculous!”","“You’re just human immortals. Even after you cultivate for 1,000 years, 10,000 years, or even 10 million years, you are still no match for us. This is the Mandate of Heaven! Today, you evil creatures will get the chance to see our power and the gap between you and us. When your souls are scattered, you’ll die without regret!”","The yellow-robed Daoist waved his sleeve, and the force turned heavier and was about to shatter everyone into dust at any moment!","At this moment, Fang Qi must use his last trump card, which was the Godly Summon Rock that he had obtained. Although it had a restriction on the level of characters that it could summon, it was different from the Carrier Rocks since it didn’t need synchronization rate. There was only one such rock; these items were extremely precious as they were all created by the System energy!","Suddenly, clouds opened, and the mist disappeared in the sky. A wave of pure lights covered the sky while auspicious colorful clouds danced in it. Almost at the same time, the Heaven and Earth cleared up as the heavy pressure suppressing Fang Qi and the Three Sky Fairies instantly vanished!","“Who is blocking me!” The yellow-robed Daoist remained in his attack posture, but the force had vanished long ago. Looking up at the sky, he saw a Daoist coming over while riding on a black ox. Meanwhile, all of the glamorous light in the Heavens and Earth went away as a pure light shot up into the sky!","“Who are you?!” No one, including the immortal masters, had imagined that someone could block the attack from this saint patriarch!","“Breaking the chaos and revealing the Heaven and Earth, he established five elements in the mortal world. Guiding Xuanyuan to immortality, he showed power at Han Fortress with Dao that is eternal,” Laozi sang the poem. “I’m the Ren Sect Master, Laozi – Li Er.”","“I heard you say that all immortals who were once mortals are ants?” Laozi said with a smile, “Ever since Pan Gu separated the Heaven from the Earth, I’ve merged my body with the Heaven and created the Three Pure Ones with one streak of pure essence. After being the Master of Ren Sect for so long, I’ve never heard of the things that you just mentioned. Today, I’ll see if I, with my human origin, will look like an ant in your eyes too.”","“What Ren Sect?! Are you in charge of a group of evil monkeys?”","The Cloud Sky Fairy and her sisters said in a hurry, “Greetings, Uncle-Master!”","Laozi nodded and said with a snort, “These ignorant animals are audacious! Hurry up and attack!”","The saint patriarch of the eight major immortal families were not ordinary immortals!","At this moment, winds howled as the universe shook. Lightning bolts showered down like raindrops, shaking the mountains and rivers. As the yellow-robed Daoist circulated his spiritual energy, lightning snakes lit up the sky and the land while murderous spirit filled the Ninth Heaven!","On the other side, an exquisite pagoda rose from the top of Laozi’s head with clouds and settled the universe!","The yellow-robed Daoist’s face turned cold. Although he hadn’t used all his strength yet, he couldn’t afflict any damage on the immortal before him!","“Xuanhuang Saint Master, I’ll help you!” At this moment, the other saint master entered the fray, attacking Laozi from the other side!","“This evil being is powerful!” The Daoist yelled, “Let’s see if you can fight both of us?!”","“Why not!?” At this moment, Laozi split into three as colorful light beams rose high into the sky with dazzling radiance!","Laozi had spilt into three forms!","“Being old before Heaven was formed, yet I was born after Heaven, I obtained the form and my name through the Li Family. I learned and cultivated under Hongjun, so I can turn one essence into the Three Pure Ones!” Laozi sang the words and said with a smile, “Even if a pearl is as tiny as a grain, it will still be radiant. Even if two more come, I can fight four of you at the same time!”","At this moment, Xuanhuang Saint Master was almost dazed by the scene, and the three immortal masters shivered uncontrollably.","The two lofty saint masters are being suppressed by only one immortal right in front of us?","They exchanged a look of horror. “Who... who the heck is this being?!”","This scene almost turned every idea that they had formed in their heads in the past tens of thousands of years upside-down!","More horrifying was that an extremely giant Tai Chi Pattern rose in the sky, blocking the sky and the sun. It was coming down from the sky toward them!","There was no exit for them, either on the land or in the sky!","“Go!” At this moment, seeing the Tai Chi Pattern coming toward them, even the two saint masters of the immortal families were horrified and fled immediately!","In the next moment, the three immortal masters fell into the Tai Chi Pattern and were instantly turned into dust! Their souls went directly toward the Gods’ Investiture Platform.","On this day, three realms experienced huge quakes!","As the most powerful existences in the three realms, their lives, which had lasted for countless years, and their permanent reign were severely threatened now. None of them could sit back and wait to be butchered!","In a permanent godly palace above the Heaven, a pair of permanent eyes slowly opened.","It gazed at the place below the bottomless abyss.","Even such a lofty existence had a grim look in its eyes.","“How about...?” a voice came from the abyss.","“Let’s join hands!”","“Where’s the Ferocious Godly Army!?” A voice seemed to fall from the top of Heaven.","In the distant battleground of gods and demons, many withered corpses and remains crawled out from the deep underground of the desolate battleground.","They seemed to have been buried in the ground for countless years. Some were thin and dry and could only be recognized as elves from their long ears...","Some were big orcs with broken armor.","There were countless cultivators and warriors who raised their longswords high. They roared with defiance as their faces turned toward the sky, looking as vivid as when they were alive.","In the ruins, the broken walls and buildings seemed to be telling their glorious past and the stories that had been buried in dust long ago.","Now, they were only shells and corpses that were being controlled like the living dead","Wearing a set of shattered armor, the blank eyes of the slim and tall elf suddenly lit up with green gloomy glint.","...","In the Elf Forest, an exquisite figure wearing a long dress and a silver-haired senior were devotedly staring at the lake which was as bright as a mirror.","First Elder Hyru’s eyes looked sad. “It has been so many years... has our god abandoned us long ago?”","Suddenly, a streak of dark light suddenly lit up in the lake!","“The Elf God answered us!” It had been so many years! They jumped and cheered, looking as happy as kids who had just received candies.","..."]},{"number":937,"title":"Chapter 937 - The World-Ending Tribulation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 937: The World-Ending Tribulation!","...","At this moment, Ancestral Master Xiaoyao and the others finally exhaled a sigh of relief after seeing that the Innumerable-Immortal Sea had drawn back their forces.","They returned to their cave abode. In the Ancestors’ Shrine, there was a new memorial tablet which had been added a few years ago.","“Ancestral Master...” some Daoists asked him, “You have a patriarch...?”","“Of course.” Ancestral Master Xiaoyao said proudly, “My patriarch was once a disciple of an immortal master. He had heaven-reaching cultivation strength and ultimate talents. I heard that he later ascended to Heaven and became an immortal!”","“Now that you mention it, I remember that Immortal Master had the same surname as the shop owner. Hehe...” He laughed, seeming to be in a good mood to have the rare opportunity to talk about his past. “At that time, the East Continent and the West Continent hadn’t separated yet, and my patriarch even knew people from some of the other clans, such as the elves. I wonder if they met each other in the High Region.”","Hearing his words, the other Daoists looked expectant. Suddenly...","“Ancestral Master... look at the tablet!”","They widened their eyes, seeming to have sensed a special presence from that tablet.","...","This didn’t only happen to the people on the East Continent. Races such as orcs and dwarves also experienced similar things.","A series of legendary figures who had been revered and worshipped for countless generations... their presences seemed to have woken up.","Even in the Liuyun Daoist Palace in the Continent of Immortal Relic...","“Palace Master, look...” In the shrine, a nameless memorial tablet emitted a weak presence for no reason.","Perhaps this world had forgotten them long ago, but they finally began to rekindle like cinder.","But this time...","“The Ferocious Godly Army has been awakened,” Above the Godly Court, two voices said the same words.","...","On the top of the whole world, in the palace that ruled both the Gods’ Palace and the Innumerable-Immortal Sea –","Even the immortals from Innumerable-Immortal Sea and the gods from the Gods’ Palace were on their knees.","Before them was the highest will that lorded over the whole world!","The Godly Court seemed to be even older than this world. From the time before the world was created, from the ultimate high position, it had watched as the whole world and the long river of time moved forward.","The pre-heaven gods, immortals, and sages now all shed their arrogance and defiance, looking as respectful as if they were seeing their master and lord.","It was said that these pre-heaven lifeforms were taught by this being, so it wasn’t wrong if they called him ‘master’.","In this holy court, only the king that ruled the gods and the sages that led the immortals had the right to speak.","These extremely powerful existences seemed to have known something or had prepared long ago.","The sages and the gods lowered their heads on their knees and listened to the most ancient lord of this world. Above their heads was the vague universe, and constellations and nebulae seemed to be surging and moving in it.","It wasn’t a form but a will, an ultimate spiritual will that existed beyond forms.","Perhaps it had appeared in many different forms. But now, it was intangible and formless.","At this moment, it was silent, but everyone seemed to understand its message.","“Mortals... will never control the Heaven and Earth...” At this moment, immortals, gods, and demons all looked at the mortal world which looked as small as a bead in their eyes. Murderous spirits shot out of their eyes and up into the sky!","“You will be destroyed in this world together with these mortals!”","This time, the immortals, gods, and demons would join hands and destroy the mortal world first! Things after that would depend on their own abilities!","When the gods and demons were angry, Heaven would fall, and the Earth would be destroyed!","They seemed to be telling these stupid and ignorant mortals who were the true lords of this world!","...","In less than one day, a phenomenon that no one had thought of or dared to think of happened in the work.","In the new shop at the East Continent, Jiang Xiaoyue had just stepped out when she felt the Heaven and Earth shaking violently. Countless rare beasts flew up from the faction in panic. In the distant mountains, countless birds were startled and flew up from the forest.","“What’s happening?!” In the Elf Forest that was as beautiful as green jade, Elf Girl Sala tried to comfort an elk. The mild-tempered wild beasts had suddenly turned restless.","Then, with a sad cry, the elk fled into the depths of the forest as if it had become crazy.","The Heaven and Earth turned chilly and gloomy while all creatures became frantic!","Wild gusts seemed to be playing a sad and magnificent tune for the living beings between Heaven and Earth. The mountains and rivers turned red as fires spread to everywhere.","Perhaps this was the true catastrophe – the world-ending tribulation!","The cultivators, warriors, and mages in the Continent of Immortal Relics, the East Continent, and the West Continent seemed to feel a deep melancholy as if the whole world was weeping and howling for the imminent fate.","At this moment, the Elf Forest was ripped apart from the middle, looking as if a beautiful piece of jade suddenly broke in half!","Looking at the sky, black clouds had completely blocked the sky on this side and engulfed the whole world.","Meanwhile, blinding golden light covered the other half of the sky.","Black and white, pure and turbid... they merged with each other beyond the Heaven and formed one force!","Those supreme existences’ power was more than what this world could withstand. But in this battle, they stepped into this world without restraining their strength, disregarding any damage that they might afflict on the earth.","“This world... is ridiculously fragile!” a voice came from the sky.","“Be careful, these guys are not easy to handle,” a Daoist said in a cold voice.","“Xuanzhong Saint Master!” An extremely miraculous and strange figure materialized in the black wind. “Don’t boost the enemies’ morale and underestimate our own power.”","When the array appeared in the sky, it shattered the whole sky like a horrifying forbidden spell. Endless thunders howled, and horrifying black thunderbolts poured down from the dark void beyond the sky!","Crack!","As the sky shattered, countless black thunderbolts poured down like a black waterfall with great horror, knocking down countless mountains and cracked the land!","The whole world seemed to be destroyed by this force and returned to the chaotic state at the beginning of time.","This was the world where the mortals lived in; it contained all their beautiful memories. But at this moment, it seemed to come to an end...","“No!” With wicked facial expressions, countless people raised their heads and roared in fury, looking crazy. But they could do nothing as they watched the distant sky shatter and even more horrifying disasters coming to the mortal world!","They watched as the gods and demons ran rampant in the sky. Those existences who they had worshipped now brought them the most horrifying despair without moving a finger.","With their eyes wide in fury, some of these mortals shouted and charged up, but they were instantly struck by lightning bolts and fires that were falling from the sky. They turned into blocks of charcoal before dropping to the ground!"]},{"number":938,"title":"Chapter 938 - We’ll Be Writing Our Own Legends (I)","paragraphs":["Chapter 938: We’ll Be Writing Our Own Legends (I)","“We...” Elf Queen Kellybel looked at the scene before her in a daze. “We’ll be destroyed?!”","Gu Tingyun stood at the edge of the cliff inside Heavenly Academy with a walking cane and gazed at the whole world that had been plunged into the world-ending tribulation.","He turned his head and looked at the naïve-faced disciples thronging behind him.","Outside the Jiuhua City Shop, Song Qingfeng, Xu Zixin, Nalan Mingxue, and the others who no longer looked soft and immature as well as many civilian warriors such as Liang Shi and Fu Jianghe slowly raised their heads and looked up at the sky.","This was the world where they lived.","However, it was being cruelly trampled by others.","...","When the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, Gods’ Palace, and Nine-Fold Darkness began to retreat, everyone thought that the worst had passed. However, no one had imagined that, compared with the previous wars, this was the real catastrophe that was going to destroy the world.","At this moment, everyone realized that they had only defeated a tiny number of these extremely powerful existences.","In the previous wars, they had shown only a very small portion of their strength. Now, as their truly stunning force was revealed, everyone looked horrified.","...","On the continents, people walked out from buildings one by one and looked up.","Perhaps they had been the happiest when they were ignorant.","Working each day as the sun rose and resting as the sun fell, people were bound by the invisible laws of nature. They were ignorant but also were free of pain and fear.","If nothing unexpected happened, perhaps the whole world would go on like this until it dissolved into nothing one day without people noticing it.","The closer they got to the truth, the more they felt that the world was just an abyss of endless darkness in the ocean.","Perhaps the world before them was Hell.","The people who tried to resist had all been destroyed.","...","“What a fragile world. I even feel like it will collapse if I put one finger on it,” a voice said while sneering. It showed itself from the darkness like an evil devil that had brought endless horror to this world.","With three heads, eight legs, a human face, and two horns, it spoke the human language but was cold and inhumane. One could see the undisguised evilness from its face.","The world had its dark side and bright side, and this being undoubtedly represented the deepest darkness.","The sky was filled with both black and white light. Darkness and light started to merge in one place in the sky; it was a scene that no one had ever seen before.","No one could remain intact before this force since this force controlled the whole world!","“Once a human did the same stupid thing, and he ended up dying on this land.” A heroic-looking god who was wearing golden armor and a crown gazed at the land as he sat on a huge silverish-white dragon. “Is this man his reincarnation?”","“Even if he is, can he change his pre-destined fate?” A saint master dressed in a purple Daoist robe gazed at the world below them coldly. “That ultimate treasure has stayed in the mortal world for a long time. It seems like these mortals have obtained some of its presence.”","“Then, we must kill them all,” the evil devil said chillily, “It’s the ultimate fortune that has been nurtured by the Heaven and Earth for countless years! How can we share it with these bugs!?”","“We must take it out as a whole.”","Countless years had passed. An ultimate thought from that loftiest existence flashed across the minds of these gods and evil demons. “It’s time for harvest.”","“Ferocious Godly Army!?” A voice seemed to come from beyond the Heaven.","Only one voice remained.","“Roar!” Mind-disturbing whistles seemed to rise from their souls, and the Heaven and Earth seemed to merge again. As gusts howled, thick grey mist rose and engulfed the whole world.","...","“It’s the Elf God!” In the Elf Kingdom, Elf Queen Kellybel and First Elder Hyru watched as the mist spread. However, the mirror-like lake looked even clearer as if it was welcoming its creator.","“Perhaps ...the Elf God has descended to the Lower Region?! He returned to see us?!” Elf Queen Kellybel and First Elder Hyru led the elders to walk up to welcome the god, trembling in excitement.","...","“The patriarch is coming back!” In the East Continent and even the Continent of Immortal Relics, the people in the major factions were thrilled.","After all, these patriarchs were the figures who they boasted about for generations.","“Palace Master, look!” Standing outside the ancestor shrine with other cultivators behind him, Xue Daolv stared at the strange phenomenon intently.","“That patriarch is the most ancient one of our Liuyun Daoist Palace!” With a smug face, Xue Daolv showed off his knowledge and whispered to the disciples beside him, “It’s said... our Liuyun Daoist Palace is only a side branch of the side branch established by this patriarch.”","It happened everywhere in the world such as the Orc Kingdom, the Elf Forest, and Liuyun Daoist Palace.","Fog rose, and it was as chilly and gloomy as frost.","A blurry and twisted figure walked over from the fog.","Everyone’s cheers stopped, and their excited expressions froze on their faces. Then, their faces turned wicked in horror, and they yelled with fear, “What... what’s this?!”","In the Elf Royal Palace, a figure slowly walked out of the misty shadows. With half of its withered face concealed under the cape, it pulled out a rusty strange bow to the fullest and aimed it at all the elves before it!","It looked exactly like the grand statue outside the Royal Palace!","“That’s...” First Elder Hyru almost chocked. “The godly technique, Moon Fall?!”","With a humming sound, his mind turned blank.","Almost subconsciously, he lunged to one side. In the next moment, he looked back and saw several astonished elders being devoured by the white light that was shooting up into the sky!","Meanwhile, an invisible force seemed to spread between Heaven and Earth.","“No... it’s no longer the Elf God!” Elf Queen Kellybel said in a shaky voice.","They were filled with despair. In this final tribulation, their god didn’t bring them redemption but destruction!","...","It happened not only in the Elf Forest but in the factions such as Liuyun Daoist Palace and all the kingdoms in the West Continent...","It felt as if a massacre had begun!","“That’s... the immortal technique – 10,000 Li Flowing Clouds! According to the legends, it’s the most powerful immortal technique in the mortal world!”","In Liuyun Daoist Palace, the holy cultivation place full of flowers and flowing white clouds, countless disciples who had been anticipating the descent of their patriarch were plunged into a shower of blood!","Screams and howls rose in waves! They still looked astonished since none of them had anticipated such a thing!","What they saw was the fate of the losers. Perhaps one day, they would become like this too. While they were worshipped by the future generations, they already became puppets and butcher knives of other beings and would slash cold blades at their descendants!","..."]},{"number":939,"title":"Chapter 939 - We’ll Be Writing Our Own Legends (II)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“It’s time for us to attack.” The whole sky was divided into three colors – purple, golden, and red. The black and red almost occupied half of the sky.","Perhaps it was no longer a war.","The evil demon with three heads and eight legs waved its hand and controlled one part of the world by force.","A destructive and colorful light beam crashed down with a long fiery tail like a comet smashing toward the sun, turning the entire Heaven and Earth red. Some people even suspected that the whole land would be destroyed by this horrifying attack!","A young man flew up below the comet-like light and was instantly engulfed by it!","This was the ultimatum of destruction launched by the three most powerful civilizations in this era!","...","Eight saint masters, ten of the most ancient pre-heaven gods, and 12 primeval devil gods.","They stood in different directions on the top of the sky and watched coldly as the humans struggled and died before their weak presences gathered in one place between the Heaven and Earth.","“Is this... our fate...?”","“Will we face the destruction this way...?”","“What... should we do?!”","In the whole world, mortals, cultivators, and warriors found countless voices talking inside their minds.","Endless negative emotions filled their minds as chills ran down their bodies. This was the real state that they were in.","“Origin Plan! Activate!” A voice seemed to come from the distant ancient time!","The chilly murderous spirit reversed like torrents pouring out of the Yellow River!","In Liuyun Daoist Palace, Xue Daolv paused his steps and took off his outer robe as the palace master. His eyes were full of steadiness and calmness that he had when he dealt with countless monsters far more powerful than himself!","“Just as we did before.” In the Elf Royal Palace, Elf Queen Kellybel quickly calmed down after the initial shock. An extremely pure golden lightning bolt exploded in her hand!","“Now, we have surpassed you!” Leaning on his walking cane, Gu Tingyun squinted his eyes, and a surge of pure essence shot up into the sky!","“The remaining disciples! Listen to my order! Form the array!” Inside Liuyun Daoist Palace, with a thunder light jumping in her palm, Su Tianji yelled in a cold tone. In the place of her usual laziness, a chilly heroic glint flashed in her eyes, making her look like a true immortal!","“Get ready...” Zong Wu held a short blade, and the Heaven and Earth suddenly dimmed!","“Attack!” The talented young people such as Song Qingfeng had shed their youthful softness long ago. Right now, except for those who had gone back to their factions to honor their ancestors, everyone else from the East Continent and the West Continent had gathered together in large numbers regardless if they were facing immortals, gods, mortals, and ghosts.","A purple flying sword emitted chilly light which shook the Ninth Heaven. Facing the pouring enemies, tens of thousands of swords shot up into the sky from behind.","“Innumerable Sword Immortal Technique!”","With spiritual energy floating under their feet, the paladins had holy spiritual essence flowing in their bodies.","“Zeal!”","“Bestow Faith!”","“Judgement!”","“Sword 23! Destroying all six paths!” Nalan Hongwu launched sword energies from his palm, and the sword spirits that was many times more powerful than the world-destroying Sword 23 shattered an immortal like a dazzling godly light beam!","“Fist of the Heavens!” St. Leidon followed closely, and his power as a paladin turned into a thick light pillar and almost pierced a huge hole in the sky!","“Your era is in the past!”","The joint army of immortals, gods, and demons swarmed up like torrents and giant waves. However, the mortals charged head-on fearlessly!","They had understood why they must raise their swords. They had no exit but no regrets either.","This wasn’t a catastrophe since...”We’ll be writing our own legends!”","“Face the wind!”","Wind and fire surged up as the two torrents crashed into each other!","...","Fang Qi was holding a stone tablet on which were written the words ‘Gods’ Investiture List’!","At this moment, the System Interface showed that he had finished the task to severely punish the previous troublemakers. He had turned the immortal masters who led that invade to dust.","However, he didn’t expect things to deteriorate so fast.","Unlock the highest-level privileges!","Fang Qi looked up at the comet-like colorful light beam that would fall on his head in the next moment, and then he glanced at the extremely powerful existences whose expressions were either icy and chilly or solemn and cold.","“Bring it on! Come and try with your full strength!”","A gold bridge spread out, separating Heaven from the Earth and the gods and demons from the mortals. It also stopped the collapse of the world below the bridge.","At this moment, golden light and purple clouds shot up into the sky! It looked as if jade towers and gold palaces appeared at the top of the void!","The River of Heaven flowed, stars blinked brightly, shining on everywhere, and colorful phoenixes soared. Dressed in gold armor, countless strong soldiers stood tall under the flapping flags! Like on a primeval scroll, the legendary names lit up one by one. Radiant light shone in the sky as figures that only existed in the legends appeared in this world!","With a seven-feet red silk ribbon fluttering in the sky, a figure appeared while stepped on golden wheels with lotus flowers in his eyes!","With a vertical eye between his brows, a godly general proudly looked at the Heaven and Earth and shot godly thunderbolts from the Ninth Heaven!","Heavenly masters, immortals, and gods stood on the two sides above the clouds in the sky!","Further up, a few Daoists sat or lay in the clouds while four swords, Immortal-Slaying, Immortal-Butchering, Immortal-Trapping, and Immortal-Exterminating, rose in the air. Then, three Treasure Ruyi emitted purple misty essence as they appeared!","In the distant sky, murderous spirits mixed with yellow essence. In the misty clouds, a huge ax appeared first, followed by a headless battle god!","Then, a fiery bow appeared below nine suns as a god with star-bright eyes stepped out and pulled the bow to the fullest!","As the Demon-Summoning Flag waved, tens of thousands of demons bowed their heads!","A pair of bright eyes suddenly opened, turning the sky as bright as day. With eyes like suns, a huge dragon flew up with a lantern in its mouth.","Extremely grand, aggressive, overbearing, and ultimate presences rose in the east.","At this moment, tens of thousands of gods descended, casting light on all eras!","Between Heaven and Earth, countless gazes turned toward this miraculous phenomenon that one wouldn’t see even in 10,000 tribulations.","They were either envious, reverent, admiring, or completely stunned.","Like the waves of a surging flood, the stunning sensation blasted at everyone’s hearts again and again.","This huge group of immortals and gods were at least as large as the combined army of the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, Gods’ Palace, and Nine-Fold Darkness!","At this moment, this group didn’t show the slightest disadvantage while battling with the three realms. In the vast sky, the immortals, gods, and demons didn’t even know where these gods came from but were truly stunned by the sight.","The people on the ground looked up at the sky and burst into waves of exclamations as they watched these gods fight against the combined force of the three realms. “They are... gods from Huaxia?!”","Divided by the gold bridge, two wars began on two battlegrounds at the same time with one in the sky and the other on the ground!"]},{"number":940,"title":"Chapter 940 - No Regrets over Entering Huaxia in This Life; Wish to Be Born in Zhonghua in the Next Lifetime!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: Zhonghua is another name for Huaxia.]","The joint army of immortals, gods, and demons poured down like a tipping River of Heaven.","In the west, figures dressed in pure white mage’s robes flew into the sky one by one, showering light everywhere. They were the Godly Judgement Army led by the God of Radiant Light Judgement!","In the northeast, immortal music sounded as tens of thousands of immortals poured down from the sky while standing on the surging yellow clouds!","In the southeast, demons and ghost howled in the black clouds!","Battle... no, everyone was engaged in an extremely fierce life-and-death killing tribulation!","Battles were everywhere on the vast land, including Liuyun Daoist Palace, the Elf Forest, and the Orc Kingdom.","In the Elf Royal Palace, the ragged cloak on the thin figure looked even more shabby as swords and magic spells struck it.","In Liuyun Daoist Palace, all the disciples and elders panted heavily, and almost the whole palace had been turned into ruins as if an extremely fierce battle had just happened.","In the frontal battleground covered in blood that formed rivers, people like Nalan Hongwu and St. Wilson suddenly stopped their attacks and turned to look ahead.","Figures walked out from the mist either with swords or whisks. Through the mist, only silhouettes could be seen.","One of them carried a huge dragon-shaped sword that was wrapped in thick and heavy chains.","“That’s...” Ancestral Master Dugu said in a deep voice, “The patriarch of our clan...!”","“And... the ancestors and senior generations of our families and factions that have declined long ago!” he continued.","Another two figures appeared from the mist. One held a decayed staff in its withered right hand, but the precious red stone on the top of the staff was impeccable.","The other held a huge two-handed sword that as tall as one man, and the light emitting from the blade chilled people’s bones!","“First Magic Saint...!?”","“Also... the First Sword Saint!” St. Wilson said in a grave voice.","They were the Ferocious Godly Army. The withered figures walking out from the mist seemed to be weeping about their failure before their deaths.","However, their unimaginable great power seemed to be telling their descendants the long lost but glorious legends in the past.","Their empty eye sockets showed no emotions, and they butchered everything around them like puppets.","Their chilly murderous spirits swept forward like mists driven by gusts!","If they still had their spiritual awareness, perhaps they would want to kill themselves! With the swords of their descendants!","When the mortals’ eyes met these empty eye sockets, a strange emotion seemed to be conveyed. Are you ready to shoulder the future?!","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu and the others seemed to hear voices from the primeval time and looked even more solemn.","“If you’re ready, cut off my head and advance forward!”","In the coarse and wicked roars, countless horrifying attacks exploded from all directions!","“Herrrr!”","At this moment, the players showed confidence, calmness, and great power on their faces, and they also demonstrated meticulous skills and souls that stood tall in the Heaven and Earth!","“As you wish!” With a smile, Nalan Hongwu shook off the blood, flesh, and dust on the blade of his longsword.","“Betting with the knights’ honor!” The paladins raised their huge swords and released rainbow-like holy light!","“It’s our duty to guard our nations and citizens!” On the battleground, military sabers were raised.","The ancestors from the distant ancient time and the ultimately talented descendants stood facing each other in solemnity on this battleground.","“Charge!”","Instantly, saber energies, sword shadows, countless horrifying magic spells, and ultimate sword spirits engulfed the entire Heaven and Earth! Surrounded by the great army of the three realms, the members of the alliance force from different races in the mortal world looked like radiant flowers that were blooming.","Sword spirits traveled all through Nalan Hongwu’s body. As their sword blades collided, his sword cut into his rival’s neck with only a few millimeters of advantage and great accuracy!","Then, Nalan Hongwu withdrew his sword in one smooth move.","Remembering the countless battles in the past, both virtual battles and battles in the real world, he thought that he might have truly reached the realm of entering micro if this realm really existed!","Tink! With a blunt metal-colliding noise, Saint Leidon used parry to deflect his rival’s huge sword and then almost at the same time...","“Omnislash!” Behind him, a figure flew up. Sword Saint Wilson raised his sword and started a symphony of destruction!","“Build the Golden Light Array!” In the sky above Liuyun Daoist Palace, heavenly light shook as thunders resonated between the Heaven and Earth!","“Blade of the Exile!” In the Elf Forest, extremely horrifying green energy poured out with a roar like a tsunami on this doomsday!","At this moment, everyone on the battleground felt a bone-deep chill. This was the furious roar of will coming from the creatures living in the mortal world.","In the short dozens or hundreds of years, they had reached a realm that their patriarchs couldn’t have imagined; some of them had even stepped into the realm of immortals and gods. With their battle skills and mindset reaching the pinnacle stage, the unyielding mortals in this world had the right to be proud!","“Stop them! Stop them!” The roars of the God of Radiant Light Judgement and other gods and immortals resonated between the Heaven and Earth.","“Kill!” At this order, many demons rose in all directions! A huge shadow engulfed the sky, and it was...","“The Shadow Legion?!” All the people from the West Continent were startled as they felt this presence.","World Mage Hematon said with a grim expression, “It’s the evil god that they worship!”","However, they were no longer as weak as they had been! They had slaughtered all the gods in God of War, listened to the lecture of Dao given by a sage in Journey to the West, and watched all kinds of Dao spells in Investiture of the Gods. Regardless of which continent they were in now, they could look back on the hard battles in the past with confidence and arrogance.","“How can you block me?!” They had reached the same immortal realm, and their swords weren’t inferior compared to their enemies’, but their battle hunger was even fiercer!","“Was it you who sent the sects under you to destroy the factions on our continent thousands of years ago? After almost cutting off all the faction lines, you are coming again thousands of years later and bringing catastrophe to us again?!” Flying up on his sword, Nalan Hongwu studied the God of Radiant Light Judgement before him.","Beside him, Zong Wu, Gu Tingyun, and other cultivators and warriors all stared at this figure with cold eyes.","“It was you who sent the legion to disturb our mortal world for the last thousands of years, leaving corpses all over the land and nations ruined?!” On the other side, the knights and mages had fury in their eyes as they studied the evil demons before them.","“Holy light! Do you see that enemy?” Led by Commander Elven, the paladins rode on their griffins and shot into the enemies’ hearts like sharp arrows!","...","“Who... the heck are you?!” In the sky above the golden rainbow bridge, the King of Gods who was wearing a godly crown and ruled the Gods’ Palace asked solemnly.","Spiritual light dispersed from Fang Qi’s palm. At this moment, he felt that no matter where he was, this was the most solid rock he could lean on and obtain strength from!","All the thoughts in his mind turned into one sentence, “No regrets over entering Huaxia in this life; wish to be born in Zhonghua in the next lifetime!”","An arrow tore open the void. Shot from the powerful Sun-Shooting Bow, the godly arrow turned into a light beam and flew out!","The headless battle god roared.","In the next moment, the immortals, gods, and demons crashed into each other on the top of the sky. It looked as magnificent as the merge of rivers of stars!","“That’s all you can do. Kill!” Xuanzhong Saint Master who was in a purple robe roared.","In the next moment, four immortal swords shot up into the sky, turning the Heaven and Earth into.","In the distant four directions, ancient swords suppressed the universe as the extremely weathered ancient worlds revealed in the red lights.","They were the following.","[Immortal-Slaying!]","[Immortal-Trapping!]","[Immortal-Butchering!]","[Immortal-Exterminating!]","Three Treasure Jade Ruyi, Tai Chi Scroll, and all kinds of connate spiritual treasures crashed down from the array!","“Ahh!” A scream rose, and it was followed by the second and the third scream...","Then, screams rose all over the mountains and fields!","As the sword energies flashed inside the array, corpses littered everywhere, and blood turned into rivers.","The immortal treasures that the enemies were proud of and their unrivaled cultivation strength seemed to be useless at this moment!","[Immortal-Slaying Sword is sharp, Immortal-Butchering Sword is deadly, and red lights rose when Immortal-Trapping Sword is launched. With miraculous variations, Immortal-Exterminating Sword makes Daluo Golden Immortals soak in blood!]","This seemed to be the true catastrophe!","These lofty existences could bring a catastrophe with a thought. They had never imagined that one day, they would become the targets of such a horrifying catastrophe!","At this moment, they seemed to be facing their own doomsday!"]},{"number":941,"title":"Chapter 941 - The Incarnation of the Great Dao!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Gods’ Investiture List opened, causing the souls of gods and immortals to fly into it and sealed them inside!","Inside the Immortal-Slaying Sword Array, even the saint masters, ancient gods, and demon gods got lost in the waves of chilly red light.","The purple-robed saint master who was the leader of the eight major immortal families, the King of Gods who ruled all gods, the king of evil gods from the Nine-Fold Darkness who wore the bone crown and emitted horrifying and ominous presence had expressions that they never showed before.","At this moment, they all turned ashen-faced! After living for countless years, they rarely had emotional fluctuations. But at this moment, an emotion named fear rose in their hearts!","“What should we do now?!” Only a few saint masters were left among the eight major immortal families. Although they had extremely high strength and had fought in the array for a while, if the situation continued, even their pre-heaven physiques and the power of the saint masters couldn’t save them.","The purple-robed Xuanzhong Saint Master, the leader of the eight saint masters, said with a grim expression, “Now, we only have one option – asking Master for help!”","Before these pre-heaven saints and primeval gods were born, there had existed ultimate existences who even these saint masters and ancient gods must look up to. These existences were probably even more ancient than this world. One of the ultimate existences had inspired the eight immortal families and the gods from the Gods’ Palace.","According to the legends, this existence came from the chaos beyond Heaven and had the most ancient power that could lord over everything.","He was the Lord of the Godly Court!","The other such existence was the Lord of Demon Gods in the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness; he was also the source of horror for all the immortals and gods!","With a strange sound, all the laws of nature and the most original forces in this world were activated.","As Heaven and Earth merged, the pure and the turbid essences were being created! In the space that was suppressed by the four swords that made up the Immortal-Slaying Sword Array, the sword energies suddenly slowed down...","The time and space inside the Immortal-Slaying Sword Array seemed to be under layers of great pressures, and its movements turned slow and difficult. An ethereal light which looked as vague as the meteors in the depths of the universe transformed into a huge hand that seemed to be condensed from stars in the universe, and it entered the array!","The hand was so huge that it almost blocked the entire sky in the Immortal-Slaying Sword Array.","“It’s Master!” The purple-robed Xuanzhong Saint Master immediately dropped to his knees and yelled, “Master is making a move!”","The King of Gods from Gods’ Palace looked disheveled while he fought in the array. He suddenly looked up and stopped what he had been doing at this sight.","All the immortals and gods in the array stopped fighting and looked at the scene in a daze.","Ever since they had consciousness, they had never seen the Lord of the Godly Court who ruled the Heavens and Earth making a move in person!","How stunning it was! How unimaginable it was!?","His first move was attacking this horrifying major array!","At this moment, an extremely grand voice that sounded like the chiming at the beginning of the world came from beyond the Heavens.","Like a giant bell, the voice resonated through all ages! No one could imagine what horrifying existences could reveal such ultimate power with a few words.","Everyone looked up and saw a spiritual figure standing in the universe with its head touching the stars. As if it stood outside of time and space, it looked down on this world coldly!","It forced its way through the Immortal-Slaying Sword Array and reached for Fang Qi in the array.","“We came at the creation of the Heaven of Earth just for the heart of this world and the seed of Heaven and Earth’s Fortune. This item has combined all the best resources in the Heaven and Earth and condensed all the essence from everything in the world. After brewing for a long time, it has come to maturity today. We have waited through thousands of tribulations, and it is all worth it. Do you think I’d allow you to ruin our plan?”","But in the next moment, the huge hand suddenly paused and then shattered into pieces!","“Who is it?!” A furious voice came from beyond the Heaven.","Standing beyond the starry sky, a figure turned from vague to solid until he completely materialized.","They faced each other from distance.","Immortal music floated over from beyond the heaven, “Sleeping in the high ninth layer of clouds, I understood true Dao on a futon. Across the Heaven and Earth, I’m the almighty master. Pan Gu created Tai Chi which gave birth to Yin and Yang and then four directions; I passed Dao to three disciples, and two of them created the Chan Sect and Jie Sect. They are leaders of Dao sects, all coming from Hongjun.”","“Who... is it?!” Seeing this scene, all the sages of the immortal families, pre-heaven gods, and demon gods from the plane of Nine-Fold Darkness’s minds turned blank as if their heads would explode in the next moment. How could such a figure exist in this Heaven and Earth?!","“What... should we do now?!” Xuanzhong Saint Master and the other saint masters felt chills running down their bodies.","“Hurry! Help me take the ultimate holy power of fortune!” Xuanzhong Saint Master rolled his eyes and said, “Then, with the force of the entire Heaven and Earth, we can melt and destroy anyone!”","“But...” Xuanhuang Saint Master beside him said with worry, “Where the heck is this ultimate holy item of fortune?!”","Xuanzhong Saint Master seemed to be recalling some past events. “After we were born, this world has evolved continuously. In the core of this world and the depths of the land, the essence of everything in this world and the best resources gathered and nurtured a spirit after a long time. We subdued it with our master and found that it contained endless Great Dao, which means it’s our destiny to take charge of the Great Dao and control the Heaven and Earth.”","“Unfortunately, the godly item had a spirit. Its spirit escaped, so we chased it and shattered it. While we fought over it with the demon gods from the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness, it disappeared into the mortal world. The shattered soul pieces scattered in the world and spread some of the presence of fortune to the mortals, which makes it extremely hard to detect its whereabouts. Only after we truly refine it can we truly control this world,” Xuanzhong said grimly, “According to our calculations, this item should have revealed its true form to the world by now. But why...”","He stared at Fang Qi without blinking. “Why doesn’t this person show any sign of it?!”","“If it reincarnated and was born in the mortal world with a human form...” Xuanhuang Saint Master stared at Fang Qi in the array and said, “Regardless of how well he hides it, he should have revealed some signs of it by now!”","Xuanhuang Saint Master asked, “If it took the human form, how can we recognize it...?”","“It’s hard to recognize, but due to its special physique, most of the energy it took in will automatically heal its damaged soul, which means that, regardless of how high its’ cultivation strength is, it will always feel hungry and need food,” Xuanzhong Saint Master said, “But this brat has fought so long without wanting to eat...?”","On the battleground in the mortal world, Jiang Xiaoyue sat on the ground while panting. Then, she rubbed her tummy and looked frustrated. “How come I feel especially hungry today...?”","She took out a bottle of iced red tea bigger than her small head in a hurry and gulped it down heartily. “Gulp! Gulp...”","The two saint masters exchanged a look, and their faces had never looked so astonished before. “Perhaps... we were chasing after the wrong person!?”","“???” Behind them, the last few immortal masters heard their words and looked at the young man before them.","We tried to smash his shop countless times, and you are now telling us that... we got the wrong person!!??"]},{"number":942,"title":"Chapter 942 - The War Ends; Gods and Demons Fall!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Do you feel it?!” Xuanzhong Saint Master suddenly said.","“That’s its presence; it’s right on this battleground!” Xuanhuang Saint Master exclaimed, “It appeared! I’m sure! I can feel it!”","“It’s been so many years; all our efforts and careful planning are for this moment...”","But at this moment, the gold bridge separated the Heaven and Earth into two worlds. Besides, they were now in the Immortal-Slaying Array, and it took all their great power to temporarily block the array. Going down to the battleground in the Lower Region was impossible!","They looked down at the battleground where the mortals were fighting the demon gods of the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness and saw rows of knights forming an array of shields, taking the front line. As warriors charged and priests sprayed holy light, the huge army advanced step by step with great steadiness!","“Priests! Follow and heal them!”","“Paladins! Push forward!”","Hoarse yells resonated all over the battlefield.","On the other side, people like Nalan Hongwu, Gu Tingyun, and Zong Wu forced the God of Radiant Light Judgement to defend frantically.","Sword shadows moved like lightning bolts. With his extremely powerful sword techniques, Nalan Hongwu fought the God of Radiant Light Judgement head-on. Countless wondrous sword techniques shot across the sky like galloping heavenly horses, but they also oozed an extraordinary steadiness.","Murderous spirits dimmed the sky as Zong Wu led others to hold back the Judgement Army from one side. Under their attacks, even the powerful God of Radiant Light Judgement was out of breath as he scrambled to block his enemies.","These mortals seemed to have drained all their strength. They moved as if they had rehearsed the tactics and calculated the steps countless times. Their battle methods were unthinkably experienced and vicious!","The troops from Gods’ Place, Nine-Fold Darkness, and the eight major immortal families were astonished to find that they were at a complete disadvantage!","This was the mortal joint army that they saw!","This was the first time that they were stunned by a group of enemies, a group of ants!","These mortals were indeed inferior to them in strength, but they had suppressed the joint army of immortals, gods, and demons step by step with almost zero casualties and mistakes!","Everyone looked grim.","“So, that’s it...?”","“Give it to them!” They had never imagined that the war in the mortal world would come to this degree, but now these immortals, gods, and demons seemed to have made a decision and yelled as one, “After experiencing countless tribulations ever since the primeval time, we can only win and can’t lose this war!”","“Kill them all!” Chills ran down their bodies. These existences made this decision not only because of greediness. The more important reason was that they couldn’t allow such enemies to live any longer.","As tribulations took place, the fortune of the world showed. These beings had taken a share of the laws of nature in Dao-Splitting Palace. Now, they were the Heavenly Dao!","At least, these mortals were not their match in strength!","They believed that as long as they achieved what they had planned in the past tens of thousands of years, no existences, regardless of how powerful they were, could block them! At least in this world that belonged to them, they would be absolutely unrivaled!","...","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue was taking a break on the edge of the battleground. Then, she thought that slacking on the side wasn’t good, so she stood up and dusted off her skirt. However, she was still feeling hungry, so she took out a bag of potato chips and began fighting and eating at the same time.","“Huh...!?”","“Why are they all staring at me?!” She shivered and felt chills running down her spine.","...","The battle that the mortals were engaged in wasn’t less difficult than the battle above the gold bridge.","They were only mortals who had just made breakthroughs.","They fought with great efforts step by step to make the scale of victory tip toward them. When they were on the brink of success and almost defeated these gods and demons with mortal strength, this sudden change almost turned all their efforts to waste!","Like a tight string that was holding the world together, everything would instantly collapse if the string broke!","...","On the battleground in the southeast, the demons from Nine-Fold Darkness looked as if they had gone berserk collectively and crashed onto the shield formations regardless of their lives. They charged repeatedly like black surging torrents until a fissure appeared.","Like a big dam that was broken, the shield array cracked open, and demons poured in toward one direction.","On the battleground in the west, a surge of stunning godly energy shot up and shielded the God of Radiant Light Judgement and the soldiers around him. Then, hundreds of elite Godly Judgement soldiers shot up light pillars into the sky as if the will of the whole world came into their bodies, and the laws of nature protected their souls!","“Doomsday Judgement!” With a furious yell, destructive light pillars rose between the Heaven and Earth and almost turned the mortal world into a horrifying Hell!","...","“Where are the tanks? Shield wall! Shield wall, push! Push!” Sword Saint Wilson let out a hoarse roar and charged into the black currents by himself.","Jiang Xiaoyue’s mind was now blank. Together with people like Li Lanruo, Mu Qing, and Yue Bai from Heavenly Academy, she was surrounded by the crazy Godly Judgement soldiers who swarmed up like waves of a tsunami.","“Kill!” Yue Bai slashed her sword without stopping.","“Kill!” Mu Qing’s eyes were red with murderous spirit.","Jiang Xiaoyue’s small face looked pale.","However, this small team of academy disciples still couldn’t see the end of their enemies even when their swords broke, and their energies were exhausted!","...","“Priests, heal! Heal!”","“Mages, control them! Hold on!”","“Hold on... hold on a bit more!” Commander Elven suddenly looked back and saw his teammates fall one by one; his heart bled for them.","At this moment, an extremely horrifying roar came as the strength of the huge evil god in the center of the battleground rose again!","A surge of extremely evil energy turned into a black tsunami and spread out in all directions.","The broken shield array at the frontline was instantly knocked down and devoured. Then, the energy continued to spread to the backline.","At this moment, even the ultimately powerful masters such as Sword Saint Wilson, World Mage Hematon, and Swein felt cold inside. “We’ll be wiped out!”","In the previous battles, they didn’t end with death. But this time, perhaps they would truly meet their end.","They looked up at the golden light above their heads. Even if the battle in the sky ended with a victory for mortals, it was meaningless since the mortal would soon be wiped out by the remaining forces of the joint army of the three realms.","Facing such horrifying power, no one could save themselves. At least the mortals couldn’t.","Xuanzhong Saint Master and the King of Gods’ Palace, Bright Light Godly King, heaved a sigh of relief. Looking at Fang Qi in the array, they chuckled and said, “Finally, we’ll triumph! You trap us in the array so we can’t do huge damage to the mortal world with a wave of our hands, but it also makes it impossible for you to help them!”","Fang Qi looked down and shook his head. “Do you believe me if I say that they no longer need anyone’s help?","“Every one of them is a challenger player.”","...","Before them was the devastated battleground and the destructive energy that devoured everything like a tsunami.","Human strength was so tiny. Of the entire Golden Griffin Knight Legion, only Commander Elven remained standing on the battleground.","No one knew what he would face, but he knew that he must do something.","For the people who they guarded and the world that they loved.","There were kind and peace-loving elves, fierce and strong orcs, and even the mysterious friends from the ancient east.","He still remembered their boat trip on Red Leaf Lake, their raids in World of Warcraft, and their sufferings in Dark Soul.","He was thankful that the world gave birth to so many loveable beings.","Perhaps the Heavenly Dao would change, but the land that they lived on was still their home with countless people and memories that they couldn’t forget.","“Paladin, do you dare to sacrifice yourself?!” The ancient words for paladins resonated in his mind.","“Of course!” He turned the blade of his huge sword and pierced his own chest!","Blessing of Sacrifice!","When everyone fell, Blessing of Sacrifice helped one person stand on the battleground.","She waved her staff lightly, and her body turned vague and merged with holy light. Then, the pure holy light spread out like angel’s wings!","Figures got up from the ground one after another. At this moment, they themselves were miracles!","“Haya!” With power that she didn’t know she possessed, Jiang Xiaoyue dispelled all the demons with one sword slash! The horrifying power cut all enemies into half, including all the soldiers of the joint army of gods and demons that surrounded them and the people of the East Continent and the West Continent!","“Head-Nailing Seven Arrow Book!” With his long white hair messily fluttering in the wind, Gu Tingyun emitted intense murderous spirit!","At this moment, they had discarded any considerations of life and death! They had no time for it!","With the seven-star bright lamp at his feet, he shot out two arrows!","“Pu!” The God of Radiant Light Judgement spewed out a mouthful of blood. Meanwhile, the huge body of the Shadow Evil God was engulfed by death presence!","“The second arrow!” Gu Tingyun’s ancient face almost withered instantly.","“Holy Shield!” On the other side, holy light lit up like rekindled flames!","At this moment, the gods and demons all over the sky felt a bone-deep chill.","With their actions, the mortals seemed to be telling these ultimate existences that they would rather die than be defeated!","At this moment, they were horrified to see that a flash of sword light swept toward them!","Blood dyed the entire Immortal-Slaying Sword Array red!","At this moment, the remaining people of the joint army of the three realms felt cold inside. With shock, horror, and fear on their faces, they finally realized that they were finished!"]},{"number":943,"title":"Chapter 943 - Huh?! Where Are My Potato Chips!? (The End – 1/2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 943: Huh?! Where Are My Potato Chips!? (The End – 1/2)","Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“It’s over...” At the other end of the golden bridge on the top of the sky, Yin and Yang merged and returned to chaos. People seemed to see an ancient but familiar starry sky and land that crashed down like a huge mountain!","In the chaos, someone roared hoarsely, “He fell... even Master fell!”","“Demon Master... Demon Master has also been suppressed!”","“Run! Quickly run!”","Not only the few remaining immortal masters but the saint masters such as Xuanzhong Saint Master were scared witless.","Then, the loftiest Godly Court beyond the endless void and above the gods collapsed.","The tens of thousands of immortals built a major array that stunned all ages.","Like a millstone of Heaven and Earth, the array destroyed these figures that had survived countless tribulations.","At this moment, they were facing the most horrifying killing tribulation that they had ever seen!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Countless gods and demons exploded into pieces and were devoured by the red light in the array. Then, they turned silent!","The gold bridge spanning the Heaven and Earth suddenly turned into a shower of gold dust while a golden flood swept across the entire sky!","The remaining spiritual energy of those once lofty existences turned into golden spiritual rain and fell on the land.","Winds brought the spiritual shower across the whole world. The Deserted Sea Realm that had scarce spiritual essence gradually turned lively again, and the storms in the huge and desolate sea area around Half City gradually calmed down.","Heavenly Abyss Sea was outside the most desolate Deserted Sea Realm in the Continent of Immortal Relic, and it was the only way leading to the Spiritual State where Yuanyang City was located. Golden spiritual rain fell in Heavenly Abyss Sea, and the strange natural phenomenon caused by the endless ancient space fissure was gradually replaced by tremendous vigor of life.","It was summer. In the remote wilderness of the Ultimate West Realm, the 10,000-year-old snow on the mountains melted, and new plants began to sprout at a visible speed. This place wasn’t located in the polar region but seemed to have been abandoned by the sun. At this moment, vivid life returned to this area!","In the Elf Forest, the shocking land crack began to slowly close as abundant golden spiritual essence entered the ground which was in desperate need of spiritual essence. Like a wondrous medicine, the spiritual essence healed the countless wounds that this world had been afflicted with ever since the ancient times.","Concealed in the small worlds which seemed to float around the continents, including spatial fragments, ancient deserts, and withered forests, countless creatures which had been on the verge of extinction walked out and entered the world.","Deadwood began to sprout, and deserts began to show refreshing greenery.","This fragile world seemed to gradually get stronger. Countless fragment-like small worlds began to gather in the center. One day, they might return to their original form.","From now on, the previous rulers disappeared. The three realms outside the mortal world would only regain order after a long time of chaos.","From now on, there were only the Heavenly Clan living in the sky and the Darkness Clan living in the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness which was connected with the depths of the ocean.","Meanwhile, humans had never given up on their explorations of the outside world. They explored the ‘sky beyond the sky’ that had been told in many legends and seemed to gradually obtain some progress.","Perhaps... there was a vaster starry sky beyond this Heaven and Earth!","A brand-new era had come!","At this moment in the Godly Court, a milky white light sphere slowly rose like a new-born sun. The laws of nature that had been split up and taken by gods now came from different directions and gathered in these ruins in the void.","A small noise sounded. After countless years, a new spirit seemed to have been born.","...","One year later –","The shop held another worldwide E-sports competition.","Xiao Yulv and Mu Donglai sat on the caster stand.","Below them were the audience stands that were filled with countless people.","Today’s competition had ended, and the casters and commenters began to chat with each other.","Mu Donglai said, “I guess everyone has heard that we’ll announce a bunch of great news after today’s competition.”","“The good news is that Gongzi Xiao Yulv, our long-time cloud player, will be removed from the blacklist after today’s competition!”","“Hahahahaha... hehehe...!” Sitting next to him, Xiao Yulv laughed hysterically.","Instantly, bullet comments flooded the screen.","[Congratulations to the long-time cloud player for being allowed to play games in the shop!]","[Awesome!]","[Are you going to livestream now?]","“Um...” Obviously, Mu Donglai saw this message. “In fact, I wanted to ask Gongzi Xiao about the first game that he’d like to play after being removed from the blacklist.”","“Of course, I’ll play Resident Evil, Diablo 2, the Legend of Sword and Fairy 1!” Xiao Yulv said while moving his hands..","“The shop has many games. Why did you choose these three old games?” Mu Donglai asked, “Can you tell us why? Did you choose them for the sentimental reason?”","“With all kinds of new games popping up, many new players might not understand my choices,” Xiao Yulv explained to Mu Donglai and the audience, “At that time, entertainment for us was going to the gambling house or listening to songs or stories. High-end entertainment was just hunting demon beasts. When the games such as the Legend of Sword and Fairy and Diablo came out... my goodness!”","“At that time, who would have expected that a monster would drop so many items after being killed? Some of which were even ultimate items! At that time, who would know that they could fly by riding on swords?! I had goosebumps all over my body by just watching them play the games,” Xiao Yulv said.","Now, the games are each better than the last, but it seems like we can’t find the feelings that we once had. At that time, we would chat about items’ attributes and properties and skill combinations in Diablo 2 for one night in excitement. We would forget to eat meals when we were in the middle of a warm discussion with friends about the plot of the Legend of Sword and Fairy 1...","“I was so eager to play when I watched them from behind...” Xiao Yulv said, “But I just couldn’t.”","“So, you will play these games to fulfill your old dreams?” Mu Donglai asked.","“You can say that.”","“Then, let’s hope our Gongzi Xiao gets to play the games as soon as possible!” Mu Donglai said, “This is the end of today’s livestream. Thank you for watching!”","“I’ll go and play games now!” Xiao Yulv waved at the camera. “See you all in my livestream room!”","The moment that he came to the entrance of the shop...","“Auch!”","A loli landed from the sky. Dressed in a beautiful snow-white silk royal dress and with a Pikachu school bag on her back, she stomped her boots and said curiously, “How come the shop owner made the ground outside the shop so soft? Did he do it to celebrate the beginning of my summer break?!","“Ya! Forget it! I must enter the shop now, or that strange big light sphere will catch up with me!” She ran into the shop.","“Who the heck did that?!” Xiao Yulv was about to get up from the ground.","“Auch!” He screamed as a milky white light sphere as tall as one man landed from the sky and flew into the shop.","Pu!","“He has broken ribs... hurry! Carry him to the Royal Medical House and give him the best medical care! He’s not allowed to leave for one month!” Faint voices came from outside the shop.","“Ah! Let me in! I can still play! Ahh!”","...","Meanwhile, inside the Jiuhua City Shop –","Jiang Xiaoyue put down her school bag cheerfully. “Boss! Get me one computer!”","“Xiaoyue?! What did you bring here?!” Nonplussed, Mr. Fang stuck out his head from the back of his seat, wondering how come a big light sphere was in the shop.","Does this thing come here to play online?!","“How do I know?!” Jiang Xiaoyue pouted and said in a huff, “This big light sphere has followed me since this morning. I don’t know where it came from, but it claims to be my little sister! How come my royal father didn’t tell me that I have another little sister! It must be an imposter!”","With a proud expression on her face as if she was saying that she wasn’t so gullible, Jiang Xiaoyue took out a big bag of potato chips from her little bag, which turned out to be a spatial storage bag!","She tore the bag open. “Au! Au! This seaweed flavor is so good!”","“Xiaoyue!” Mr. Fang took the bag of potato chips from her and said patiently, “I told you that it’s a high-calorie food. Look at you! You’ve gained weight and have a round face! I’ll keep this bag of potato chips for you!”","“Besides, it’s not right that your academy gives you so many breaks.” Mr. Fang took out a big pile of papers from his storage artifact. They were test preparation materials and worksheets for university entrance exams.","“You need extra classes this summer break. After all, a childhood without the experience of doing extra classes isn’t a perfect childhood.”","“Huh!?” After Mr. Fang put them on her desk, Jiang Xiaoyue looked at the pile of papers that towered over her and froze.","At this moment, Mr. Fang also looked puzzled. “It seems like that the Lord of Godly Court came from beyond the Heaven, and it wasn’t will of this world...”","“Then, where’s the will of this world...? How come I’ve never felt it?”","As Mr. Fang was engrossed in this thought, a pure-white little hand reached out from the light sphere and grabbed a handful of potato chips stealthily.","“This is indeed puzzling...” Mr. Fang gazed at the ceiling and continued to think.","The hand took another handful of potato chips.","“Forget it. I’ll give up thinking about it since I can’t figure it out.”","The hand took another handful of potato chips.","Mr. Fang snapped back to reality. “Seaweed-flavored potato chips are my favorite. I’ll eat some!”","He reached his hand into the bag and froze.","“Huh?! Where are my potato chips?!”","Lifting the empty bag, he looked around with widened eyes and blinked. “???”"]},{"number":944,"title":"Chapter 944 (END) - The Ten-Year-Long Internet Story in This World (The End – 2/2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 944: The Ten-Year-Long Internet Story in This World (The End – 2/2)","Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The great war had huge effects on the whole world. Although the golden spiritual rain healed most of the damaged places between the Heavens and Earth and removed all the injuries and diseases from the people who were bathed in it, some people still died. For example, the high holinesses who had come to help Origins Internet Club with their spiritual treasures at Shen Gongbao’s persuasion had been killed before the war by the preventive mechanisms left in the spiritual treasures by the immortal masters.","Due to the backlash of the Head-Nailing Seven Arrows Book, Gu Tingyun reincarnated and returned to Heavenly Academy to cultivate.","Of course, there were beneficiaries.","Even though the realms other than the mortal world received lower benefits, the Valkyrie who was lying in the pool found that her fingertips shook a little.","“I... I can move?!” Sure enough, her arms could move now. Her breath turned shallow as she murmured, “After I recover, I’ll...”","“Wait. It’s 8 PM now! I’ll see what TV Series the shop has tonight!” At this thought, she immediately cast a spell to show the big screen at the lounge area in the shop.","Immediately, she heard the song, “I still can’t part with you... let us stay together in the mortal world and live a dashing life...”","On the big screen were two big words— My Fair Princess!","[TL Note: My Fair Princess, also known as Return of the Pearl Princess or Princess Returning Pearl, is a 1998–1999 television costume drama. It had been rebroadcasted every summer for more than ten years, and everyone in China knows about it.]","“???”","“What TV Series is this?!” Immediately, she began watching it, engrossed as she lay in the pool.","...","As for the previous gods who had entered the Gods’ Investiture List, they were now busy working day and night in the most dangerous fissures in the world. Full of void tribulation thunderbolts, these places couldn’t be reached by the golden spiritual rain, and they worked tirelessly to heal these fissures and contribute to the recovery of the world.","Many years later when they finally purged their sins, they could finally return to the Gods’ Investiture Platform and shoulder the responsibility of protecting this world.","...","By now, Mr. Fang’s internet café and its games and movies had spread all over the world. Its arcade games and mobile games were popular even in other realms.","Time passed.","Some of the old players worked in the shops. For example, Shen Qingqing became the head of the internet café’s culture and promotion department. Xu Zixin established an association to study gun-fighting techniques and was responsible for part of the security work outside the shop. Dong Qingli, the owner of Wind and Moon Pavilion, had made her business into a chain of stores and offered delicacies in every corner of the world under Mr. Fang’s recommendations.","Some had grown out of their youthful confusion, realized their dreams, and built their careers. Take Song Qingfeng and his two good friends Lin Shao and Xu Luo as examples. Song Qingfeng had joined the expedition into the ruins beyond the sky and explored the secrets of the whole world. Lin Shao had returned to Lingyun Academy, and this former disciple became an instructor. Xu Luo was engaged in the study of the ancient ruins on the continent and had built his own archeology team to research and uncover the long-forgotten ancient history of this continent.","Some people such as Nalan Hongwu had put down the heavy burdens and began to truly enjoy the remaining years of their lives.","Some had become entertainment or technical streamers and brought excellent game guides and happiness to people all over the world.","Even the independent warriors such as Liang Shi and Fatty Wang Tai had their own properties, established families, and lived busy lives.","Of course, Nalan Mingxue must be mentioned. She was now controlling one of the biggest industries in the world – the mobile games industry.","It had become more and more difficult and almost impossible for them to gather together and do over-night raids or discuss game guides for a whole day as in the old days.","Another year-end drew near. Mr. Fang sat on a couch next to the window and lit a cigarette.","The customers thronged in the shop as usual.","“Have you tried the new game, Chicken Dinner? A few young people who were about 13 years walked into the shop. They wore the clothes of the nearby big families with badges of Lingyun Academy pinned on their chests.”","[TL Note: It is the nickname for PUBG in China.]","“League of Legends released limited edition skins. It’s said one of them is Dragon Fist Lee Sin!” In the shop, a young man who was about 16 years said.","“I’m going to buy Jade Dragon Wukong!” another young man said.","“I heard that Instructor Wu of Shengjing Academy is going to take people to the Luke Raid in Dungeon Fighter Online for free today!” A few figures walked in. “Hurry up! There’ll be no spots for us if we’re late!”","...","At this moment, light snow fell from the sky. Mr. Fang looked up. The smirk face emoji in the shop would still come out draped in a quilt, but the active players in the shop were no longer the same ones.","They were in their youth, and somehow, Mr. Fang saw his younger self in them.","After finishing one cigarette, Mr. Fang gazed at the bustling crowd in the shop, feeling a bit lonesome. Suddenly, it struck him that he had come to this world for more than ten years.","Looking at the young people coming and going, he sometimes missed his youthful self who used to play in the internet café.","At this moment, Su Tianji got off her livestream. Then, she put down the virtual reality headset, bought two mugs of Cappuccino, and walked over from the counter.","Dressed in warrior’s clothes, Lin Shao walked in with ice and snow all over his head. While brushing off snow from his clothes, he chuckled and said, “A student sneaked out to hunt demon beasts and got in danger. It took me some time to find him.”","He looked around. “I hope I’m not late.”","“No, you’re not.” Mr. Fang said with a smile, “You’re the second.”","“Hehe! You guys are early!” An Huwei opened the door and looked toward the lounge area. Then, he glanced around and froze before saying, “Brother Liang, how have you been?”","Liang Shi also walked into the shop. “Well! I’m quite busy since the year-end is here.”","People like Nalan Hongwu, Royal Princess Ji Yu, Xu Zixin, Shen Qingqing, and Half City’s Mo Tianxing and Ning Bi arrived one by one.","They filed in, putting away their umbrellas and bamboo cloaks. Then, they bought a cup of their favorite beverage and sat on the couches in the lounge area, just like they had done in the old days.","“Now, you are all busy.” With a smile, Mr. Fang extinguished the cigarette butt and said, “I booked a private compartment in the Wind and Moon Pavilion. It’s a rare occasion for you to return here, and tomorrow is New Year’s Eve, so let’s have a New Year’s Eve dinner tonight in advance!”","“Hahaha! Okay!”","“The shop is as busy as usual...”","“It’s busier!”","“Sir, where’s Xiaoyue?” Su Tianji asked.","“I sent her to Wind and Moon Pavilion to order the dishes.”","“Huh? Is everyone here? It seems like we are missing a few.” An Huwei looked around. “Where’s that kid Song Qingfeng?”","“It’s said that he set off yesterday and should be here today.”","When they pushed open the door and looked out of the shop, they saw a young man who was close to 30 years old coming over from the end of the street. Dressed in a military uniform, his previous handsome face had some signs of weather and age with a scar beside one of his eyes. With an experienced and decisive presence, he greeted them with a military salute.","“Young Master... Song!?”","“Hahahaha! Dude! I almost can’t recognize you!”","“Let’s go! We bros have to have a few cups together!”","“No going back unless we all get drunk!”","Mr. Fang laughed, “Today, we’ll all get drunk!”","“Oh-!”","“Hahahahaha!”","They disappeared at the end of the street.","...","When spring came, Mr. Fang entrusted the management of the internet club to the staff and walked to the distance with a simple bag on his shoulders.","Perhaps he would tour this beautiful world as he had promised himself. Perhaps he wanted to find a way to return to his homeworld... who knows?","A figure caught up with him.","In the dusk, breezes brushed her calm face and fluttered her pure-white dress hem. With snowflakes falling on her shoulders, she felt the lightness of setting down a heavy burden. The mild and elegant voice said, “I plan to tour around the world as well. Can I join you?”","“Okay.”"]}]);
